(1611545, 217921, 34247, '<td valign="top">the pose is interesting to say the least. compositionally, the curving line of the fencing is a distraction for me. the chest, arm and stomach hair add a touch of realism. Nice human touch. 7 for the smile, and this would have gone higher without as cluttered a background.</td>', 'the pose is interesting to say the least. compositionally, the curving line of the fencing is a distraction for me. the chest, arm and stomach hair add a touch of realism. Nice human touch. 7 for the smile, and this would have gone higher without as cluttered a background.', '2005-08-15 05:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611546, 215961, 35274, '<td valign="top">heh, <br/>you know, I had planned to do something almost exactly like this, escept with lots of eye liner...<br/>Either way, very beautiful! I love how you framed her and the isolated rain drops. Her shoulder area is blown out tho, but I really don''t think it detracts much from the image. Would have been interesting to see the original colors, only desaturated to mute the tones, or maybe with a slight bluish tint to emphasize the rain factor. Anyway, I hope you do well!</td>', 'heh, you know, I had planned to do something almost exactly like this, escept with lots of eye liner...Either way, very beautiful! I love how you framed her and the isolated rain drops. Her shoulder area is blown out tho, but I really don''t think it detracts much from the image. Would have been interesting to see the original colors, only desaturated to mute the tones, or maybe with a slight bluish tint to emphasize the rain factor. Anyway, I hope you do well!', '2005-08-15 05:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
