(1611682, 217910, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear, I think the hand should be a little less inside the frame, it distracts a little.  I was wondering if the girl should have looked straight into the lens, but I think it''s much better like this, it suits the title better or vice versa.  I first guessed that this is Heiða''s work, but after a while I''m began to think the work in this photo is inspired by Heiða and most likely this is Nazgul''s work, but I could be wrong.  This will end up high, most likely in top 10.</td>', 'Nice and clear, I think the hand should be a little less inside the frame, it distracts a little.  I was wondering if the girl should have looked straight into the lens, but I think it''s much better like this, it suits the title better or vice versa.  I first guessed that this is Heiða''s work, but after a while I''m began to think the work in this photo is inspired by Heiða and most likely this is Nazgul''s work, but I could be wrong.  This will end up high, most likely in top 10.', '2005-08-15 08:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
