(1611722, 216023, 35602, '<td valign="top">Liked the concept really well.  There is quite a bit of grain, though, in the image, especially in the background.  Some cameras have a setting that reduces noise in the image.  Also, if you have a TIF setting on your camera, as I do, I find that using it for these challenges create too large a file to compress down to the requirements of the challenge.</td>', 'Liked the concept really well.  There is quite a bit of grain, though, in the image, especially in the background.  Some cameras have a setting that reduces noise in the image.  Also, if you have a TIF setting on your camera, as I do, I find that using it for these challenges create too large a file to compress down to the requirements of the challenge.', '2005-08-15 08:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611724, 217898, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very compelling and attractive image.  Perhaps a little too overprocessed.  The childs colors are off.  Maybe the focus wasn''t really sharp when you took the picture, and you tried to compensate in editing.  Still, given composition and attractiveness, it is a very nice photo.</td>', 'Very compelling and attractive image.  Perhaps a little too overprocessed.  The childs colors are off.  Maybe the focus wasn''t really sharp when you took the picture, and you tried to compensate in editing.  Still, given composition and attractiveness, it is a very nice photo.', '2005-08-15 08:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611725, 217533, 21816, '<td valign="top">That''s really nice! The pink really stands out! Well done.</td>', 'That''s really nice! The pink really stands out! Well done.', '2005-08-15 08:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611726, 218054, 35602, '<td valign="top">Could have been less shallow depth of field.  For this image, I think having it all sharply focused would have improved it.  But that is only my opinion so don''t take it to heart.  Can''t please everybody, as I have more than discovered in these challenges.</td>', 'Could have been less shallow depth of field.  For this image, I think having it all sharply focused would have improved it.  But that is only my opinion so don''t take it to heart.  Can''t please everybody, as I have more than discovered in these challenges.', '2005-08-15 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611731, 217539, 35602, '<td valign="top">REally clear image.  Detail of water is really awesome on the face as well as falling on the face.  Don''t like too much the stubble on the face.  Too bad it wasn''t all grown in.  That would have topped this photo from a 9 to a 10</td>', 'REally clear image.  Detail of water is really awesome on the face as well as falling on the face.  Don''t like too much the stubble on the face.  Too bad it wasn''t all grown in.  That would have topped this photo from a 9 to a 10', '2005-08-15 08:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611732, 217970, 18191, '<td valign="top">Absoultely astounding. Great shot --- the subtly use of colors rocks!</td>', 'Absoultely astounding. Great shot --- the subtly use of colors rocks!', '2005-08-15 08:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611733, 217948, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice monochromatic composition.</td>', 'Nice monochromatic composition.', '2005-08-15 08:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611738, 216724, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and the urban feel. The reflection on the pavers is great.  The shape of the umbrella is a perfect compliment to the rectangles of the pavement. Great silhouette.</td>', 'Love the angle and the urban feel. The reflection on the pavers is great.  The shape of the umbrella is a perfect compliment to the rectangles of the pavement. Great silhouette.', '2005-08-15 09:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611742, 216561, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the group of ducks all clustered together amidst the beautiful blue water. Their white color is a great contrast.  The circles caused by the drops make for interesting shape vairations. The rocks in the lower left help to ground the photo.</td>', 'I love the group of ducks all clustered together amidst the beautiful blue water. Their white color is a great contrast.  The circles caused by the drops make for interesting shape vairations. The rocks in the lower left help to ground the photo.', '2005-08-15 09:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
