(1611790, 218041, 39850, '<td valign="top">''7'' - Really like the potential of this shot, and whilst I can''t see any ''rain'' (re the Challenge), there''s obvious ''residue'' on the web - why it is only on one side intrigues me a little.  Criticism; given the color (almost a golden) of the spider and the pinkish ''something'' in the background, I would really like to have seen the angle changed to get the spider ''over'' that pink, perhaps even in the ''purple centre''.  A touch more clarity focus on all the drops, and this would have been a superb, and unique shot, in my opinion.  It still stands out, even just for the coloring, in my opinion.  edit:typos<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-22 06:33:05.</i></td>', '''7'' - Really like the potential of this shot, and whilst I can''t see any ''rain'' (re the Challenge), there''s obvious ''residue'' on the web - why it is only on one side intrigues me a little.  Criticism; given the color (almost a golden) of the spider and the pinkish ''something'' in the background, I would really like to have seen the angle changed to get the spider ''over'' that pink, perhaps even in the ''purple centre''.  A touch more clarity focus on all the drops, and this would have been a superb, and unique shot, in my opinion.  It still stands out, even just for the coloring, in my opinion.  edit:typos', '2005-08-15 09:30:06.000000', '2005-08-22 07:33:05.000000', 1),
(1611791, 217159, 92, '<td valign="top">I like the soft color you chose. Nice reflection photo :)</td>', 'I like the soft color you chose. Nice reflection photo :)', '2005-08-15 09:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611792, 217113, 38925, '<td valign="top">this is amazing, no comments, because it is perfect</td>', 'this is amazing, no comments, because it is perfect', '2005-08-15 09:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611793, 216363, 92, '<td valign="top">I''m so jealous. I''ve wanted to learn to to take storm photos for a long time. The color is perfect with the black. AWESOME photo ! 10</td>', 'I''m so jealous. I''ve wanted to learn to to take storm photos for a long time. The color is perfect with the black. AWESOME photo ! 10', '2005-08-15 09:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611794, 217840, 38925, '<td valign="top">nice colors, i really like it</td>', 'nice colors, i really like it', '2005-08-15 09:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611796, 217927, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing effect, its really amazing</td>', 'amazing effect, its really amazing', '2005-08-15 09:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611800, 217894, 39664, '<td valign="top">I love the soft focus and mellow colors of this capture.  Tis MUY BUENO!</td>', 'I love the soft focus and mellow colors of this capture.  Tis MUY BUENO!', '2005-08-15 09:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611802, 217948, 39850, '<td valign="top">''8'' - Very nice shot, color is superb.  Criticism; even though I have said the color is superb, I would like to see it even more ''azure'' - somehow.  One way might just to have been (if possible) to get the full 640 x 640 here.  I know you may well have preferred this ''framing'', but just my opinion, I would like to see it really ''full'', especially as it would allow more of those ''droplets'' to ''play'' and draw the eye to them.  Not sure if it is a pool or what, or even natural rain, but looks erratic enough to convince me it is.</td>', '''8'' - Very nice shot, color is superb.  Criticism; even though I have said the color is superb, I would like to see it even more ''azure'' - somehow.  One way might just to have been (if possible) to get the full 640 x 640 here.  I know you may well have preferred this ''framing'', but just my opinion, I would like to see it really ''full'', especially as it would allow more of those ''droplets'' to ''play'' and draw the eye to them.  Not sure if it is a pool or what, or even natural rain, but looks erratic enough to convince me it is.', '2005-08-15 09:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611804, 217379, 39664, '<td valign="top">Wow!  The rainbow is so beautiful and clear!  Nice capture!</td>', 'Wow!  The rainbow is so beautiful and clear!  Nice capture!', '2005-08-15 09:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611807, 216085, 39664, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2005-08-15 09:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
