(1611813, 217938, 39664, '<td valign="top">Very nice cature and very emotive feel.  The title works well to tell others what you are after.  I really like it!</td>', 'Very nice cature and very emotive feel.  The title works well to tell others what you are after.  I really like it!', '2005-08-15 09:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
