(1611870, 218058, 39850, '<td valign="top">''7'' (just pretend) - I like this capture of the rain (or what looks like rain) for the Challenge.  Criticism; for me, there is too much ''fore/top'' foliage.  I would like to see almost a thin ''veiling'' of it or none.  A zoom ''through the branches'' out to the rain, may have made this a better shot in my opinion.  I like the colors and the water capture but just think it has more potential than you have captured - in my opinion.</td>', '''7'' (just pretend) - I like this capture of the rain (or what looks like rain) for the Challenge.  Criticism; for me, there is too much ''fore/top'' foliage.  I would like to see almost a thin ''veiling'' of it or none.  A zoom ''through the branches'' out to the rain, may have made this a better shot in my opinion.  I like the colors and the water capture but just think it has more potential than you have captured - in my opinion.', '2005-08-15 10:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
