(1611938, 217047, 39850, '<td valign="top">''7'' - Very nice ''soft rain'' shot for the Challenge.  Really like the look of that lily.  Criticism; considering the Challenge, I would like to have seen a ''larger'' photo if possible, showing more ''drops''.  The color is nice and I don''t know if you softened a little, but even though I said I like the lily, with the rain the main ''focal point'' (for me in my opinion re the Challenge) I would like to see more definition, so possibly a sharpening, or just to contradict myself, a ''blurring/softening'' could have worked too.  Just also trying to get more ''symmetry/composition'' with the placement of the pads within the frame would have made this a better shot in my opinion.</td>', '''7'' - Very nice ''soft rain'' shot for the Challenge.  Really like the look of that lily.  Criticism; considering the Challenge, I would like to have seen a ''larger'' photo if possible, showing more ''drops''.  The color is nice and I don''t know if you softened a little, but even though I said I like the lily, with the rain the main ''focal point'' (for me in my opinion re the Challenge) I would like to see more definition, so possibly a sharpening, or just to contradict myself, a ''blurring/softening'' could have worked too.  Just also trying to get more ''symmetry/composition'' with the placement of the pads within the frame would have made this a better shot in my opinion.', '2005-08-15 10:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611940, 218102, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like the grit and light in this image...very electric...the blur of the person is great...yet the hand is still, very nice.</td>', 'I really like the grit and light in this image...very electric...the blur of the person is great...yet the hand is still, very nice.', '2005-08-15 10:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611942, 215552, 31403, '<td valign="top">I love it, what''s best is you''re getting an 8 without one drop of water visible!  :-)  Great work</td>', 'I love it, what''s best is you''re getting an 8 without one drop of water visible!  :-)  Great work', '2005-08-15 10:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611947, 217215, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like this... but I bet you''re gonna get slammed with "no rain" no gain comments...I love that little teeny cloud up in the right hand corner...such a lonely little guy...nice image.</td>', 'I really like this... but I bet you''re gonna get slammed with "no rain" no gain comments...I love that little teeny cloud up in the right hand corner...such a lonely little guy...nice image.', '2005-08-15 10:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
