(1611961, 217855, 39850, '<td valign="top">''8'' - Great rain shot for the Challenge.  Criticism; whilst I do like the colors, I wonder if it would have packed more punch in b/w, especially seeing as you have so much definition in the water and splashes.  Not sure about the black frame.  Actually on a closer look, perhaps you have desaturated somewhat, can''t discern ''green''.  Good shot though.  Maybe, just for added ''touch'' and character, if the girl in blue had a blue umbrella might have created a really unique shot.</td>', '''8'' - Great rain shot for the Challenge.  Criticism; whilst I do like the colors, I wonder if it would have packed more punch in b/w, especially seeing as you have so much definition in the water and splashes.  Not sure about the black frame.  Actually on a closer look, perhaps you have desaturated somewhat, can''t discern ''green''.  Good shot though.  Maybe, just for added ''touch'' and character, if the girl in blue had a blue umbrella might have created a really unique shot.', '2005-08-15 10:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611962, 217971, 19095, '<td valign="top">Everything about it is great - maybe too much in the middle but still love it!</td>', 'Everything about it is great - maybe too much in the middle but still love it!', '2005-08-15 10:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
