(1611976, 216736, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way the rain creates a kind of filter to the scene. The way that the roof fades into the rain makes it seem as though the building is almost hunching down in the wet weather.</td>', 'I like the way the rain creates a kind of filter to the scene. The way that the roof fades into the rain makes it seem as though the building is almost hunching down in the wet weather.', '2005-08-15 11:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
