(1611980, 215961, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like your crop and use of negative space. The high contrast black and white also works well. Also like the lines created by the rain drops falling during the exposure. Nice job!</td>', 'I like your crop and use of negative space. The high contrast black and white also works well. Also like the lines created by the rain drops falling during the exposure. Nice job!', '2005-08-15 11:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
