(1611989, 216363, 8522, '<td valign="top">Call me anal if you like, but spelling is all part of the package. Great depiction of rain.</td>', 'Call me anal if you like, but spelling is all part of the package. Great depiction of rain.', '2005-08-15 11:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611991, 217159, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of reflection and interesting cropping. I think I quite like the lack of head - creates an abstract and anonymous feel. Selective desat works too.</td>', 'Great use of reflection and interesting cropping. I think I quite like the lack of head - creates an abstract and anonymous feel. Selective desat works too.', '2005-08-15 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611992, 217588, 18219, '<td valign="top">cool capture.<br/>I don''t know if it would have worked, but I think it would have looked better if the raindrops had been in focus instead of the trees?</td>', 'cool capture.I don''t know if it would have worked, but I think it would have looked better if the raindrops had been in focus instead of the trees?', '2005-08-15 11:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1612003, 217717, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a lovely portrait. One of the few images of woodies that has a really palpatable sense of emotion. Wonderful, wonderful lighting, the lines of the light and rain are so clear. Great background. Lovely texture of the wet surface bricks/ tiles. Nice composition. All good!</td>', 'Wow, what a lovely portrait. One of the few images of woodies that has a really palpatable sense of emotion. Wonderful, wonderful lighting, the lines of the light and rain are so clear. Great background. Lovely texture of the wet surface bricks/ tiles. Nice composition. All good!', '2005-08-15 11:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1612005, 216793, 18219, '<td valign="top">very nice.<br/>but i am a big fan of b/w.<br/>nice thirds.</td>', 'very nice.but i am a big fan of b/w.nice thirds.', '2005-08-15 11:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1612007, 217786, 3087, '<td valign="top">Is that the moon at the top right or a serendipitous refraction of light? I''m guessing moon but I like that it could be either. Great nightscape colours. Simple composition but lots of detail. Has a real atmosphere to it.</td>', 'Is that the moon at the top right or a serendipitous refraction of light? I''m guessing moon but I like that it could be either. Great nightscape colours. Simple composition but lots of detail. Has a real atmosphere to it.', '2005-08-15 11:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1612016, 217968, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame the rain is so light in this shot... I had to look at the splashes in the river to see evidence of rain. PP definitely takes this in the direction of digital art, and I''m not 100% sure I like it, but I think it could grow on me. The effect is certainly striking. If the sky wasn''t quite so burnt out, I think this would be a very strong shot. I think it''s oversharpened too much for my eyes here which detracts from the effect.</td>', 'Shame the rain is so light in this shot... I had to look at the splashes in the river to see evidence of rain. PP definitely takes this in the direction of digital art, and I''m not 100% sure I like it, but I think it could grow on me. The effect is certainly striking. If the sky wasn''t quite so burnt out, I think this would be a very strong shot. I think it''s oversharpened too much for my eyes here which detracts from the effect.', '2005-08-15 11:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1612018, 217910, 18219, '<td valign="top">It may be raining in the background, but it certainly isn''t visible.<br/>I have a feeling this fact may hurt your score.<br/>A nice image though, nice and clear and crisp with some good colors.</td>', 'It may be raining in the background, but it certainly isn''t visible.I have a feeling this fact may hurt your score.A nice image though, nice and clear and crisp with some good colors.', '2005-08-15 11:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1612019, 216453, 8522, '<td valign="top">WAY too oversaturated, and the gray background doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'WAY too oversaturated, and the gray background doesn''t work for me.', '2005-08-15 11:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1612020, 216838, 18219, '<td valign="top">A "cute" picture, but I can''t see any rain.<br/>I have a feeling a lot of people are going to be saying that to you.<br/>Also the post processing seems to be very harshly done.</td>', 'A "cute" picture, but I can''t see any rain.I have a feeling a lot of people are going to be saying that to you.Also the post processing seems to be very harshly done.', '2005-08-15 11:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
