(1612038, 216000, 35804, '<td valign="top">I like this...the composition and contrast  are really nice...the softness/Neat Image/or whatever is a bit bizarre though, a little over the top...this would have been just as pleasing without it IMO.</td>', 'I like this...the composition and contrast  are really nice...the softness/Neat Image/or whatever is a bit bizarre though, a little over the top...this would have been just as pleasing without it IMO.', '2005-08-15 11:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
