(1612041, 218038, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, but the distortion on the faces spoils it. Extreme care needs to be taken at focal lengths below 20mm. The flash is a bit too strong. Also, the umbrella covers the eyes of the girl which is a no-no in my book. Still a great shot though which is quirky and engaging.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, but the distortion on the faces spoils it. Extreme care needs to be taken at focal lengths below 20mm. The flash is a bit too strong. Also, the umbrella covers the eyes of the girl which is a no-no in my book. Still a great shot though which is quirky and engaging.', '2005-08-15 11:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1612042, 216023, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, the noise works well. A fraction overexposed though.</td>', 'Lovely shot, the noise works well. A fraction overexposed though.', '2005-08-15 11:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
