(1612061, 217450, 29474, '<td valign="top">I think that this would be better if it was cropped to the edges of the white fence. Otherwise it is a wonderful picture with great colour and sense of feeling contrasts.</td>', 'I think that this would be better if it was cropped to the edges of the white fence. Otherwise it is a wonderful picture with great colour and sense of feeling contrasts.', '2005-08-15 11:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
