(1612125, 215995, 26189, '<td valign="top">I''m not too fond of the colors here. It''s a nice shot, though.  I''ve only found two so far that has used a gutter....so good idea.</td>', 'I''m not too fond of the colors here. It''s a nice shot, though.  I''ve only found two so far that has used a gutter....so good idea.', '2005-08-15 12:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
