(1612130, 215363, 26189, '<td valign="top">It looks a little blurry to me.  I can''t really tell what the bottom right corner is a picture of.  The left side of the picture is nice...with the water hitting the window sill.</td>', 'It looks a little blurry to me.  I can''t really tell what the bottom right corner is a picture of.  The left side of the picture is nice...with the water hitting the window sill.', '2005-08-15 12:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
