(1612149, 217894, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a great photo.     I love the muted colors, and the rain coming off the roof.   This is one of the best!    Good Luck!  10</td>', 'What a great photo.     I love the muted colors, and the rain coming off the roof.   This is one of the best!    Good Luck!  10', '2005-08-15 12:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
