(1612241, 217890, 34247, '<td valign="top">a bit bland and cluttered. the blown sky in particular isn''t working for me. the cars in the distance are also distracting. focus seems a bit soft. 4</td>', 'a bit bland and cluttered. the blown sky in particular isn''t working for me. the cars in the distance are also distracting. focus seems a bit soft. 4', '2005-08-15 13:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
