(1612743, 217310, 30605, '<td valign="top">ITaht I really like even thought the rain connection is not that obvious. The color of the ground/sand dune is very nice. There is a bit of blue sky and what appears to be sun lighted clouds on the left side that would have been better burned out to enhance the "storm approching" mood. Excellent. 8</td>', 'ITaht I really like even thought the rain connection is not that obvious. The color of the ground/sand dune is very nice. There is a bit of blue sky and what appears to be sun lighted clouds on the left side that would have been better burned out to enhance the "storm approching" mood. Excellent. 8', '2005-08-15 16:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
