(1612750, 217921, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice to see he''s gittin'' er dun despite the rain.  i''m not gonna lie, this creeps me out a little.  a little tighter crop could increase the impact.  don''t be scared to crop off a part of his butt and even some of his hat.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'nice to see he''s gittin'' er dun despite the rain.  i''m not gonna lie, this creeps me out a little.  a little tighter crop could increase the impact.  don''t be scared to crop off a part of his butt and even some of his hat.Pedro', '2005-08-15 16:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
