(1612774, 217534, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very nice open road shot. Very attractive perspective. Sky look very interesting. I suspect some burning was applyed on those clouds; it may be my monitor, but the clouds on the left side are definately too dark, almost to the point of detail lost. 8</td>', 'Very nice open road shot. Very attractive perspective. Sky look very interesting. I suspect some burning was applyed on those clouds; it may be my monitor, but the clouds on the left side are definately too dark, almost to the point of detail lost. 8', '2005-08-15 17:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
