(1613321, 216010, 17837, '<td valign="top">I think there is too much sky here for its own good. The color is muted, which doesnt work here. The lighting is very flat, which also doesnt work. I get the feeling you shot from inside your car just so you can have the out of focus and distracting waterdrops.</td>', 'I think there is too much sky here for its own good. The color is muted, which doesnt work here. The lighting is very flat, which also doesnt work. I get the feeling you shot from inside your car just so you can have the out of focus and distracting waterdrops.', '2005-08-15 20:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613323, 216382, 17837, '<td valign="top">A very cool shot, but did it really rain or did you just spray the plants lol.  I would have cropped the top a bit, I believe it to be unneccessary here.</td>', 'A very cool shot, but did it really rain or did you just spray the plants lol.  I would have cropped the top a bit, I believe it to be unneccessary here.', '2005-08-15 20:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613349, 217703, 17837, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me think you did this indoors for several reasons...<br/> <br/>1. The entire photo as a whole is warm, which leads me to believe you shot using a Tungsten lamp and didnt set the correct white balance.<br/> <br/>2. The many drops seem to resemble that of mixing water with glycerine so that the drops stay in place.<br/> <br/>Based on these observations, I can''t score it highly as it doesnt meet the challenge (in my view)</td>', 'This photo makes me think you did this indoors for several reasons... 1. The entire photo as a whole is warm, which leads me to believe you shot using a Tungsten lamp and didnt set the correct white balance. 2. The many drops seem to resemble that of mixing water with glycerine so that the drops stay in place. Based on these observations, I can''t score it highly as it doesnt meet the challenge (in my view)', '2005-08-15 20:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
