(1614268, 217855, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the action.  The framing really works for me.  Very creative.</td>', 'I like the action.  The framing really works for me.  Very creative.', '2005-08-16 10:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614269, 216104, 34906, '<td valign="top">A lot of interest to look at here.  Excellent capture.  It would have been even without the lightning, which may even be a distraction here.</td>', 'A lot of interest to look at here.  Excellent capture.  It would have been even without the lightning, which may even be a distraction here.', '2005-08-16 10:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614272, 217817, 35357, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  Unfortunately for this challenge, the only thing remotely related to rain is the umbrella and light cloud cover.  I love the subject matter though, great job, good luck!</td>', 'What a great shot!  Unfortunately for this challenge, the only thing remotely related to rain is the umbrella and light cloud cover.  I love the subject matter though, great job, good luck!', '2005-08-16 10:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614273, 217140, 34906, '<td valign="top">To my eye this is perfectly composed.  Really like it.</td>', 'To my eye this is perfectly composed.  Really like it.', '2005-08-16 10:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614274, 216085, 35357, '<td valign="top">Fun shot, nice.</td>', 'Fun shot, nice.', '2005-08-16 10:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614275, 216839, 34906, '<td valign="top">Great title, excellent capture.</td>', 'Great title, excellent capture.', '2005-08-16 10:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614278, 217982, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like natural framing on the left &amp; open-ness on the right.  The geese &amp; rock sculptures lend good interest, nice shot.  The slightly tilted horizon (lake) is a little distracting.</td>', 'I like natural framing on the left & open-ness on the right.  The geese & rock sculptures lend good interest, nice shot.  The slightly tilted horizon (lake) is a little distracting.', '2005-08-16 10:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614280, 216431, 34906, '<td valign="top">I love the color and composition.  The model is a bit too posed for my taste.</td>', 'I love the color and composition.  The model is a bit too posed for my taste.', '2005-08-16 10:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614282, 217857, 34906, '<td valign="top">I find this pleasing to look at.</td>', 'I find this pleasing to look at.', '2005-08-16 10:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614283, 217875, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract feel.  Not a whole lot of specific interest, but general interst is good for me.  I like the odd cyan hue too.</td>', 'I like the abstract feel.  Not a whole lot of specific interest, but general interst is good for me.  I like the odd cyan hue too.', '2005-08-16 10:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614286, 217759, 34906, '<td valign="top">Really excellent concept and composition.  Color needs correcting.</td>', 'Really excellent concept and composition.  Color needs correcting.', '2005-08-16 10:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614287, 217580, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the great focus in the puddle and natural framing.  Centred composition works for me.</td>', 'I like the great focus in the puddle and natural framing.  Centred composition works for me.', '2005-08-16 10:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614288, 217970, 35357, '<td valign="top">Just plain funky!</td>', 'Just plain funky!', '2005-08-16 10:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614289, 217846, 34906, '<td valign="top">The wiinner for me, so far.  What a moody, evocative shot.  I love it.</td>', 'The wiinner for me, so far.  What a moody, evocative shot.  I love it.', '2005-08-16 10:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614292, 216865, 34906, '<td valign="top">Great title.</td>', 'Great title.', '2005-08-16 10:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614293, 216389, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the very wet feel to this shot.  In retrospect, I think if the shot could have been taken near to the water level the effect of the splashing rain might be really interesting.  Good work!</td>', 'I like the very wet feel to this shot.  In retrospect, I think if the shot could have been taken near to the water level the effect of the splashing rain might be really interesting.  Good work!', '2005-08-16 10:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614294, 217892, 34906, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I would have liked to have seen a bit more space on top.</td>', 'I like it.  I would have liked to have seen a bit more space on top.', '2005-08-16 10:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614296, 217838, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the low angle, it lends a little interest to an otherwise uninteresting scene.</td>', 'I like the low angle, it lends a little interest to an otherwise uninteresting scene.', '2005-08-16 10:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614298, 215552, 34906, '<td valign="top">The angles and awkward posing really add interest here.  Color treatment is good.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'The angles and awkward posing really add interest here.  Color treatment is good.  I like this a lot.', '2005-08-16 10:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614301, 217808, 34906, '<td valign="top">The faded foliage in the background is beautiful.  I would have liked to see more brightness in the foreground.</td>', 'The faded foliage in the background is beautiful.  I would have liked to see more brightness in the foreground.', '2005-08-16 10:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614302, 217440, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the action, and the way this shot reminds me of how much I enjoy zooming through deep puddles.  Pedestrians beware!  The only way I can think of improving this shot would be to wait for a more interesting vehicle to make a splash, probably not possible, though.</td>', 'I like the action, and the way this shot reminds me of how much I enjoy zooming through deep puddles.  Pedestrians beware!  The only way I can think of improving this shot would be to wait for a more interesting vehicle to make a splash, probably not possible, though.', '2005-08-16 10:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614304, 217878, 35357, '<td valign="top">Not much interest in this shot.</td>', 'Not much interest in this shot.', '2005-08-16 10:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614305, 217773, 34906, '<td valign="top">Really great concept and it captures the mood.  I would have liked to see the top part of this cropped.  The light at the top left takes attention away from the main event, which is the table arrangement.</td>', 'Really great concept and it captures the mood.  I would have liked to see the top part of this cropped.  The light at the top left takes attention away from the main event, which is the table arrangement.', '2005-08-16 10:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614307, 217779, 34906, '<td valign="top">Good, moody composition.  I like how claustrophobic his face is between the umbrella and the top of the gate.</td>', 'Good, moody composition.  I like how claustrophobic his face is between the umbrella and the top of the gate.', '2005-08-16 10:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614308, 217865, 35357, '<td valign="top">NIce negative space, perhaps too much umbrella, though.  I like the bit of action of the water running off.</td>', 'NIce negative space, perhaps too much umbrella, though.  I like the bit of action of the water running off.', '2005-08-16 10:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614309, 217703, 35357, '<td valign="top">Fantastic flower shot, but just looks like another wet flower to me.</td>', 'Fantastic flower shot, but just looks like another wet flower to me.', '2005-08-16 10:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
