(1614380, 216010, 35357, '<td valign="top">The only thing that makes this shot feel rainy to me are the droplets in the foreground, which I don''t care for.  Great scenery, though.</td>', 'The only thing that makes this shot feel rainy to me are the droplets in the foreground, which I don''t care for.  Great scenery, though.', '2005-08-16 10:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
