(1614406, 216479, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really nice image! you might try cropping off the bottom and top to the immediate window sashes. I fear this won''t do well because it doesn''t scream "rain," but I love it. 8</td>', 'Really nice image! you might try cropping off the bottom and top to the immediate window sashes. I fear this won''t do well because it doesn''t scream "rain," but I love it. 8', '2005-08-16 11:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
