(1614408, 218103, 32338, '<td valign="top">I can''t say why... but I like it.  Maybe because it is like secretly visiting someone''s quiet, off-the-beaten path neighborhood (experiencing what I wouldn''t normally get to experience).  I wonder if different cropping or a slightly different angle would make it even more.</td>', 'I can''t say why... but I like it.  Maybe because it is like secretly visiting someone''s quiet, off-the-beaten path neighborhood (experiencing what I wouldn''t normally get to experience).  I wonder if different cropping or a slightly different angle would make it even more.', '2005-08-16 11:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614409, 217155, 32338, '<td valign="top">KABANG!!!</td>', 'KABANG!!!', '2005-08-16 11:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614411, 217489, 32338, '<td valign="top">Unique</td>', 'Unique', '2005-08-16 11:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
