(1614593, 216363, 22612, '<td valign="top">As I was going through all of the other photos I thought I would like to see a good lighning shot and then yours came along.  Very good shot- I personally would have cropped more- but I really like it.</td>', 'As I was going through all of the other photos I thought I would like to see a good lighning shot and then yours came along.  Very good shot- I personally would have cropped more- but I really like it.', '2005-08-16 12:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614624, 216363, 9111, '<td valign="top">awesome!   the rain curtain plus the lightening are wonderful!</td>', 'awesome!   the rain curtain plus the lightening are wonderful!', '2005-08-16 13:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614630, 216910, 9111, '<td valign="top">i would have liked to see anything in focus on this photo.  The rain drops on the window give a nice glitter and had the potential to make a very nice photo</td>', 'i would have liked to see anything in focus on this photo.  The rain drops on the window give a nice glitter and had the potential to make a very nice photo', '2005-08-16 13:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614655, 217534, 39339, '<td valign="top">just wonderful!  such a dramatic shot!</td>', 'just wonderful!  such a dramatic shot!', '2005-08-16 13:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614699, 217113, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and sharp. Focus is perfect. 7</td>', 'Very crisp and sharp. Focus is perfect. 7', '2005-08-16 13:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614701, 217927, 34192, '<td valign="top">The image is nice but the title is REALLY unneccesary.  It''s irrelevent and "Delivery Boy" would have been just fine.  Anyway,  I like the image.  I would have cropped just a little off the top as that much white space is a little over-powering.  Looks like colored pencil filter was used.  Whether it was or not, the feel/texture really enhances the image.  I like the repetition of red here as well as the soft focus - it works with the image. 8 - good luck in the challenge! Update:  In looking over the rest of the entries, I came to realize this was one of the more creative shots and so I feel compelled to bump you up to 9.</td>', 'The image is nice but the title is REALLY unneccesary.  It''s irrelevent and "Delivery Boy" would have been just fine.  Anyway,  I like the image.  I would have cropped just a little off the top as that much white space is a little over-powering.  Looks like colored pencil filter was used.  Whether it was or not, the feel/texture really enhances the image.  I like the repetition of red here as well as the soft focus - it works with the image. 8 - good luck in the challenge! Update:  In looking over the rest of the entries, I came to realize this was one of the more creative shots and so I feel compelled to bump you up to 9.', '2005-08-16 13:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614716, 217739, 30605, '<td valign="top">Cool title from one of my favorite artist. Brothers is Arms is  the best Dire Straits album.<br/>On to your photo: That is very nice. I like the shallow depth of field. It''s very cool the effect you have captured; everything is more or less out of focus except the what is seen through the water drop. Bravo 10.</td>', 'Cool title from one of my favorite artist. Brothers is Arms is  the best Dire Straits album.On to your photo: That is very nice. I like the shallow depth of field. It''s very cool the effect you have captured; everything is more or less out of focus except the what is seen through the water drop. Bravo 10.', '2005-08-16 13:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614732, 216909, 37444, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, though I would have preferred to see the swan''s reflection.</td>', 'Beautiful image, though I would have preferred to see the swan''s reflection.', '2005-08-16 13:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614736, 218041, 37444, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, composition...but I keep wondering what the heck that white spot is LOL</td>', 'Very nice capture, composition...but I keep wondering what the heck that white spot is LOL', '2005-08-16 13:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614738, 217965, 37444, '<td valign="top">I wonder how you did this as I was under the impression that raindrops are eliptical.</td>', 'I wonder how you did this as I was under the impression that raindrops are eliptical.', '2005-08-16 13:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614740, 217497, 37444, '<td valign="top">Looks like many streets in Wichita after we get our 4 to 8 inches of rain :)</td>', 'Looks like many streets in Wichita after we get our 4 to 8 inches of rain :)', '2005-08-16 13:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614742, 217595, 34247, '<td valign="top">I feel this image has potential, but as it is, it''s a bit on the bland side. The skies could be made more moody, angry, etc and the rainbow could be emphasized somehow. Perhaps there''s a bit too much lightness on the foreground as well. 5</td>', 'I feel this image has potential, but as it is, it''s a bit on the bland side. The skies could be made more moody, angry, etc and the rainbow could be emphasized somehow. Perhaps there''s a bit too much lightness on the foreground as well. 5', '2005-08-16 13:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614744, 217047, 37444, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very soothing, super image.</td>', 'Very nice, very soothing, super image.', '2005-08-16 13:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614747, 217855, 4177, '<td valign="top">Nigh on to perfect timing on this one. Good shot!</td>', 'Nigh on to perfect timing on this one. Good shot!', '2005-08-16 13:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
