(1614753, 216479, 4177, '<td valign="top">Quite the shot. I think the attempt to associate this with rain is a real stretch, but I''m not going to worry about that little detail. 7</td>', 'Quite the shot. I think the attempt to associate this with rain is a real stretch, but I''m not going to worry about that little detail. 7', '2005-08-16 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
