(1614801, 216023, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Focus is well placed with good shaprness on the flower and the water drop. Lighting is not bad, but on my monitor, the whites of the flower is nearly blown out to the point that is very difficult to pick up individual petals, especially on the upper left portion of the flower. Still very nice. 7</td>', 'Nice composition. Focus is well placed with good shaprness on the flower and the water drop. Lighting is not bad, but on my monitor, the whites of the flower is nearly blown out to the point that is very difficult to pick up individual petals, especially on the upper left portion of the flower. Still very nice. 7', '2005-08-16 14:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614810, 217278, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice sort of muddy color tone in this picture. Gives the feeling that the rain is far from over.</td>', 'Nice sort of muddy color tone in this picture. Gives the feeling that the rain is far from over.', '2005-08-16 14:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614818, 216793, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice capture with falling rain drop. Very dramatic. I am not a fan of b&amp;w, but it works here. 7</td>', 'Nice capture with falling rain drop. Very dramatic. I am not a fan of b&w, but it works here. 7', '2005-08-16 14:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614819, 217892, 32262, '<td valign="top">I love this!!</td>', 'I love this!!', '2005-08-16 14:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614828, 217921, 30605, '<td valign="top">Technically, this photo is ok and the subject really look like he his enjoying himself. But I don''t find this photo very esthetic. 5</td>', 'Technically, this photo is ok and the subject really look like he his enjoying himself. But I don''t find this photo very esthetic. 5', '2005-08-16 14:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614833, 217601, 34759, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s rain.. but I think you probably could have gotten a better shot. It kind of just looks like a wet street. Plus it''s a bit small and blurry. But nice try!</td>', 'Well, it''s rain.. but I think you probably could have gotten a better shot. It kind of just looks like a wet street. Plus it''s a bit small and blurry. But nice try!', '2005-08-16 14:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
