(1614838, 218038, 34759, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cluttered composition. There''s way too much going on here and I don''t really  know what the focal point''s supposed to be.</td>', 'This is a pretty cluttered composition. There''s way too much going on here and I don''t really  know what the focal point''s supposed to be.', '2005-08-16 14:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
