(1615203, 218043, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, toning and subject matter. Hard vignetting works well, but it is strange that only three corners are covered by this. 8</td>', 'Great perspective, toning and subject matter. Hard vignetting works well, but it is strange that only three corners are covered by this. 8', '2005-08-16 18:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615206, 216736, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is hard to tell if the rain is water falling from the sky or just noise. I like the mood, composition and the toning of this photo. It looks old, it could have been entered in the timecapsule challenge with 1880 as a title.<br/>The fog around the roof tells something about the conditions.<br/>7</td>', 'It is hard to tell if the rain is water falling from the sky or just noise. I like the mood, composition and the toning of this photo. It looks old, it could have been entered in the timecapsule challenge with 1880 as a title.The fog around the roof tells something about the conditions.7', '2005-08-16 18:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
