(1615234, 217194, 3032, '<td valign="top">Strongest part of the photo is how the light falls on the book, perfect. Even a little river in the middle of it. 7</td>', 'Strongest part of the photo is how the light falls on the book, perfect. Even a little river in the middle of it. 7', '2005-08-16 18:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
