(1615239, 217982, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the balance between the geese and the stone structures in the background.  The large empty sky kinda detracts from the picture, though.  5</td>', 'I like the balance between the geese and the stone structures in the background.  The large empty sky kinda detracts from the picture, though.  5', '2005-08-16 18:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615240, 217534, 3032, '<td valign="top">By the time you''re there it''s all over. :)<br/>Good subject matter, technically good. The brightness on top is a bit distracting, it draws the eye out of the rainstorm. I would like to see a tighter crop tat focusses more on the road and the dark clouds. 7</td>', 'By the time you''re there it''s all over. :)Good subject matter, technically good. The brightness on top is a bit distracting, it draws the eye out of the rainstorm. I would like to see a tighter crop tat focusses more on the road and the dark clouds. 7', '2005-08-16 18:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615242, 215903, 3032, '<td valign="top">Lovely how the light plays tricks on the fields and on the falling rain.</td>', 'Lovely how the light plays tricks on the fields and on the falling rain.', '2005-08-16 18:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615244, 217761, 811, '<td valign="top">The bw really adds to the feeling of desolation here.  The whites on the right seem to be a touch blown out, and the perspective of the building kinda makes it feel tilted and slightly off-balance.  I like the capture and the mood of the picture though.</td>', 'The bw really adds to the feeling of desolation here.  The whites on the right seem to be a touch blown out, and the perspective of the building kinda makes it feel tilted and slightly off-balance.  I like the capture and the mood of the picture though.', '2005-08-16 18:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
