(1615278, 217898, 811, '<td valign="top">Siimply precious.  I like the bold red of the water suit and the intense look at the splash.  Betcha she (I''m assuming she because of the pink shoes) was loving this.<br/> <br/>There''s something strange about the focus though.  The kid is very sharp, but the sidewalk and fence are out just enough to mess with your eyes, but not out enough to be truly "blurry."  Maybe just me.</td>', 'Siimply precious.  I like the bold red of the water suit and the intense look at the splash.  Betcha she (I''m assuming she because of the pink shoes) was loving this. There''s something strange about the focus though.  The kid is very sharp, but the sidewalk and fence are out just enough to mess with your eyes, but not out enough to be truly "blurry."  Maybe just me.', '2005-08-16 18:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
