(1615366, 215995, 25140, '<td valign="top">I really like the color treatment you''ve given this.</td>', 'I really like the color treatment you''ve given this.', '2005-08-16 19:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615368, 217904, 25140, '<td valign="top">A perfect title.  I loved the painted feeling in this photograph.</td>', 'A perfect title.  I loved the painted feeling in this photograph.', '2005-08-16 19:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615371, 216492, 25140, '<td valign="top">Ahh, Millenium Park, my kids love this place.  You can tell that the children in your photograph love it too.  Very nice work capturing their joy.</td>', 'Ahh, Millenium Park, my kids love this place.  You can tell that the children in your photograph love it too.  Very nice work capturing their joy.', '2005-08-16 19:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615374, 217609, 25140, '<td valign="top">I like the green color palette and its complemented by your simple border.</td>', 'I like the green color palette and its complemented by your simple border.', '2005-08-16 19:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615379, 217910, 25140, '<td valign="top">I''m immediately drawn to those pretty eyes because you''ve taken this from just the right angle.  One of the best things about rain is playing it, you''ve met this challenge well.</td>', 'I''m immediately drawn to those pretty eyes because you''ve taken this from just the right angle.  One of the best things about rain is playing it, you''ve met this challenge well.', '2005-08-16 19:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615381, 217820, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and a great idea, but unfortunately their expression doesn''t match the title (not that that has any bearing on the quality of the picture, just a thought).<br/> <br/>The picture is in focus, but not "sharp" per se.  It almost looks like it was underexposed and brightened in post-processing giving it a grainy look.</td>', 'Good composition, and a great idea, but unfortunately their expression doesn''t match the title (not that that has any bearing on the quality of the picture, just a thought). The picture is in focus, but not "sharp" per se.  It almost looks like it was underexposed and brightened in post-processing giving it a grainy look.', '2005-08-16 19:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615382, 217828, 25140, '<td valign="top">There are some really interesting elements in this photo - the blur of the rain, the texture of the fruit and the drops - nice.</td>', 'There are some really interesting elements in this photo - the blur of the rain, the texture of the fruit and the drops - nice.', '2005-08-16 19:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615385, 217828, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the rich greeness of this, and great capture of the water drop.  The focus seems just a tad off, giving it a grainy look.</td>', 'I like the rich greeness of this, and great capture of the water drop.  The focus seems just a tad off, giving it a grainy look.', '2005-08-16 19:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
