(1615780, 217113, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - looks like a chandlelier crystal!!!  This is stunning.  Talk about capture. WOW</td>', 'WOW - looks like a chandlelier crystal!!!  This is stunning.  Talk about capture. WOW', '2005-08-16 22:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615784, 218089, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great night shot.  Where''s the rain?   I love the golden tones and her movement. Nice leading line as well.  Just so you know - I gave this an 8.</td>', 'Great night shot.  Where''s the rain?   I love the golden tones and her movement. Nice leading line as well.  Just so you know - I gave this an 8.', '2005-08-16 22:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615787, 217310, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple yet powerful.  The red meeting the blue gray clouded sky is just stunning.  What is the red?? 8</td>', 'Simple yet powerful.  The red meeting the blue gray clouded sky is just stunning.  What is the red?? 8', '2005-08-16 22:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615788, 217898, 15711, '<td valign="top">Such a cute happy time.  The fence is a tad distracting but I love the red slicker and the blue shovel.  You could maybe eliminate some of the fence and it would still be as effective.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Such a cute happy time.  The fence is a tad distracting but I love the red slicker and the blue shovel.  You could maybe eliminate some of the fence and it would still be as effective.  Nicely done.', '2005-08-16 22:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615789, 217539, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love this. I''d like to see more of the background on at least one side of his face, though. Great coloration and detail. Despite my earlier comments, I''m still giving it an 8.</td>', 'Love this. I''d like to see more of the background on at least one side of his face, though. Great coloration and detail. Despite my earlier comments, I''m still giving it an 8.', '2005-08-16 22:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615791, 217878, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the slippery roads, but it lacks a little pizzaz. It seems a tad flat, probably from the grayness of the sky. But with rain, that''s what you get. The clarity and movement make up for it.</td>', 'I like the slippery roads, but it lacks a little pizzaz. It seems a tad flat, probably from the grayness of the sky. But with rain, that''s what you get. The clarity and movement make up for it.', '2005-08-16 22:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615793, 217646, 15711, '<td valign="top">What fun.  The red orange of the rain suit is a perfect contrast to the subject.</td>', 'What fun.  The red orange of the rain suit is a perfect contrast to the subject.', '2005-08-16 22:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615794, 215523, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE THE TITLE. Great stop action. I wish the rose were a touch more focused. Despite my earlier comment, still an 8.  Very good.</td>', 'LOVE THE TITLE. Great stop action. I wish the rose were a touch more focused. Despite my earlier comment, still an 8.  Very good.', '2005-08-16 22:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615796, 217644, 15711, '<td valign="top">Whee. I hope there was a kid in that car, enjoying the splash.  Great movement shot.</td>', 'Whee. I hope there was a kid in that car, enjoying the splash.  Great movement shot.', '2005-08-16 22:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615799, 217580, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s a reflection??? WOW!!!! Never seen one so clear.  Good job. 8</td>', 'That''s a reflection??? WOW!!!! Never seen one so clear.  Good job. 8', '2005-08-16 22:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615800, 217820, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d like to crop out some of the people in the background and concentrate on the couple.  You''d still see the glimmer of the water on the walkway.  Nice urban shot.</td>', 'I''d like to crop out some of the people in the background and concentrate on the couple.  You''d still see the glimmer of the water on the walkway.  Nice urban shot.', '2005-08-16 22:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615805, 216045, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple. Love the composition and negative space of the concrete area.</td>', 'Simple. Love the composition and negative space of the concrete area.', '2005-08-16 22:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615819, 217433, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has lots of punch.  The single saturation of red is good but maybe a smidge overdone.  The water droplets are so crystal clear.  Perfect focus. Nicely composed.</td>', 'This has lots of punch.  The single saturation of red is good but maybe a smidge overdone.  The water droplets are so crystal clear.  Perfect focus. Nicely composed.', '2005-08-16 22:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615823, 216054, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish the house wasn''t in the background, but with an urban setting, it''s hard to change the scenery. I love the car and the blurred lights and splash it''s making.</td>', 'I wish the house wasn''t in the background, but with an urban setting, it''s hard to change the scenery. I love the car and the blurred lights and splash it''s making.', '2005-08-16 22:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615838, 216766, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid entry. The rainbow is the gift in this shot!!<br/></td>', 'Nice vivid entry. The rainbow is the gift in this shot!!', '2005-08-16 23:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615840, 216908, 37961, '<td valign="top">Pretty unique idea for this challenge really. I like it.</td>', 'Pretty unique idea for this challenge really. I like it.', '2005-08-16 23:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615848, 217902, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice urban setting.  I like the color that the blue jeans and the cones add.</td>', 'Nice urban setting.  I like the color that the blue jeans and the cones add.', '2005-08-16 23:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615862, 217609, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has an icy feel to it. I love the different green tones and the coolness of the water droplets. That touch of purple on the edge isa  very nice touch Good closeup..</td>', 'This has an icy feel to it. I love the different green tones and the coolness of the water droplets. That touch of purple on the edge isa  very nice touch Good closeup..', '2005-08-16 23:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615872, 216354, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I''m upping this to an 8. I like the glistening droplets on the umbrella amidst the warm autumnal tones of the gackground.  Nice use of framing as well.</td>', 'Very nice. I''m upping this to an 8. I like the glistening droplets on the umbrella amidst the warm autumnal tones of the gackground.  Nice use of framing as well.', '2005-08-16 23:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615878, 217440, 15711, '<td valign="top">If this car were a bright color, this would be perfect. I love the reflection of the lights.</td>', 'If this car were a bright color, this would be perfect. I love the reflection of the lights.', '2005-08-16 23:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615886, 217866, 15711, '<td valign="top">For some reason, the figures are distracting to me in this shot. I love the powerful feel of the sky grounded by the dark rugget rocks and the guys just look like little mini men.  Maybe if they were grouped together and not spread out - I''d like them being in the shot. 7</td>', 'For some reason, the figures are distracting to me in this shot. I love the powerful feel of the sky grounded by the dark rugget rocks and the guys just look like little mini men.  Maybe if they were grouped together and not spread out - I''d like them being in the shot. 7', '2005-08-16 23:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615896, 217904, 15711, '<td valign="top">The yellow lights are the perfect contrast to the rainy green tones.  Very nice. The lights'' reflection is a quick leading line as well.</td>', 'The yellow lights are the perfect contrast to the rainy green tones.  Very nice. The lights'' reflection is a quick leading line as well.', '2005-08-16 23:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615900, 217497, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love that the truck is red.  It really POPS out of the green water.  This is nicely done.</td>', 'I love that the truck is red.  It really POPS out of the green water.  This is nicely done.', '2005-08-16 23:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615905, 217971, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty tone on tone.  Not particularly unusual, but for a macro/close up, this is very appealing. I like the frontal leaves crawling out of the dull background to a clear front view.  7</td>', 'Pretty tone on tone.  Not particularly unusual, but for a macro/close up, this is very appealing. I like the frontal leaves crawling out of the dull background to a clear front view.  7', '2005-08-16 23:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615910, 217963, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting take. I like the flair on the ford sign.  It''s slightly off centered perspective is nice.</td>', 'Interesting take. I like the flair on the ford sign.  It''s slightly off centered perspective is nice.', '2005-08-16 23:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615914, 217870, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of the shot.  The three lights add a nice touch. 7</td>', 'I like the angle of the shot.  The three lights add a nice touch. 7', '2005-08-16 23:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615919, 217817, 15711, '<td valign="top">Kind of busy with all of the riggings, but I like the idea of this shot. Maybe zoom in on the couple with the gray sky above. 7</td>', 'Kind of busy with all of the riggings, but I like the idea of this shot. Maybe zoom in on the couple with the gray sky above. 7', '2005-08-16 23:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615925, 217973, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely and sensual. 7</td>', 'Lovely and sensual. 7', '2005-08-16 23:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615928, 216104, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most impressive silvery b/w. 8</td>', 'A most impressive silvery b/w. 8', '2005-08-16 23:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615929, 216085, 15711, '<td valign="top">He''s havin'' some fun!!! Love the green and red boots. In a perfect world, there would be no houses in the background, but that''d be asking for too much.  Maybe blur it out a bit more.</td>', 'He''s havin'' some fun!!! Love the green and red boots. In a perfect world, there would be no houses in the background, but that''d be asking for too much.  Maybe blur it out a bit more.', '2005-08-16 23:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615930, 217745, 22734, '<td valign="top">Wow! So clear and crisp.  7</td>', 'Wow! So clear and crisp.  7', '2005-08-16 23:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615931, 217485, 15711, '<td valign="top">The intensity of the yellow is good contrast to the charcoal tones of the shot. Very urban.</td>', 'The intensity of the yellow is good contrast to the charcoal tones of the shot. Very urban.', '2005-08-16 23:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615934, 217333, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  I love the purple and turquoise.   Not overly interesting, but the hues are lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  I love the purple and turquoise.   Not overly interesting, but the hues are lovely.', '2005-08-16 23:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615938, 217211, 15711, '<td valign="top">Spider webs are so beautiful with the rain droplets.  The blue sparkling background is nice.</td>', 'Spider webs are so beautiful with the rain droplets.  The blue sparkling background is nice.', '2005-08-16 23:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615940, 216918, 22734, '<td valign="top">An outstanding study. 8</td>', 'An outstanding study. 8', '2005-08-16 23:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615944, 217595, 15711, '<td valign="top">On second view, I just spotted the rainbow!!!  I wish it were a bit more vivid, but that''s Mother Nature for ya. I like the texture of the sand after the rain.</td>', 'On second view, I just spotted the rainbow!!!  I wish it were a bit more vivid, but that''s Mother Nature for ya. I like the texture of the sand after the rain.', '2005-08-16 23:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615946, 216271, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great. 8</td>', 'Great. 8', '2005-08-16 23:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615953, 217927, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. 7</td>', 'Nicely done. 7', '2005-08-16 23:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615954, 217781, 15711, '<td valign="top">The beautiful  sky and single tree with the bridge is a nice touch. I wish there were some reflection from a wet road - that would have added a bit more pizzaz to the shot for me.</td>', 'The beautiful  sky and single tree with the bridge is a nice touch. I wish there were some reflection from a wet road - that would have added a bit more pizzaz to the shot for me.', '2005-08-16 23:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615956, 216793, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice movement. I like your choice of black and white. Maybe up the brightness of the flowers for more contrast.</td>', 'Nice movement. I like your choice of black and white. Maybe up the brightness of the flowers for more contrast.', '2005-08-16 23:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615958, 217330, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. 7</td>', 'Nice effect. 7', '2005-08-16 23:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615959, 217761, 15711, '<td valign="top">Be sure and contact me after the challenge. LOL<br/> <br/>Great black and white shot. Nice movement of the rain. Good use of black and white.</td>', 'Be sure and contact me after the challenge. LOL Great black and white shot. Nice movement of the rain. Good use of black and white.', '2005-08-16 23:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615963, 217533, 15711, '<td valign="top">The vividness of the flower against the black background sprinkled with those glistening drops is VERY pretty.  Upon second review, I''m upping my score to an 8.</td>', 'The vividness of the flower against the black background sprinkled with those glistening drops is VERY pretty.  Upon second review, I''m upping my score to an 8.', '2005-08-16 23:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615964, 216952, 22734, '<td valign="top">Outstanding in every way. The reflection, the horses and that fence that leads away from the lovely foregound past the horses and into the sky. 10</td>', 'Outstanding in every way. The reflection, the horses and that fence that leads away from the lovely foregound past the horses and into the sky. 10', '2005-08-16 23:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615965, 217308, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good capture! 8</td>', 'A very good capture! 8', '2005-08-16 23:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1615971, 217810, 15711, '<td valign="top">The left edge of the leaf is a tad too blurred for my taste, but the clarity of the drops to the right of it is really nice.  I love a tone on tone macro of a leaf every time. 7</td>', 'The left edge of the leaf is a tad too blurred for my taste, but the clarity of the drops to the right of it is really nice.  I love a tone on tone macro of a leaf every time. 7', '2005-08-16 23:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
