(1616000, 218038, 15711, '<td valign="top">This just seems like a snapshot.  There is alot going on here, although I like the sentiment. I think just the boy on the left with the umbrella might''ve made a better subject by himself, but you''d have to change the title.</td>', 'This just seems like a snapshot.  There is alot going on here, although I like the sentiment. I think just the boy on the left with the umbrella might''ve made a better subject by himself, but you''d have to change the title.', '2005-08-16 23:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616009, 216050, 22734, '<td valign="top">Love it. 8</td>', 'Love it. 8', '2005-08-16 23:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616013, 217745, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. The intensity of the yellow and red with the dropping petals and leaves is a very nice piece of work.  Maybe not the most original, but great for what it is. I''d eliminate maybe the left flower so that you have POW with just one.</td>', 'Very pretty. The intensity of the yellow and red with the dropping petals and leaves is a very nice piece of work.  Maybe not the most original, but great for what it is. I''d eliminate maybe the left flower so that you have POW with just one.', '2005-08-16 23:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616015, 216479, 22734, '<td valign="top">Quite an image. 7</td>', 'Quite an image. 7', '2005-08-16 23:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616018, 217761, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great downpour. 8</td>', 'Great downpour. 8', '2005-08-16 23:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616051, 216023, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is a super idea.  I would have scored it higher if the background had not appeared noisy -- it may just be texture, but I felt it was distracting -- and if the whites had not been so blown out on the upper part of the flower.  I also think a stronger composition would have helped.  I wish I could make these remarks sound "softer" because I really think your idea was great and you were able to catch that drop with such clarity.  I see a lot of creativity and potential in the image and hope this will help encourage you to continue to pursue excellence.  Trust me, it will probably end up scoring higher than mine!! LOL!</td>', 'This is a super idea.  I would have scored it higher if the background had not appeared noisy -- it may just be texture, but I felt it was distracting -- and if the whites had not been so blown out on the upper part of the flower.  I also think a stronger composition would have helped.  I wish I could make these remarks sound "softer" because I really think your idea was great and you were able to catch that drop with such clarity.  I see a lot of creativity and potential in the image and hope this will help encourage you to continue to pursue excellence.  Trust me, it will probably end up scoring higher than mine!! LOL!', '2005-08-16 23:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616055, 217702, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the water droplets. but it seems a tad busy. I''d like to see just a single blossom or two. The white against the dark green is lovely.</td>', 'I love the water droplets. but it seems a tad busy. I''d like to see just a single blossom or two. The white against the dark green is lovely.', '2005-08-16 23:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616056, 216479, 24065, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful, creative image!!!  My only suggestion for improvement -- and, hey, what do I know? -- would be to crop it closer at the top and bottom so you just had the window fill the frame.  Excellent image!!</td>', 'What a beautiful, creative image!!!  My only suggestion for improvement -- and, hey, what do I know? -- would be to crop it closer at the top and bottom so you just had the window fill the frame.  Excellent image!!', '2005-08-16 23:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616057, 217890, 15711, '<td valign="top">This just seems like a snapshot.  Maybe if you cropped out most of the buildings and concentrated on the trees???</td>', 'This just seems like a snapshot.  Maybe if you cropped out most of the buildings and concentrated on the trees???', '2005-08-16 23:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616073, 215961, 15711, '<td valign="top">I thought I''d already commented on this.  I love the half face and the great use of contrast.  The dark of the eyes is great.  Very clear sparkle which I like.  Nice drips on the hair.  GOOD JOB.</td>', 'I thought I''d already commented on this.  I love the half face and the great use of contrast.  The dark of the eyes is great.  Very clear sparkle which I like.  Nice drips on the hair.  GOOD JOB.', '2005-08-17 00:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616077, 217878, 811, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus, and bolder colors could have really helped this to be a more effective photograph.  The road leads "into" the shot well enough, but it doesn''t go to anything particularly interesting.  I am assuming you were having to shoot without getting run over, but if you could have isolated one car or vehicle to "focus" on, the viewer would be more interested, I think.</td>', 'Sharper focus, and bolder colors could have really helped this to be a more effective photograph.  The road leads "into" the shot well enough, but it doesn''t go to anything particularly interesting.  I am assuming you were having to shoot without getting run over, but if you could have isolated one car or vehicle to "focus" on, the viewer would be more interested, I think.', '2005-08-17 00:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616090, 216023, 10686, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get a lot of neg comments about the grain, but, for me, that''s the little something that makes this shot really good.</td>', 'You''ll probably get a lot of neg comments about the grain, but, for me, that''s the little something that makes this shot really good.', '2005-08-17 00:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616092, 217308, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2005-08-17 00:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616096, 216054, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and well-framed.</td>', 'Excellent capture and well-framed.', '2005-08-17 00:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616101, 217110, 10686, '<td valign="top">nice abstraction effect with the window, but the subject is pretty dull</td>', 'nice abstraction effect with the window, but the subject is pretty dull', '2005-08-17 00:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616103, 217278, 10686, '<td valign="top">I love the subdued color, just says the right things</td>', 'I love the subdued color, just says the right things', '2005-08-17 00:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616105, 217866, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot is rather intimidating feeling.  The men, who are obviously not tiny little runts, are being dwarfed and overcome by nature.  Though not exactly "rain" (my opinion, obviously), definitely gives the idea that it has either just rained, or these guys are going to get wet in the very near future. <br/> <br/>Good exposure as well.</td>', 'This shot is rather intimidating feeling.  The men, who are obviously not tiny little runts, are being dwarfed and overcome by nature.  Though not exactly "rain" (my opinion, obviously), definitely gives the idea that it has either just rained, or these guys are going to get wet in the very near future.  Good exposure as well.', '2005-08-17 00:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616112, 216054, 10686, '<td valign="top">What can I say? Other than OK motion blur, this shot is pretty much just another snap.</td>', 'What can I say? Other than OK motion blur, this shot is pretty much just another snap.', '2005-08-17 00:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616117, 218077, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalist feel and the contrast of the yellow light and the blue cloudy sky.</td>', 'I like the minimalist feel and the contrast of the yellow light and the blue cloudy sky.', '2005-08-17 00:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616119, 216104, 22537, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this shot.  The tones, composition, mood and relevance to the challenge are a winner for me.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like everything about this shot.  The tones, composition, mood and relevance to the challenge are a winner for me.  Good luck!', '2005-08-17 00:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616121, 217355, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like the textures at play here, but I think the White vertical bar is too centered and the shot is not quite straight enough to be really static, but not at enough of an angle to by dynamic.</td>', 'I like the textures at play here, but I think the White vertical bar is too centered and the shot is not quite straight enough to be really static, but not at enough of an angle to by dynamic.', '2005-08-17 00:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
