(1616125, 216104, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the tonal range in this one.  Good blacks without seeming "dark" because your lighter areas are well done as well.    Congrats on the lightning capture -- hope you got out safely. :)  Very nice shot.</td>', 'I really like the tonal range in this one.  Good blacks without seeming "dark" because your lighter areas are well done as well.    Congrats on the lightning capture -- hope you got out safely. :)  Very nice shot.', '2005-08-17 00:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
