(1616136, 217927, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. The only suggestion I have is that you might consider playing with the framing and going to a horizontal crop, cropping as much of the white at the top as possible. I think that would make it a lot stronger.</td>', 'I like this a lot. The only suggestion I have is that you might consider playing with the framing and going to a horizontal crop, cropping as much of the white at the top as possible. I think that would make it a lot stronger.', '2005-08-17 00:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
