(1616140, 217113, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is very cool and a great capture if it is water.  I say that because it almost looks staged.  Forgive me if I''m wrong as it is an excellent shot regardless.  Goodluck!</td>', 'This is very cool and a great capture if it is water.  I say that because it almost looks staged.  Forgive me if I''m wrong as it is an excellent shot regardless.  Goodluck!', '2005-08-17 00:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616141, 217887, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I too tried a deck shot, but, alas, it just didn''t look like rain (probably because it wasn''t :) ).  <br/> <br/>I think if you had composed it so that the deck lines were running diagonally through the picture (more extremely than they are now), it would have been more interesting and dynamic.  Also, the colors are kinda flat, maybe a conversion to sepia or bw would help.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I too tried a deck shot, but, alas, it just didn''t look like rain (probably because it wasn''t :) ).   I think if you had composed it so that the deck lines were running diagonally through the picture (more extremely than they are now), it would have been more interesting and dynamic.  Also, the colors are kinda flat, maybe a conversion to sepia or bw would help.', '2005-08-17 00:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
