(1616154, 217159, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition!  You can almost feel the "joy" of splashing.  My only nitpick is that the knees look a little plastic-y and colorless.  There''s just enough color to keep it from being bw, but not enough to look like the healthy child that it seems to be.</td>', 'Great composition!  You can almost feel the "joy" of splashing.  My only nitpick is that the knees look a little plastic-y and colorless.  There''s just enough color to keep it from being bw, but not enough to look like the healthy child that it seems to be.', '2005-08-17 00:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616155, 216760, 10686, '<td valign="top">I can tell you have a great subject, but photographically, this is just another great shot doomed to being just a snap. The two biggest problems are that we can''t see his face, so we can''t share in his joy at splashing and he''s dead center in the frame with all this extra nothing around him.</td>', 'I can tell you have a great subject, but photographically, this is just another great shot doomed to being just a snap. The two biggest problems are that we can''t see his face, so we can''t share in his joy at splashing and he''s dead center in the frame with all this extra nothing around him.', '2005-08-17 00:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
