(1616574, 215631, 37893, '<td valign="top">This seems like an interesting illusion of rain. What''s in front of the lens? It can''t be rain because the water shows no splashes and the sun is reflecting much on the water''s surface :) Good try :)</td>', 'This seems like an interesting illusion of rain. What''s in front of the lens? It can''t be rain because the water shows no splashes and the sun is reflecting much on the water''s surface :) Good try :)', '2005-08-17 02:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616585, 217021, 37893, '<td valign="top">My gosh! Those are mighty big drops! Talk about raining buckets!</td>', 'My gosh! Those are mighty big drops! Talk about raining buckets!', '2005-08-17 02:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616648, 218073, 36999, '<td valign="top">Nice Light!</td>', 'Nice Light!', '2005-08-17 02:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616685, 215967, 36999, '<td valign="top">Nice "Palette"</td>', 'Nice "Palette"', '2005-08-17 02:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616702, 217224, 42511, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2005-08-17 02:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616982, 217927, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph.  Basic editing rules ... why?  Or more to the point, why say so?  Do you imagine that makes it more meritorious?  It''s a fine image, and doesn''t need to be boosted or rationalised to score well.  Terrific composition, well captured and effectively (if a little basically) processed.  8</td>', 'Nice photograph.  Basic editing rules ... why?  Or more to the point, why say so?  Do you imagine that makes it more meritorious?  It''s a fine image, and doesn''t need to be boosted or rationalised to score well.  Terrific composition, well captured and effectively (if a little basically) processed.  8', '2005-08-17 06:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616986, 217481, 23458, '<td valign="top">not much to say...... <br/> <br/>except ....<br/> <br/>WOW!</td>', 'not much to say......  except .... WOW!', '2005-08-17 06:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617000, 217376, 30364, '<td valign="top">Striking composition, nice combination of textures, effective capture of Rain.  7</td>', 'Striking composition, nice combination of textures, effective capture of Rain.  7', '2005-08-17 06:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617015, 217846, 30364, '<td valign="top">Really lovely composition.  Looks simple but it''s actually quite sophisticated and thoughtful.   Love the way the cows form a repeating echelon of miserable resignation as they suffer the rain.  The bit of visible track efficiently leads the viewer''s attention to the most advantageous start point for studying the herd.  Also love the ''rained-out'' background, which both frames the cows and reinforces the feeling of sodden misery.  9</td>', 'Really lovely composition.  Looks simple but it''s actually quite sophisticated and thoughtful.   Love the way the cows form a repeating echelon of miserable resignation as they suffer the rain.  The bit of visible track efficiently leads the viewer''s attention to the most advantageous start point for studying the herd.  Also love the ''rained-out'' background, which both frames the cows and reinforces the feeling of sodden misery.  9', '2005-08-17 06:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617021, 215241, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and evocative.  Lovely composition / crop.  Restrained processing ... it might have been tempting to overprocess that sky, to wring more ''drama'' out of the scene, but you resisted the temptation, and thereby retained its charm.  Bravo!  9</td>', 'Beautiful and evocative.  Lovely composition / crop.  Restrained processing ... it might have been tempting to overprocess that sky, to wring more ''drama'' out of the scene, but you resisted the temptation, and thereby retained its charm.  Bravo!  9', '2005-08-17 06:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617024, 217534, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love road shots, and this one is very nice indeed.  Glad you chose a straight &amp; unremarkable bit of road; it directs the attention to the key point of your image, and contributes to the feel of it, without getting in the way.  7</td>', 'Love road shots, and this one is very nice indeed.  Glad you chose a straight & unremarkable bit of road; it directs the attention to the key point of your image, and contributes to the feel of it, without getting in the way.  7', '2005-08-17 06:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617032, 217481, 30364, '<td valign="top">Really good candid portrait, and a very clever incorporation of ''Rain'' ... the look of uneasiness on his face speaks volumes about how the rain is going to affect him.  A well conceived &amp; executed image.  8</td>', 'Really good candid portrait, and a very clever incorporation of ''Rain'' ... the look of uneasiness on his face speaks volumes about how the rain is going to affect him.  A well conceived & executed image.  8', '2005-08-17 06:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617035, 217450, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The white fence creates a startling bit of foreground interest &amp; intrigue, without distracting the attention from the rainstorm.  Well composed and executed.  7</td>', 'Very nice.  The white fence creates a startling bit of foreground interest & intrigue, without distracting the attention from the rainstorm.  Well composed and executed.  7', '2005-08-17 06:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617039, 217970, 30364, '<td valign="top">A lovely, graphic image.  And a very good example of when it is absolutely right to free yourself from the tiresome rule of thirds ... the symmetry of this image is what makes it so powerful and original.  It''s a fascinating photograph, apparently simple but actually packed with interest.  And the rain is a legitimate contributor to the whole, not just a happy co-incidence.  Very fine work.  9</td>', 'A lovely, graphic image.  And a very good example of when it is absolutely right to free yourself from the tiresome rule of thirds ... the symmetry of this image is what makes it so powerful and original.  It''s a fascinating photograph, apparently simple but actually packed with interest.  And the rain is a legitimate contributor to the whole, not just a happy co-incidence.  Very fine work.  9', '2005-08-17 06:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617045, 216479, 30364, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  It''s so stark and unsettling, and both stirs and challenges the imagination of the viewer.  That''s my definition of worthy art.  The slight  ''reverse pincushion'' effect of the window frame doesn''t diminish it; I think it actually contributes.  I''m not even too bothered by the fact that you''ve had to use your title to try to bash it into fitting inside the challenge.  9</td>', 'I love this picture.  It''s so stark and unsettling, and both stirs and challenges the imagination of the viewer.  That''s my definition of worthy art.  The slight  ''reverse pincushion'' effect of the window frame doesn''t diminish it; I think it actually contributes.  I''m not even too bothered by the fact that you''ve had to use your title to try to bash it into fitting inside the challenge.  9', '2005-08-17 07:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617046, 215903, 30364, '<td valign="top">Highly evocative image.  It conveys the feel of distant rain so faithfully,  I can just about smell it!  7</td>', 'Highly evocative image.  It conveys the feel of distant rain so faithfully,  I can just about smell it!  7', '2005-08-17 07:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617052, 216724, 30364, '<td valign="top">Photograph is brilliant ... title sucks a bit (it seems confusing and doesn''t suit this gritty image).  The composition is terrific; I think you''ve used the tilted horizon very cleverly to wring a highly dramatic effect out of the road kerbs.  And the wet paving looks fabulous in contrast to the virtually silhouetted figure and his reflection/shadow.  Very classy work.  9</td>', 'Photograph is brilliant ... title sucks a bit (it seems confusing and doesn''t suit this gritty image).  The composition is terrific; I think you''ve used the tilted horizon very cleverly to wring a highly dramatic effect out of the road kerbs.  And the wet paving looks fabulous in contrast to the virtually silhouetted figure and his reflection/shadow.  Very classy work.  9', '2005-08-17 07:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617055, 217539, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely, tactile image.  The water looks seriously wet (not the case in many entries).  The expression on his face is fabulous; he''s just about wallowing in the rain!  8</td>', 'Lovely, tactile image.  The water looks seriously wet (not the case in many entries).  The expression on his face is fabulous; he''s just about wallowing in the rain!  8', '2005-08-17 07:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617059, 216766, 30364, '<td valign="top">A striking, stark image and a legitimate take on the challenge topic in my view.  It''s a scene that encourages the viewer into some actual thought about rain and its consequences, as opposed to yet another raindrop on a leaf.  Nice, effective composition.  7</td>', 'A striking, stark image and a legitimate take on the challenge topic in my view.  It''s a scene that encourages the viewer into some actual thought about rain and its consequences, as opposed to yet another raindrop on a leaf.  Nice, effective composition.  7', '2005-08-17 07:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617062, 217786, 30364, '<td valign="top">Effective variation on the ''droplet on a leaf'' genre.  This one exhibits some original thought ,as well as your obvious skill in composing, capturing and processing the image.  7<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-30 08:37:31.</i></td>', 'Effective variation on the ''droplet on a leaf'' genre.  This one exhibits some original thought ,as well as your obvious skill in composing, capturing and processing the image.  7', '2005-08-17 07:24:09.000000', '2010-10-30 09:37:31.000000', 1),
(1617065, 216705, 30364, '<td valign="top">The very best of the "Rain, rain, go away...'' images.  Lovely thoughtful young model, terrific rain-on-the-window effect.  Nice composition, photography and processing.  7</td>', 'The very best of the "Rain, rain, go away...'' images.  Lovely thoughtful young model, terrific rain-on-the-window effect.  Nice composition, photography and processing.  7', '2005-08-17 07:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617069, 217929, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the clouds and a very fine exposure deflect the spotlight away from what would probably be a rather pedestrian foreground.  Well done on directing the attention of the viewer so deftly.  7</td>', 'Great detail in the clouds and a very fine exposure deflect the spotlight away from what would probably be a rather pedestrian foreground.  Well done on directing the attention of the viewer so deftly.  7', '2005-08-17 07:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617078, 215995, 30364, '<td valign="top">Simple idea, executed with plenty of flair and skill.  You''ve used composition and exposure very well to make such an interesting image out of an everyday scene that most of us might have overlooked.  The water stream seems a little overprocessed, but it''s effective anyway.  7</td>', 'Simple idea, executed with plenty of flair and skill.  You''ve used composition and exposure very well to make such an interesting image out of an everyday scene that most of us might have overlooked.  The water stream seems a little overprocessed, but it''s effective anyway.  7', '2005-08-17 07:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617102, 217983, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very appealing portrait of a charming subject.  Your simple but effective composition makes the most of both the model and the theme.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Very appealing portrait of a charming subject.  Your simple but effective composition makes the most of both the model and the theme.  Well done.  7', '2005-08-17 07:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617110, 215701, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, effective rain, and an appealing little model.  Quite high contrast on the skin tones, but I like that too.  7</td>', 'Nice composition, effective rain, and an appealing little model.  Quite high contrast on the skin tones, but I like that too.  7', '2005-08-17 07:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617114, 216389, 30364, '<td valign="top">Monsoon?  It''s a terrific, documentary-style image.  Very powerful, even without eye contact with the subject.  7</td>', 'Monsoon?  It''s a terrific, documentary-style image.  Very powerful, even without eye contact with the subject.  7', '2005-08-17 07:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617278, 218043, 30364, '<td valign="top">An interesting and effective composition, also a little weird and quirky (which I like very much).  7</td>', 'An interesting and effective composition, also a little weird and quirky (which I like very much).  7', '2005-08-17 08:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617286, 217890, 18219, '<td valign="top">there''s not really anything of interest to the picture, nowhere for the eye to be drawn to.<br/>No wow factor.<br/>Sorry :-)<br/>but at least it''s in focus and meets the challenge!!!!</td>', 'there''s not really anything of interest to the picture, nowhere for the eye to be drawn to.No wow factor.Sorry :-)but at least it''s in focus and meets the challenge!!!!', '2005-08-17 08:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617290, 217821, 18219, '<td valign="top">good attempt :-)</td>', 'good attempt :-)', '2005-08-17 08:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617294, 216045, 18219, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a tighter crop on the umbrella?</td>', 'Perhaps a tighter crop on the umbrella?', '2005-08-17 08:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617299, 217894, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  It''s a deft composition; just enough of the building to show us what it is, but not so much that it loses its charm &amp; intimacy.  Really terrific rain; it''s bucketing down!  7</td>', 'Very nice image.  It''s a deft composition; just enough of the building to show us what it is, but not so much that it loses its charm & intimacy.  Really terrific rain; it''s bucketing down!  7', '2005-08-17 08:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617323, 217209, 30364, '<td valign="top">This took equal measures of vision and confidence.  It''s a superb minimalist image of a subject that most of us would entirely overlook or dismiss, so I congratulate you for seeing it.  I also admire your courage in submitting it to a forum where it''s guaranteed to be underestimated.  9</td>', 'This took equal measures of vision and confidence.  It''s a superb minimalist image of a subject that most of us would entirely overlook or dismiss, so I congratulate you for seeing it.  I also admire your courage in submitting it to a forum where it''s guaranteed to be underestimated.  9', '2005-08-17 09:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617342, 217021, 35357, '<td valign="top">IMO, dnmc<br/> <br/>edit - I''m 99.9% sure this is not rain, but rather a fountain of some sort.  If I''d taken this shot and was concerned about appearing to meet the challenge, I wouldn''t have submitted it.  But that sort of thing hasn''t stopped me in the past, so I''m not saying you shouldn''t have entered it.  I''d certainly be very happy if I''d got a photo like this, it is very nice.  The centered composition doesn''t work for me, though, I''d prefer to see it panned more to the left, to give some running room.  My favourite thing about it is the silvery water drops on the black background, very cool.<br/> <br/>Score = 4</td>', 'IMO, dnmc edit - I''m 99.9% sure this is not rain, but rather a fountain of some sort.  If I''d taken this shot and was concerned about appearing to meet the challenge, I wouldn''t have submitted it.  But that sort of thing hasn''t stopped me in the past, so I''m not saying you shouldn''t have entered it.  I''d certainly be very happy if I''d got a photo like this, it is very nice.  The centered composition doesn''t work for me, though, I''d prefer to see it panned more to the left, to give some running room.  My favourite thing about it is the silvery water drops on the black background, very cool. Score = 4', '2005-08-17 09:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617360, 216749, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC.<br/> <br/>-edit:  Clearly this is not rain.  Also, I envy you for living in a place where the weather is mostly beautiful.  The weather where I live is mostly crap, but my wife won''t live anywhere more than 20km from her family.  Oh well, I love her family a lot too.  I do like the stopped action of this shot, great expression on the boy''s face too.  I think your shot would be improved by cropping at the right where his arm meets the blue.  i don''t think that part of the Slip ''n Slide adds anything to the photo, and the crop would get you closer to the action.<br/> <br/>Sorry, I''m a bully.  Score = 4</td>', 'DNMC. -edit:  Clearly this is not rain.  Also, I envy you for living in a place where the weather is mostly beautiful.  The weather where I live is mostly crap, but my wife won''t live anywhere more than 20km from her family.  Oh well, I love her family a lot too.  I do like the stopped action of this shot, great expression on the boy''s face too.  I think your shot would be improved by cropping at the right where his arm meets the blue.  i don''t think that part of the Slip ''n Slide adds anything to the photo, and the crop would get you closer to the action. Sorry, I''m a bully.  Score = 4', '2005-08-17 09:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617363, 216492, 35357, '<td valign="top">Playful drops at the local splash pad.  DNMC.<br/> <br/>-edit:  Cleary not rain. [4]</td>', 'Playful drops at the local splash pad.  DNMC. -edit:  Cleary not rain. [4]', '2005-08-17 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617384, 217651, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet plant/flower shot.  Beautiful focus and bokeh.</td>', 'Another wet plant/flower shot.  Beautiful focus and bokeh.', '2005-08-17 09:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617388, 217323, 35357, '<td valign="top">This is nice as an abstract shot, but I find little of interest in it.</td>', 'This is nice as an abstract shot, but I find little of interest in it.', '2005-08-17 09:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617390, 218034, 35602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful saturation.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful saturation.  Nice composition.', '2005-08-17 09:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617398, 217590, 35357, '<td valign="top">Definitely rain in the distance... pretty far though.  A lot of cloud in the shot for my taste, I''d prefer to see a pretty extreme zoom in on the rainy area with the fading mountain ranges.</td>', 'Definitely rain in the distance... pretty far though.  A lot of cloud in the shot for my taste, I''d prefer to see a pretty extreme zoom in on the rainy area with the fading mountain ranges.', '2005-08-17 09:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617399, 217925, 35357, '<td valign="top">Not much of interest for me in this shot, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Not much of interest for me in this shot, I''m afraid.', '2005-08-17 09:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617401, 218102, 35602, '<td valign="top">Felt the contrast between dark and light was too strong.  I didn''t care for the blurred focus on the person, either.  The red and white sign also seems to really not belong in the image.  Balance of the contrast, closer cropping and better focus would have made the image much better.</td>', 'Felt the contrast between dark and light was too strong.  I didn''t care for the blurred focus on the person, either.  The red and white sign also seems to really not belong in the image.  Balance of the contrast, closer cropping and better focus would have made the image much better.', '2005-08-17 09:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617405, 217194, 35602, '<td valign="top">The sheeting rain almost looks like rays of light.  I like the black and white used on the image.  I am a reader, though, and I cringed when I saw the book left out in the rain.  Still, the image is well rendered.</td>', 'The sheeting rain almost looks like rays of light.  I like the black and white used on the image.  I am a reader, though, and I cringed when I saw the book left out in the rain.  Still, the image is well rendered.', '2005-08-17 09:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617410, 217215, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC :-(<br/> <br/>While I applaud you for throwing this shot into the mix, I''m sticking to giving this fine, non-rainy shot, a 4. :-(<br/> <br/>The colour and sharpness is wonderful, and beautiful to look at.  Great catch to get that one piece of cornstalk(?) pointing right at your one, lonely puff of could.  Title and story is fantastic, too, now I have guilt, but this is really like the anti-rain photo, with the rain story.  Sorry for my opinion, great shot. [4]</td>', 'DNMC :-( While I applaud you for throwing this shot into the mix, I''m sticking to giving this fine, non-rainy shot, a 4. :-( The colour and sharpness is wonderful, and beautiful to look at.  Great catch to get that one piece of cornstalk(?) pointing right at your one, lonely puff of could.  Title and story is fantastic, too, now I have guilt, but this is really like the anti-rain photo, with the rain story.  Sorry for my opinion, great shot. [4]', '2005-08-17 09:36:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1617415, 216104, 35602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  The lightening capture was wonderful.  A little too much noise in the clouds on the left.  Without knowing your camera or any of your settings, it looks to me as though the light may have been compensated too much.  It may have also been shot with too big a file and when it was compressed it may have added undesired noise.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  The lightening capture was wonderful.  A little too much noise in the clouds on the left.  Without knowing your camera or any of your settings, it looks to me as though the light may have been compensated too much.  It may have also been shot with too big a file and when it was compressed it may have added undesired noise.', '2005-08-17 09:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617422, 217865, 35602, '<td valign="top">Looks like you put a light under the umbrella to separate it from the background.  Excellent idea, but it may have added an overcast to the composition which happens sometimes with incandescent light or flashlights.</td>', 'Looks like you put a light under the umbrella to separate it from the background.  Excellent idea, but it may have added an overcast to the composition which happens sometimes with incandescent light or flashlights.', '2005-08-17 09:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617425, 217595, 18219, '<td valign="top">if only the rainbow was a little clearer</td>', 'if only the rainbow was a little clearer', '2005-08-17 09:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617428, 217982, 35602, '<td valign="top">Somewhat muddy.  Hard to get clean shots in the rain, as I discovered with the 100 or so that I took.  Did you use flash?  Might have added some fill in light on the geese if you had.</td>', 'Somewhat muddy.  Hard to get clean shots in the rain, as I discovered with the 100 or so that I took.  Did you use flash?  Might have added some fill in light on the geese if you had.', '2005-08-17 09:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617429, 217770, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice clear bright flowers, but if you were to crop a little tighter, it would get rid of some of the "unwanted" background.</td>', 'nice clear bright flowers, but if you were to crop a little tighter, it would get rid of some of the "unwanted" background.', '2005-08-17 09:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617430, 218073, 35602, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened.</td>', 'Oversharpened.', '2005-08-17 09:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617432, 217862, 18219, '<td valign="top">why so sad?<br/>maybe because only one leg is tucked in :-)<br/>nice emotive capture</td>', 'why so sad?maybe because only one leg is tucked in :-)nice emotive capture', '2005-08-17 09:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617434, 218034, 18219, '<td valign="top">that kid should have some shoes on, he may stand in something nasty :-)<br/> <br/>I like the silhoutte reflection in the water.</td>', 'that kid should have some shoes on, he may stand in something nasty :-) I like the silhoutte reflection in the water.', '2005-08-17 09:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617441, 218041, 18219, '<td valign="top">an interesting abstract background.<br/>Probably would be better if the actual spider was more in focus?</td>', 'an interesting abstract background.Probably would be better if the actual spider was more in focus?', '2005-08-17 09:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617444, 217554, 35602, '<td valign="top">Some people use grain as a creative tool.  I saw a lot of grain in this one.  Did you shoot in RAW?  My camera has a TIFF setting, and I notice when I shoot at TIFF, the compression leaves way to much grain.  It is because the file is so large, that it can''t handle such compression, but when enlarged to poster size it looks really awesome.  Try using smaller files for these challenges if you can, because it helps to clear up alot of noise and grain.</td>', 'Some people use grain as a creative tool.  I saw a lot of grain in this one.  Did you shoot in RAW?  My camera has a TIFF setting, and I notice when I shoot at TIFF, the compression leaves way to much grain.  It is because the file is so large, that it can''t handle such compression, but when enlarged to poster size it looks really awesome.  Try using smaller files for these challenges if you can, because it helps to clear up alot of noise and grain.', '2005-08-17 09:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617447, 217333, 18219, '<td valign="top">the image seems too dark overall.<br/>nice depth of field though.</td>', 'the image seems too dark overall.nice depth of field though.', '2005-08-17 09:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617448, 217381, 18219, '<td valign="top">an interesting composition</td>', 'an interesting composition', '2005-08-17 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617450, 217023, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Love the face.  She is beautiful.  I will give this one a 10</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Love the face.  She is beautiful.  I will give this one a 10', '2005-08-17 09:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617454, 217159, 31403, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, I think if you rotated it 30 degrees or so - so the boots are upper left and reflection is lower right - it would be a stronger composition.  Try it and let me know what you think - or show me - I''d be interested to see.  Terrific work though - nice job</td>', 'This is a great photo, I think if you rotated it 30 degrees or so - so the boots are upper left and reflection is lower right - it would be a stronger composition.  Try it and let me know what you think - or show me - I''d be interested to see.  Terrific work though - nice job', '2005-08-17 09:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617458, 216745, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great close-up of the center of the petunia(?)  Could have been cleaner and more crisp.</td>', 'Great close-up of the center of the petunia(?)  Could have been cleaner and more crisp.', '2005-08-17 09:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617461, 218049, 35602, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast.  Picture looks a little dirty.  Try shooting with a smaller file or pixel.</td>', 'Needs more contrast.  Picture looks a little dirty.  Try shooting with a smaller file or pixel.', '2005-08-17 09:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617462, 217892, 31403, '<td valign="top">this makes me fell joy!  Thank you!</td>', 'this makes me fell joy!  Thank you!', '2005-08-17 09:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617470, 216479, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  I love the added softness.  Makes it look surreal.  I think it is a likely candidate for a challenge entitled Alfred Hitchcock.  I gave it a 6 because I don''t think I see rain in it.  I am putting it in my portfolio as a favorite, though.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  I love the added softness.  Makes it look surreal.  I think it is a likely candidate for a challenge entitled Alfred Hitchcock.  I gave it a 6 because I don''t think I see rain in it.  I am putting it in my portfolio as a favorite, though.', '2005-08-17 09:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617471, 216329, 35602, '<td valign="top">Thought the motion was too much.</td>', 'Thought the motion was too much.', '2005-08-17 09:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617476, 216442, 19961, '<td valign="top">Well, with that title what do you expect?</td>', 'Well, with that title what do you expect?', '2005-08-17 09:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
