(1617497, 217643, 35602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  Lighting is so warm and soothing, which rain can be at night as you go to sleep.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  Lighting is so warm and soothing, which rain can be at night as you go to sleep.', '2005-08-17 10:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617506, 217790, 35602, '<td valign="top">The sun created a flare, which works in some compositions, but not in this one.  Also the definition on the trees is very low.  Sometimes a hood on the camera helps, but when it is directly pointed to the sun there is not much you can do to prevent flare.  Try other angles and techniques until you find one that works for this type of photo.</td>', 'The sun created a flare, which works in some compositions, but not in this one.  Also the definition on the trees is very low.  Sometimes a hood on the camera helps, but when it is directly pointed to the sun there is not much you can do to prevent flare.  Try other angles and techniques until you find one that works for this type of photo.', '2005-08-17 10:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617515, 217890, 35602, '<td valign="top">I hope you got a lot of rain.  That grass is really burned.  The picture does show an obvious downpour, but perhaps more saturation would have brought out color a bit better.  Also try in black and white, where you can show great contrast without compromising the detail of the picture.  Even toning it  to give a creative edge might be in order.</td>', 'I hope you got a lot of rain.  That grass is really burned.  The picture does show an obvious downpour, but perhaps more saturation would have brought out color a bit better.  Also try in black and white, where you can show great contrast without compromising the detail of the picture.  Even toning it  to give a creative edge might be in order.', '2005-08-17 10:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617516, 215961, 42469, '<td valign="top">Artistic with the interesting and  beautiful child face.</td>', 'Artistic with the interesting and  beautiful child face.', '2005-08-17 10:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
