(1618263, 216023, 22537, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and simple.  You may have burned a bit more detail into the petals and processed through Neatimage to reduce the noise.  Other than that, this is an outstanding capture.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful and simple.  You may have burned a bit more detail into the petals and processed through Neatimage to reduce the noise.  Other than that, this is an outstanding capture.  Good luck!', '2005-08-17 13:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
