(1618268, 216920, 22537, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot deserving of a high score in this challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent shot deserving of a high score in this challenge.  Good luck!', '2005-08-17 13:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618271, 217770, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the tonality here, and your control of exposure, which is impeccable. I think you''ve lost a little of the sense of finest detail, probably from the smallness of the file size of the image, whihc has also lead to those blurry lines about high-contrast edges. I''m not convinced about the composition overall either: its quite simplistic, and i think something stronger would make more immediate impact - especially in a challenge here there are doubtless many many flower photographs. But there remains a lot to like here.</td>', 'I like the tonality here, and your control of exposure, which is impeccable. I think you''ve lost a little of the sense of finest detail, probably from the smallness of the file size of the image, whihc has also lead to those blurry lines about high-contrast edges. I''m not convinced about the composition overall either: its quite simplistic, and i think something stronger would make more immediate impact - especially in a challenge here there are doubtless many many flower photographs. But there remains a lot to like here.', '2005-08-17 13:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618272, 217278, 22537, '<td valign="top">The mood of this shot is great. Good luck!</td>', 'The mood of this shot is great. Good luck!', '2005-08-17 13:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618275, 216920, 20941, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2005-08-17 13:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618279, 216479, 22537, '<td valign="top">I dont know how this connects to rain but it is an excellent shot in of itself. Has a real Hitchcock feel to though I''m sure that has been mentioned numerous times.  You have portrayed an eerie stillness in this image. Good luck!</td>', 'I dont know how this connects to rain but it is an excellent shot in of itself. Has a real Hitchcock feel to though I''m sure that has been mentioned numerous times.  You have portrayed an eerie stillness in this image. Good luck!', '2005-08-17 13:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618282, 217155, 37544, '<td valign="top">although it probably was raining when you shot this, there is no rain present in the photograph. I am not voting lower for that though. This is a great capture of the weather but there just seems to be something missing. It needs punch. I would have straightened it also.</td>', 'although it probably was raining when you shot this, there is no rain present in the photograph. I am not voting lower for that though. This is a great capture of the weather but there just seems to be something missing. It needs punch. I would have straightened it also.', '2005-08-17 13:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618283, 217929, 22537, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I''m a sucker for good clouds.  Good luck!</td>', 'Good shot.  I''m a sucker for good clouds.  Good luck!', '2005-08-17 13:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618284, 216050, 13602, '<td valign="top">I would of got that portrait alignment and closer to it a bit. I think the composition would be better like that. Nice capture otherways.</td>', 'I would of got that portrait alignment and closer to it a bit. I think the composition would be better like that. Nice capture otherways.', '2005-08-17 13:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618291, 217485, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully intense shot, though obviously you''re going to feel the weight of the voters as regards rain :-) I can see that the de-sat trick really adds impact to the yellow band of the ''line'' - but was it necessary to go that far with it? Whilst I like the tonality enormously, and the composition, and the whole image, that element of it rather feels like being hit over the head and told what to look at - as though you don''t quite trust your audience to find things for themselves in your work. There''s also a sense of heavy-handedness with the dodge and burn tools, which really is becoming a recurrent dpc disease again, and, for me, lacks subtlety. Just a couple of dislikes in a great image, though.</td>', 'Wonderfully intense shot, though obviously you''re going to feel the weight of the voters as regards rain :-) I can see that the de-sat trick really adds impact to the yellow band of the ''line'' - but was it necessary to go that far with it? Whilst I like the tonality enormously, and the composition, and the whole image, that element of it rather feels like being hit over the head and told what to look at - as though you don''t quite trust your audience to find things for themselves in your work. There''s also a sense of heavy-handedness with the dodge and burn tools, which really is becoming a recurrent dpc disease again, and, for me, lacks subtlety. Just a couple of dislikes in a great image, though.', '2005-08-17 13:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618292, 216908, 20941, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of lighting to capture this very cool image!</td>', 'Wonderful use of lighting to capture this very cool image!', '2005-08-17 13:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618293, 215961, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is certainly one of the more striking images of the challenge.  The cropping is an excellent choice.  Sorta spooky......hmmm.....where is Nicholson??  Good luck!</td>', 'This is certainly one of the more striking images of the challenge.  The cropping is an excellent choice.  Sorta spooky......hmmm.....where is Nicholson??  Good luck!', '2005-08-17 13:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618296, 217533, 37544, '<td valign="top">nice abstract, just wish that something was in focus.</td>', 'nice abstract, just wish that something was in focus.', '2005-08-17 13:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618302, 216766, 37544, '<td valign="top">I really like this! I would have adjusted the levels a bit more to make the rainbow show up more.</td>', 'I really like this! I would have adjusted the levels a bit more to make the rainbow show up more.', '2005-08-17 13:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618305, 217595, 37544, '<td valign="top">Nice picture! I wish you would have done some post processing to make the rainbow show up more-this could be outstanding IMO!</td>', 'Nice picture! I wish you would have done some post processing to make the rainbow show up more-this could be outstanding IMO!', '2005-08-17 13:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618307, 218077, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s an odd, almost water-colour-esque feel to this image (not out of place, I suppose). I can see arguments both for and against the inclusion of the lamp-post, but oh, for it to be straight. Colour tones are good, and the sense of greyness, of dullness is well achieved. Without the post, it might have an almost turner-like quality of light about it.</td>', 'There''s an odd, almost water-colour-esque feel to this image (not out of place, I suppose). I can see arguments both for and against the inclusion of the lamp-post, but oh, for it to be straight. Colour tones are good, and the sense of greyness, of dullness is well achieved. Without the post, it might have an almost turner-like quality of light about it.', '2005-08-17 13:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618313, 216760, 37544, '<td valign="top">another cute kid!</td>', 'another cute kid!', '2005-08-17 13:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618316, 218034, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good contrast, strong composition, colour, exposure. I like it, but couldn''t go overboard about it. Solid work.</td>', 'Good contrast, strong composition, colour, exposure. I like it, but couldn''t go overboard about it. Solid work.', '2005-08-17 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618319, 217898, 42253, '<td valign="top">Great shot!<br/> <br/>Really represents the theme well.</td>', 'Great shot! Really represents the theme well.', '2005-08-17 13:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618320, 217961, 37544, '<td valign="top">oh cool! The only thing I hate about macro shots is if everything is not in focus. This still is a nice picture-good luck</td>', 'oh cool! The only thing I hate about macro shots is if everything is not in focus. This still is a nice picture-good luck', '2005-08-17 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618328, 216453, 42253, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!<br/> <br/>Big color and good compo</td>', 'Great shot!! Big color and good compo', '2005-08-17 13:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618330, 217023, 37544, '<td valign="top">this is great! love her smile too! good luck!</td>', 'this is great! love her smile too! good luck!', '2005-08-17 13:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618331, 217929, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very strong indeed - reminds me of Simon Norfolk, who is a genius (so that''s a high compliment indeed). I would love the foreground t have been pulled up a little, just to reveal some more detail in those buildings (and I don''t mean throwing the dodge and burn at it indiscriminately). The tonality and light in the sky is wonderfully caught, and it remain purely photographic; very high standard.</td>', 'Very strong indeed - reminds me of Simon Norfolk, who is a genius (so that''s a high compliment indeed). I would love the foreground t have been pulled up a little, just to reveal some more detail in those buildings (and I don''t mean throwing the dodge and burn at it indiscriminately). The tonality and light in the sky is wonderfully caught, and it remain purely photographic; very high standard.', '2005-08-17 13:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618332, 217534, 37544, '<td valign="top">VERY GOOD-top 10 I bet!</td>', 'VERY GOOD-top 10 I bet!', '2005-08-17 13:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618336, 215778, 42253, '<td valign="top">I like it!!<br/> <br/>Great strong color contrast.<br/> <br/>And the theme is well understood in this abstract</td>', 'I like it!! Great strong color contrast. And the theme is well understood in this abstract', '2005-08-17 13:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618341, 217440, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think this lacks a sense of drama, which might have been usefully increased with some contrast work, especially around that spray of water, which simply shades into greyness.</td>', 'I think this lacks a sense of drama, which might have been usefully increased with some contrast work, especially around that spray of water, which simply shades into greyness.', '2005-08-17 13:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618343, 217278, 42253, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!<br/> <br/>Subtle color really and the theme is well represented.</td>', 'Great shot!! Subtle color really and the theme is well represented.', '2005-08-17 13:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618348, 217758, 42253, '<td valign="top">I really like the color burst in the drops.</td>', 'I really like the color burst in the drops.', '2005-08-17 13:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618353, 217211, 42253, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!<br/> <br/>The cool, wet look really works here.<br/> <br/>The web is very well represented too!</td>', 'Great shot!! The cool, wet look really works here. The web is very well represented too!', '2005-08-17 13:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618355, 217927, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice image - and the kind of title I would expect to put folks'' backs up. I''m not sure, for myself, and given the rule-set, that the process of your editing is much of an issue in my assessment of this - at least, it wasn''t until I read the title.</td>', 'Nice image - and the kind of title I would expect to put folks'' backs up. I''m not sure, for myself, and given the rule-set, that the process of your editing is much of an issue in my assessment of this - at least, it wasn''t until I read the title.', '2005-08-17 13:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618357, 216617, 42253, '<td valign="top">Great mood!!<br/> <br/>Makes a rainy moment seem special<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great mood!! Makes a rainy moment seem special ', '2005-08-17 13:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618372, 216389, 24065, '<td valign="top">This was a great idea.  In my opinion -- for what it''s worth -- there are 2 things that would improve the image.  First, composition -- my eyes are drawn past the boy to the stumps or whatever they are behind him.  Second, lighting -- the shadows are too harsh on his face and body.  In advanced editing you could have used Highlights-Shadows adjustements, curves or a dodge and burn layer to get rid of some of the shadows.  I hope this is helpful feedback.</td>', 'This was a great idea.  In my opinion -- for what it''s worth -- there are 2 things that would improve the image.  First, composition -- my eyes are drawn past the boy to the stumps or whatever they are behind him.  Second, lighting -- the shadows are too harsh on his face and body.  In advanced editing you could have used Highlights-Shadows adjustements, curves or a dodge and burn layer to get rid of some of the shadows.  I hope this is helpful feedback.', '2005-08-17 13:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618375, 216431, 24065, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image!!!  10</td>', 'Wonderful image!!!  10', '2005-08-17 13:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618405, 217855, 13602, '<td valign="top">great shot I like it alot!</td>', 'great shot I like it alot!', '2005-08-17 13:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618457, 217875, 13602, '<td valign="top">the blue in this kinda bothers me a bit, I think a good old b/w would of been more proper, anyways a verry nice one!</td>', 'the blue in this kinda bothers me a bit, I think a good old b/w would of been more proper, anyways a verry nice one!', '2005-08-17 14:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618461, 217909, 20941, '<td valign="top">Creative and well composed with pleasing color scheme a pleasing abstract like image! Nice work!</td>', 'Creative and well composed with pleasing color scheme a pleasing abstract like image! Nice work!', '2005-08-17 14:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
