(1618614, 217534, 21388, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! I Love the dramatic sky, light and composition. My favourite.</td>', 'Wow!!! I Love the dramatic sky, light and composition. My favourite.', '2005-08-17 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
