(1619231, 216763, 35357, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see some real rain in this rain challenge, congrats.  For me this shot has nice composition &amp; flow, from the rain streaking down past the light, slamming into the road, and rushing away in a torrent.  The lighting is really nice.</td>', 'It''s nice to see some real rain in this rain challenge, congrats.  For me this shot has nice composition & flow, from the rain streaking down past the light, slamming into the road, and rushing away in a torrent.  The lighting is really nice.', '2005-08-17 18:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1619232, 217971, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet plant/flower shot.  The lighting &amp; dof for the dark background are very nice.</td>', 'Another wet plant/flower shot.  The lighting & dof for the dark background are very nice.', '2005-08-17 18:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1619242, 216793, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet flower shot... but hold on, this is one with a difference!  I love the action, and the angle of the water drops is perfect.  Real rain or not doesn''t matter.  I might have been inclined to use colour, but this shot is great either way.  Using B&amp;W probably has the effect of subduing the flowers and adding importance to the ''rain'', anyway.  Great job!</td>', 'Another wet flower shot... but hold on, this is one with a difference!  I love the action, and the angle of the water drops is perfect.  Real rain or not doesn''t matter.  I might have been inclined to use colour, but this shot is great either way.  Using B&W probably has the effect of subduing the flowers and adding importance to the ''rain'', anyway.  Great job!', '2005-08-17 18:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1619244, 218073, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet plant/flower shot.  Actually got ''rain'' though.  Not much interest for me. [6]</td>', 'Another wet plant/flower shot.  Actually got ''rain'' though.  Not much interest for me. [6]', '2005-08-17 18:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
