(1620482, 215552, 37844, '<td valign="top">Concept is nice, but seems setup instead of spontaneous.  Felt it could have been just alittle more exciting , alittle more ragged and possibly barefoot would have gave it a less contrived feel.</td>', 'Concept is nice, but seems setup instead of spontaneous.  Felt it could have been just alittle more exciting , alittle more ragged and possibly barefoot would have gave it a less contrived feel.', '2005-08-18 03:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
