(1620657, 217892, 42592, '<td valign="top">I love the way this image is framed. It seemed very natural and in the moment. I like that it was shot in black and white.</td>', 'I love the way this image is framed. It seemed very natural and in the moment. I like that it was shot in black and white.', '2005-08-18 07:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620658, 218043, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting, dirty image - love the feel of it, very expressive. The areas you appear to have darkened seems a brutal effect - perhaps a touch heavy--handed? Not enough feathering? Nothing else in frame seems to go quite a black as those areas ... and the overlap with the umbrella makes it plainly editing. Outside of that reservation though, a much more intriguing image than most</td>', 'Interesting, dirty image - love the feel of it, very expressive. The areas you appear to have darkened seems a brutal effect - perhaps a touch heavy--handed? Not enough feathering? Nothing else in frame seems to go quite a black as those areas ... and the overlap with the umbrella makes it plainly editing. Outside of that reservation though, a much more intriguing image than most', '2005-08-18 07:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620659, 217821, 6999, '<td valign="top">Just too abstract for my taste I''m afraid - though I can imagine you were struggling, in LA, for rain :-)</td>', 'Just too abstract for my taste I''m afraid - though I can imagine you were struggling, in LA, for rain :-)', '2005-08-18 07:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620660, 217910, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait - with the slight reservation that you might have calmed down the highlights on the glove and the bear a touch - they have that very digital over-exposed feel. Great tones otherwise though. One has to hunt for the suggestion of rain (as opposed to cold) a bit more than bodes well for your score in a Rain challenge here, but it''s a good shot.</td>', 'Excellent portrait - with the slight reservation that you might have calmed down the highlights on the glove and the bear a touch - they have that very digital over-exposed feel. Great tones otherwise though. One has to hunt for the suggestion of rain (as opposed to cold) a bit more than bodes well for your score in a Rain challenge here, but it''s a good shot.', '2005-08-18 07:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620661, 217481, 42592, '<td valign="top">Wow! Amazing contrast of color and so well framed. I love how well you captured the details of his expression amid the backdrop of the traffic.</td>', 'Wow! Amazing contrast of color and so well framed. I love how well you captured the details of his expression amid the backdrop of the traffic.', '2005-08-18 07:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620662, 217846, 6999, '<td valign="top">Love the feel here - a strong sense of that head-down just-get-through-it unremitting drizzle. You might have had a slightly stronger composition - this seems to fall a little between a set of parallels and a more leading group of those cows; I also wonder if a little pulling down of the exposure wouldn''t have deepened and enriched the green tones, and perhaps lost the sense of the sky drifting into over-exposure, although obviously the details of the cows themselves needed to be maintained. It''s a fine shot, even with those reservations, and even with the slight feeling of missing the very finest detail.</td>', 'Love the feel here - a strong sense of that head-down just-get-through-it unremitting drizzle. You might have had a slightly stronger composition - this seems to fall a little between a set of parallels and a more leading group of those cows; I also wonder if a little pulling down of the exposure wouldn''t have deepened and enriched the green tones, and perhaps lost the sense of the sky drifting into over-exposure, although obviously the details of the cows themselves needed to be maintained. It''s a fine shot, even with those reservations, and even with the slight feeling of missing the very finest detail.', '2005-08-18 07:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620663, 216104, 35517, '<td valign="top">simply gorgeous shot... well done... looks spectacular...... 10</td>', 'simply gorgeous shot... well done... looks spectacular...... 10', '2005-08-18 07:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620664, 217862, 6999, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure, excellent detail - it''s remarkable how the quality of a camera and lens shows through the re-sizing process really. Two things really make it: the sleeves hanging below the hands, and the one trouser-leg not tucked into the boot - perhaps a shame that you haven''t got the full figure in frame, to emphasise that last point.</td>', 'Perfect exposure, excellent detail - it''s remarkable how the quality of a camera and lens shows through the re-sizing process really. Two things really make it: the sleeves hanging below the hands, and the one trouser-leg not tucked into the boot - perhaps a shame that you haven''t got the full figure in frame, to emphasise that last point.', '2005-08-18 07:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620666, 217740, 21604, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Very nice trails made by the rain, and lovely colors in the flowers. 7</td>', 'I really like this shot. Very nice trails made by the rain, and lovely colors in the flowers. 7', '2005-08-18 07:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620667, 217925, 21604, '<td valign="top">It definitely says "rain" to me, but I feel that there is a lack of a focal point to the shot and the colors are a bit flat.</td>', 'It definitely says "rain" to me, but I feel that there is a lack of a focal point to the shot and the colors are a bit flat.', '2005-08-18 07:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620668, 217450, 32767, '<td valign="top">I guessing this is an elsapo? I could be wrong but it a great image with superb post processing. Nice capture.</td>', 'I guessing this is an elsapo? I could be wrong but it a great image with superb post processing. Nice capture.', '2005-08-18 07:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620670, 216724, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is one of my picks for a top 3 finish. Fantastic eye and overall concept. The crop and use of lines is stunning. Thank you for bieng you. 10</td>', 'This is one of my picks for a top 3 finish. Fantastic eye and overall concept. The crop and use of lines is stunning. Thank you for bieng you. 10', '2005-08-18 07:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
