(1620768, 216492, 17134, '<td valign="top">playful? looks more like a serious tropical storm to me!</td>', 'playful? looks more like a serious tropical storm to me!', '2005-08-18 08:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620812, 217023, 32378, '<td valign="top">There is something about the angle of the rain in this shot that tends to make it look like it really isn''t rain.</td>', 'There is something about the angle of the rain in this shot that tends to make it look like it really isn''t rain.', '2005-08-18 09:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620819, 218089, 31403, '<td valign="top">I hope you left comments on this - nothing looks wet, and the blurs make me think she is posed - if so, well done - if it is candid, well done.  I''m interested to see.  I would like the top of the ramp and the visual distraction of the building and three lights to be cropped out of this photo, love the yellow cast, cool photo 7</td>', 'I hope you left comments on this - nothing looks wet, and the blurs make me think she is posed - if so, well done - if it is candid, well done.  I''m interested to see.  I would like the top of the ramp and the visual distraction of the building and three lights to be cropped out of this photo, love the yellow cast, cool photo 7', '2005-08-18 09:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620822, 217482, 32378, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped this closer, if only to make the rain appear more believable.  From the arc of the rain it appears this is some kind of sprinkler.</td>', 'I would have cropped this closer, if only to make the rain appear more believable.  From the arc of the rain it appears this is some kind of sprinkler.', '2005-08-18 09:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620824, 216050, 31403, '<td valign="top">that''s cool!  the wind catching the spray to give that little curve, and the excellent b&amp;w conversion make this my favorite so far!  8 with a good chance of a bump up!</td>', 'that''s cool!  the wind catching the spray to give that little curve, and the excellent b&w conversion make this my favorite so far!  8 with a good chance of a bump up!', '2005-08-18 09:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620838, 217982, 32378, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if more of the sky was cropped out to just above the tree line in the back ground.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if more of the sky was cropped out to just above the tree line in the back ground.', '2005-08-18 09:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620841, 215854, 35357, '<td valign="top">Good idea and technically good, but the subject lacks interest for me.</td>', 'Good idea and technically good, but the subject lacks interest for me.', '2005-08-18 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620843, 216865, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Spider is a bit blown.  I see no rain, though the web is wet.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Spider is a bit blown.  I see no rain, though the web is wet.', '2005-08-18 09:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620848, 216479, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC... :-(<br/> <br/>Wow, very cool shot.  Has nothing to do with rain.</td>', 'DNMC... :-( Wow, very cool shot.  Has nothing to do with rain.', '2005-08-18 09:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620849, 216793, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the only thing is the angle of the "rain."  If the wind was blowing that hard to make the rain come from this angle seems the flower would have been bending over in the wind a lot more.</td>', 'Nice photo, the only thing is the angle of the "rain."  If the wind was blowing that hard to make the rain come from this angle seems the flower would have been bending over in the wind a lot more.', '2005-08-18 09:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620851, 216838, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC... :-(<br/> <br/>Background blurring has left a distracting aura around the kids.  Fantasic catch of the kids, though.</td>', 'DNMC... :-( Background blurring has left a distracting aura around the kids.  Fantasic catch of the kids, though.', '2005-08-18 09:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620860, 217739, 31403, '<td valign="top">Great photo and cool title, before the () - I believe "why worry" was Dire Straits Brothers in Arms album<br/> <br/>revisit - bumped to 10</td>', 'Great photo and cool title, before the () - I believe "why worry" was Dire Straits Brothers in Arms album revisit - bumped to 10', '2005-08-18 09:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620868, 216023, 10634, '<td valign="top">Not sure how others feel about the noise in this photo, but I like it.</td>', 'Not sure how others feel about the noise in this photo, but I like it.', '2005-08-18 09:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620881, 217159, 10634, '<td valign="top">The best of the "Puddle Stomping" shots in the challenge in my opinion. Good Luck!</td>', 'The best of the "Puddle Stomping" shots in the challenge in my opinion. Good Luck!', '2005-08-18 10:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620888, 216354, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot... I like the colors in the background. There is a little bit of noise at the top and bottom right of the photo that is distracting because it doesn''t fit in with the rest of the background. The blur brush would do away with this nicely. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice shot... I like the colors in the background. There is a little bit of noise at the top and bottom right of the photo that is distracting because it doesn''t fit in with the rest of the background. The blur brush would do away with this nicely. Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-08-18 10:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620893, 216736, 10634, '<td valign="top">The lightness of the sky draws your eye to it and you don''t see the building right away.</td>', 'The lightness of the sky draws your eye to it and you don''t see the building right away.', '2005-08-18 10:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620897, 215552, 10634, '<td valign="top">Love the color.. good luck in the challenge</td>', 'Love the color.. good luck in the challenge', '2005-08-18 10:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620915, 217786, 4477, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!</td>', 'Brilliant!', '2005-08-18 10:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620919, 216271, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun shot, and something that I thought there would be more of. One would perhaps like there to be even more spray from the truck, but you''ve certainly caught a mood.</td>', 'Fun shot, and something that I thought there would be more of. One would perhaps like there to be even more spray from the truck, but you''ve certainly caught a mood.', '2005-08-18 10:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620925, 217215, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty certin the negative approach isn''t going to wash with the voters, but it is of course tricky to be original and different and if you''re somehwere without rain ... <br/> <br/>I''m not wholly sure about your composition here - the framing seems somewhat arbitrary, with the shapes of those dried leaves not working together for you. The angles and shapes I think need to be more coherent in their overall effect - this seems too random. Great blue, though.</td>', 'I''m pretty certin the negative approach isn''t going to wash with the voters, but it is of course tricky to be original and different and if you''re somehwere without rain ...  I''m not wholly sure about your composition here - the framing seems somewhat arbitrary, with the shapes of those dried leaves not working together for you. The angles and shapes I think need to be more coherent in their overall effect - this seems too random. Great blue, though.', '2005-08-18 10:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620947, 217481, 33758, '<td valign="top">Great picture! Ribbon material! 10</td>', 'Great picture! Ribbon material! 10', '2005-08-18 10:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620983, 218077, 42602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love the blue-lit clouds!</td>', 'Beautiful! I love the blue-lit clouds!', '2005-08-18 11:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620987, 217740, 17134, '<td valign="top">the first nice picture of a flower in the rain.. (and there are so many)</td>', 'the first nice picture of a flower in the rain.. (and there are so many)', '2005-08-18 11:14:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1620988, 217781, 42602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but maybe better w/out car lights?</td>', 'Beautiful, but maybe better w/out car lights?', '2005-08-18 11:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620989, 217159, 33515, '<td valign="top">I would like this pic much better if it included the child''s head. I leaves me with a weird feeling without that reference. 5</td>', 'I would like this pic much better if it included the child''s head. I leaves me with a weird feeling without that reference. 5', '2005-08-18 11:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620990, 216766, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, the sky looks perfect. 6</td>', 'Very nice colors, the sky looks perfect. 6', '2005-08-18 11:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620993, 217224, 42602, '<td valign="top">Truely beautiful! Nice and sharp, and beautiful color!</td>', 'Truely beautiful! Nice and sharp, and beautiful color!', '2005-08-18 11:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620995, 216050, 33515, '<td valign="top">I not sure I would want to see the next thing that came out. The cropping of the frame is good and lets me eye flow out into the picture nicely.</td>', 'I not sure I would want to see the next thing that came out. The cropping of the frame is good and lets me eye flow out into the picture nicely.', '2005-08-18 11:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620996, 217866, 42602, '<td valign="top">Great potential... maybe better poses next time?</td>', 'Great potential... maybe better poses next time?', '2005-08-18 11:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1620999, 217752, 42602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... I love how the light comes from the flower...</td>', 'Beautiful... I love how the light comes from the flower...', '2005-08-18 11:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621001, 215903, 42602, '<td valign="top">WOW! I love the light! Aww... Makes me miss the mountains... *sniff*<br/>Good job!</td>', 'WOW! I love the light! Aww... Makes me miss the mountains... *sniff*Good job!', '2005-08-18 11:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621002, 217948, 42602, '<td valign="top">I like the name, love the pic!</td>', 'I like the name, love the pic!', '2005-08-18 11:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621005, 217450, 42602, '<td valign="top">Very nice.... *is impressed*</td>', 'Very nice.... *is impressed*', '2005-08-18 11:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621006, 217113, 42602, '<td valign="top">Interesting... Your pic makes the water look like crystal.</td>', 'Interesting... Your pic makes the water look like crystal.', '2005-08-18 11:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621011, 217968, 42602, '<td valign="top">Very good. I like the model, but the picture might be better w/out...</td>', 'Very good. I like the model, but the picture might be better w/out...', '2005-08-18 11:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621015, 215630, 42602, '<td valign="top">Cool name, interesting picutre... Did you black and white it, then invert color?</td>', 'Cool name, interesting picutre... Did you black and white it, then invert color?', '2005-08-18 11:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621016, 217921, 35804, '<td valign="top">YEEEEEEEEEEEEEE  HAW AND HELL YEAH!<br/> <br/>OMG...I can''t stop laughing...completely genius...10!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'YEEEEEEEEEEEEEE  HAW AND HELL YEAH! OMG...I can''t stop laughing...completely genius...10!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2005-08-18 11:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621017, 216045, 42602, '<td valign="top">Heehee... I love your name!</td>', 'Heehee... I love your name!', '2005-08-18 11:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621019, 216833, 42602, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture... I like the sparkle...</td>', 'Interesting picture... I like the sparkle...', '2005-08-18 11:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621024, 217938, 42602, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Good idea, but model lacks enough emotion.</td>', 'Interesting. Good idea, but model lacks enough emotion.', '2005-08-18 11:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621026, 217892, 42602, '<td valign="top">Awww... Very cute... Next time, though, get the model to smile REALLY big so we can see how happy she is. The smile is hiding in this picture.</td>', 'Awww... Very cute... Next time, though, get the model to smile REALLY big so we can see how happy she is. The smile is hiding in this picture.', '2005-08-18 11:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621061, 217646, 11673, '<td valign="top">I would like to ask permission of the photographer if this image to use your photograph as a basis for a watercolour idea?  Please write me at daigledm@nbnet.nb.ca if this would be okay.  It''s lovely ... thanks!  Muguets</td>', 'I would like to ask permission of the photographer if this image to use your photograph as a basis for a watercolour idea?  Please write me at daigledm@nbnet.nb.ca if this would be okay.  It''s lovely ... thanks!  Muguets', '2005-08-18 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621092, 217485, 326, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!</td>', 'Very cool shot!', '2005-08-18 11:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621121, 217497, 326, '<td valign="top">cool shot &amp; title</td>', 'cool shot & title', '2005-08-18 12:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621130, 217534, 7910, '<td valign="top">Great capture; nice use of thirds and the vanishing point.</td>', 'Great capture; nice use of thirds and the vanishing point.', '2005-08-18 12:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621137, 217855, 7910, '<td valign="top">nice action.</td>', 'nice action.', '2005-08-18 12:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621138, 218103, 32767, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Simple but very effective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Simple but very effective.', '2005-08-18 12:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621140, 217482, 7910, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting... even if it happens to be staged.  Perfect shutter speed for the drops.</td>', 'very nice lighting... even if it happens to be staged.  Perfect shutter speed for the drops.', '2005-08-18 12:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621141, 217113, 32767, '<td valign="top">Really nice image. Superb coloring. Good Luck! 7</td>', 'Really nice image. Superb coloring. Good Luck! 7', '2005-08-18 12:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621143, 217846, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2005-08-18 12:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621145, 217029, 32767, '<td valign="top">Poor dog. Looks a little more like you hit him/her with a bucket of water.</td>', 'Poor dog. Looks a little more like you hit him/her with a bucket of water.', '2005-08-18 12:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621147, 217921, 17134, '<td valign="top">Added points for:<br/>- excellent use of available models<br/>- making the model wet<br/>- figuring out how to pose<br/> <br/>Demoted points for:<br/>- the lack of an interesting environment (like a farm, farmland or perhaps a forest)<br/>- not having a female model when showing wet tshirts (kidding here)</td>', 'Added points for:- excellent use of available models- making the model wet- figuring out how to pose Demoted points for:- the lack of an interesting environment (like a farm, farmland or perhaps a forest)- not having a female model when showing wet tshirts (kidding here)', '2005-08-18 12:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621151, 217644, 17134, '<td valign="top">spectacular! the timeframe could be shorter though, this makes the car unsharp and the water ''funny''</td>', 'spectacular! the timeframe could be shorter though, this makes the car unsharp and the water ''funny''', '2005-08-18 12:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621240, 217609, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet plant/flower shot.  Although nicely done, these don''t hold much interest for me.</td>', 'Another wet plant/flower shot.  Although nicely done, these don''t hold much interest for me.', '2005-08-18 13:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621243, 216023, 17610, '<td valign="top">good detail but the colours don''t quite go</td>', 'good detail but the colours don''t quite go', '2005-08-18 13:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621245, 216910, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC... :-(<br/> <br/>It''s sunny out, the sky is blue, someone sneezed on your window while hitting a bump in the car.  This could be nice in an abstract sense, but there is no subject or flow of interest for me.</td>', 'DNMC... :-( It''s sunny out, the sky is blue, someone sneezed on your window while hitting a bump in the car.  This could be nice in an abstract sense, but there is no subject or flow of interest for me.', '2005-08-18 13:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621259, 217808, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet plant/flower shot.  Very nicely done.  I especially like the misty, treed background.  It sets off the weeping stalks very nicely.</td>', 'Another wet plant/flower shot.  Very nicely done.  I especially like the misty, treed background.  It sets off the weeping stalks very nicely.', '2005-08-18 13:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621260, 217224, 35357, '<td valign="top">Great butterfly, I like the colours.  Very nicely focused.  I don''t know how you got the ''rain'' streaks, and while they make the shot fit the challenge, they don''t look natural at all.  I think this is a great shot on its own, the streaks detract form it, IMO.</td>', 'Great butterfly, I like the colours.  Very nicely focused.  I don''t know how you got the ''rain'' streaks, and while they make the shot fit the challenge, they don''t look natural at all.  I think this is a great shot on its own, the streaks detract form it, IMO.', '2005-08-18 13:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621264, 217820, 35357, '<td valign="top">The background is most interesting to me in this shot.  I don''t feel a connection to, or much interest in the subjects.  I think I''d find this shot much more interesting if it were taken from a different angle than the usual eye-level.  Maybe from low, looking up, which culd use the umbrella as half the background and the scenery as the other half, at an angle.</td>', 'The background is most interesting to me in this shot.  I don''t feel a connection to, or much interest in the subjects.  I think I''d find this shot much more interesting if it were taken from a different angle than the usual eye-level.  Maybe from low, looking up, which culd use the umbrella as half the background and the scenery as the other half, at an angle.', '2005-08-18 13:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621265, 218057, 6999, '<td valign="top">Certainly a good scene for the challenge - but i think you need to work on ideas of composition and processing. Certainly more contrast would have helped bring out the depth of tones in the sky, and could have made the dark grey even more threatening. Compositionally - good that you haven''t placed the horizon centrally as so many do, but the tree and landing stage make a very confused left-hand side of the image, especially with the smaller areas of tree intruding into frame.</td>', 'Certainly a good scene for the challenge - but i think you need to work on ideas of composition and processing. Certainly more contrast would have helped bring out the depth of tones in the sky, and could have made the dark grey even more threatening. Compositionally - good that you haven''t placed the horizon centrally as so many do, but the tree and landing stage make a very confused left-hand side of the image, especially with the smaller areas of tree intruding into frame.', '2005-08-18 13:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621269, 217481, 6999, '<td valign="top">As a street portrait I like this very much. The pose works absolutely to bring it into the challenge (not suggesting it''s a posed shot, but you know what I mean). The processing and depth of field is exemplary, exposure and tonality, escpecially in that green shirt, marvellouslly clear.</td>', 'As a street portrait I like this very much. The pose works absolutely to bring it into the challenge (not suggesting it''s a posed shot, but you know what I mean). The processing and depth of field is exemplary, exposure and tonality, escpecially in that green shirt, marvellouslly clear.', '2005-08-18 13:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621271, 217764, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet plant/flower shot.  Nicely composed.  I like the dof &amp; background most about this shot.  The rain-steaks are very nice.</td>', 'Another wet plant/flower shot.  Nicely composed.  I like the dof & background most about this shot.  The rain-steaks are very nice.', '2005-08-18 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621277, 216659, 35357, '<td valign="top">Oddly I find this shot interesting, while the other puddle shots I''ve seen so far have held little interest for me.  I can''t quite place it.  Good job of making the ordinary an interesting subject.  Maybe it''s the odd mix of elements... building, sewer, submerged grass, rock.. very nicely arranged.</td>', 'Oddly I find this shot interesting, while the other puddle shots I''ve seen so far have held little interest for me.  I can''t quite place it.  Good job of making the ordinary an interesting subject.  Maybe it''s the odd mix of elements... building, sewer, submerged grass, rock.. very nicely arranged.', '2005-08-18 13:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621281, 215967, 35357, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s rainy out, but I can''t tell.  I''m pretty neutral on the subject matter.  I think it might be improved with a slight pan to the right &amp; down.</td>', 'I guess it''s rainy out, but I can''t tell.  I''m pretty neutral on the subject matter.  I think it might be improved with a slight pan to the right & down.', '2005-08-18 13:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621292, 216909, 35357, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate the the beak is a little oof, always the first place my eye goes after the eye.  Very nice pose with the raindrops &amp; circles.  I think this shot would be even better with a pan down, to get the goose''s reflection in the ripply water.</td>', 'Unfortunate the the beak is a little oof, always the first place my eye goes after the eye.  Very nice pose with the raindrops & circles.  I think this shot would be even better with a pan down, to get the goose''s reflection in the ripply water.', '2005-08-18 13:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621300, 217880, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the black space behind the woman, I think this shot would be much more attractive to me with a pan to the left to increase the negative space.  Maybe to get the right side just to the right of the statue.</td>', 'I like the black space behind the woman, I think this shot would be much more attractive to me with a pan to the left to increase the negative space.  Maybe to get the right side just to the right of the statue.', '2005-08-18 13:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621315, 217910, 35357, '<td valign="top">I would pan a bit to the left, to her collar or hat.  Not a very rainy shot, but a very cute kid.  I like the focus &amp; dof.</td>', 'I would pan a bit to the left, to her collar or hat.  Not a very rainy shot, but a very cute kid.  I like the focus & dof.', '2005-08-18 13:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621401, 216736, 31543, '<td valign="top">The way the sharpness of the image refines really draws you into the detail of the building.  I love this!</td>', 'The way the sharpness of the image refines really draws you into the detail of the building.  I love this!', '2005-08-18 14:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621421, 217875, 18219, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I can see any rain.<br/>But, I really like the effect you have here.<br/>The color is good also.<br/>And the overall clarity of the image.</td>', 'I don''t think I can see any rain.But, I really like the effect you have here.The color is good also.And the overall clarity of the image.', '2005-08-18 14:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621427, 217482, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice colors and composition and crispness and clearness and clarity.<br/>I can''t think of anything else begining with C :-)</td>', 'nice colors and composition and crispness and clearness and clarity.I can''t think of anything else begining with C :-)', '2005-08-18 14:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621431, 217555, 18219, '<td valign="top">looks like cookies and milk!!!!!<br/>But a nice capture all the same.<br/>Very good.</td>', 'looks like cookies and milk!!!!!But a nice capture all the same.Very good.', '2005-08-18 14:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621432, 218050, 18219, '<td valign="top">I thought they were roaches at first!!!!<br/>Nice title and subject matter.</td>', 'I thought they were roaches at first!!!!Nice title and subject matter.', '2005-08-18 14:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621481, 218043, 35804, '<td valign="top">Such a dynamic compostion...I really like the depth and "drama" of this image...very nice.</td>', 'Such a dynamic compostion...I really like the depth and "drama" of this image...very nice.', '2005-08-18 14:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621483, 217965, 35804, '<td valign="top">What a fun image...the focus is "magical"...pretty sparkle and shimmer.</td>', 'What a fun image...the focus is "magical"...pretty sparkle and shimmer.', '2005-08-18 14:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621487, 217389, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like the deep rich cool tones of this picture...very nice focus too...the brightness of the fruit against the coldness of the day is so striking...nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the deep rich cool tones of this picture...very nice focus too...the brightness of the fruit against the coldness of the day is so striking...nicely done.', '2005-08-18 14:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621489, 216724, 35804, '<td valign="top">Love the light on the slick cobblestone road, the B &amp; W is a really nice choice...well done.</td>', 'Love the light on the slick cobblestone road, the B & W is a really nice choice...well done.', '2005-08-18 14:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621493, 217029, 35804, '<td valign="top">What a silly pup!  : } Such a fun summertime picture.</td>', 'What a silly pup!  : } Such a fun summertime picture.', '2005-08-18 14:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
