(1621891, 217595, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Wish the rainbow was a little more visible, but love the contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Wish the rainbow was a little more visible, but love the contrast.', '2005-08-18 18:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621896, 216442, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but the title really detracts IMHO.  You''ve got great emotion and color.</td>', 'Great capture, but the title really detracts IMHO.  You''ve got great emotion and color.', '2005-08-18 18:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621898, 217929, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic focus.  Nice tones &amp; composition - the sky is terrific.</td>', 'Fantastic focus.  Nice tones & composition - the sky is terrific.', '2005-08-18 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621899, 217159, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - don''t care for the border.  Good composition and color though.</td>', 'Nice capture - don''t care for the border.  Good composition and color though.', '2005-08-18 18:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621901, 217764, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great focus &amp; color.  Really nice composition too.</td>', 'Great focus & color.  Really nice composition too.', '2005-08-18 18:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621903, 217257, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and focus.  Great DOF too.  The only thing I don''t care for about this shot is the "centered" composition.  Otherwise, terrific.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and focus.  Great DOF too.  The only thing I don''t care for about this shot is the "centered" composition.  Otherwise, terrific.', '2005-08-18 18:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621905, 217927, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the Monet-esque feel to this photo.  The colors are great, unfortunate that the upper part is blown out, but that may just add to the image.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the Monet-esque feel to this photo.  The colors are great, unfortunate that the upper part is blown out, but that may just add to the image.  Well done.', '2005-08-18 18:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621906, 215241, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but looks overprocessed to me.  The colors aren''t quite right (mountains too blue, ground too yellow-brown).</td>', 'Nice composition, but looks overprocessed to me.  The colors aren''t quite right (mountains too blue, ground too yellow-brown).', '2005-08-18 18:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621908, 217971, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and focus.  very natural color too.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice DOF and focus.  very natural color too.  Nice job.', '2005-08-18 18:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621909, 215363, 29490, '<td valign="top">Captures "Rain" quite well.   I think a little more dof would work for me, but I''d have to see the final result to be sure.  Overall a good photo.</td>', 'Captures "Rain" quite well.   I think a little more dof would work for me, but I''d have to see the final result to be sure.  Overall a good photo.', '2005-08-18 18:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621913, 216766, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Love the colors and nice clean focus.  Wish the big white letters weren''t on the barn though.  :-)</td>', 'Great capture.  Love the colors and nice clean focus.  Wish the big white letters weren''t on the barn though.  :-)', '2005-08-18 18:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621916, 217846, 29490, '<td valign="top">One of my faves!  Nice subject matter, nice fog, nice colors, nice hills fading in the background.  I like how the center fella is the only one with a white face, it adds to the photo.</td>', 'One of my faves!  Nice subject matter, nice fog, nice colors, nice hills fading in the background.  I like how the center fella is the only one with a white face, it adds to the photo.', '2005-08-18 18:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621917, 217840, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great colors and focus on the rain soaked glass.  Not sure that it has enough to stand on its own though.  Don''t get me wrong - it''s a very pleasing image.</td>', 'Great colors and focus on the rain soaked glass.  Not sure that it has enough to stand on its own though.  Don''t get me wrong - it''s a very pleasing image.', '2005-08-18 18:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621918, 217891, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great focus &amp; DOF.  Nice color too.  Good job.</td>', 'Great focus & DOF.  Nice color too.  Good job.', '2005-08-18 18:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621921, 217866, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very appealing composition.  Fantastic sky &amp; clouds.  Good job.</td>', 'Very appealing composition.  Fantastic sky & clouds.  Good job.', '2005-08-18 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621923, 216617, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this image, and the colors are very good.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the softness of this image, and the colors are very good.  Well done.', '2005-08-18 18:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621925, 216749, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  The highlights are a little bright, but you certainly got a lot of emotion packed into the image.  Good job.</td>', 'Great capture!  The highlights are a little bright, but you certainly got a lot of emotion packed into the image.  Good job.', '2005-08-18 18:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621927, 216354, 29490, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the umbrella.  I like the color scheme, it''s very pleasing, and the crop is superb.  Well done!</td>', 'Great focus on the umbrella.  I like the color scheme, it''s very pleasing, and the crop is superb.  Well done!', '2005-08-18 18:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621930, 217739, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  The dead leaves and the "life-giving" water make for good contrast.  The colors are great.  Nice job.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  The dead leaves and the "life-giving" water make for good contrast.  The colors are great.  Nice job.  Bumping up.', '2005-08-18 18:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621933, 217983, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cute girl.  Nice colors and composition too.</td>', 'Cute girl.  Nice colors and composition too.', '2005-08-18 18:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621935, 218043, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Love the grunge feel.  Very emotive.</td>', 'Great shot.  Love the grunge feel.  Very emotive.', '2005-08-18 18:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621936, 217779, 29490, '<td valign="top">b/w is perfect for this shot.  The only disconcerting element is the height of the fence, but I don''t think you had much control over that and still be able to get part of the person''s face.  Nice shot.</td>', 'b/w is perfect for this shot.  The only disconcerting element is the height of the fence, but I don''t think you had much control over that and still be able to get part of the person''s face.  Nice shot.', '2005-08-18 18:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621938, 216382, 34659, '<td valign="top">Good DOF.  I think the colors could be bumped up a notch, but great focus and I like the lighting on the water droplets.</td>', 'Good DOF.  I think the colors could be bumped up a notch, but great focus and I like the lighting on the water droplets.', '2005-08-18 18:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621940, 217140, 34659, '<td valign="top">Boy - that''s coming down hard &amp; heavy!  Great color &amp; composition.  Good focus too.</td>', 'Boy - that''s coming down hard & heavy!  Great color & composition.  Good focus too.', '2005-08-18 18:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621943, 216899, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines and focus.  Not sure the B/W works well here though - could just be me!  :-)  Still, a very surprisingly emotive shot.</td>', 'Beautiful lines and focus.  Not sure the B/W works well here though - could just be me!  :-)  Still, a very surprisingly emotive shot.', '2005-08-18 18:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621947, 216561, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I love little white call ducks.  Good color and focus.  Great composition.</td>', 'Great capture.  I love little white call ducks.  Good color and focus.  Great composition.', '2005-08-18 18:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621948, 217485, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of selective desat.  Powerful image - very gloomy and foreboding.</td>', 'Very effective use of selective desat.  Powerful image - very gloomy and foreboding.', '2005-08-18 18:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621949, 216023, 41504, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this image.  The single drop reflecting the surroundings is good &amp; the flower has good detail.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this image.  The single drop reflecting the surroundings is good & the flower has good detail.', '2005-08-18 18:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621951, 217818, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Unfortunately, I think you''re good image may get lost in the deluge of leaf &amp; water droplet shots.  Hopefully it won''t though.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Unfortunately, I think you''re good image may get lost in the deluge of leaf & water droplet shots.  Hopefully it won''t though.  Good job.', '2005-08-18 18:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621952, 217601, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nothing sticks out as a defining subject in this shot.   I''d recommend making use of most of the 640 pixels available instead of less than half, it might make this shot snap.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nothing sticks out as a defining subject in this shot.   I''d recommend making use of most of the 640 pixels available instead of less than half, it might make this shot snap.  Good luck!', '2005-08-18 18:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621953, 216453, 41504, '<td valign="top">Really like the detail &amp; color in this.  The DOF is really effective.</td>', 'Really like the detail & color in this.  The DOF is really effective.', '2005-08-18 18:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621955, 217889, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great focus &amp; DOF.  Nice vivid color too.  good job.</td>', 'Great focus & DOF.  Nice vivid color too.  good job.', '2005-08-18 18:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621957, 216045, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Surprisingly appealing image too.  Nice job.</td>', 'Cute idea.  Surprisingly appealing image too.  Nice job.', '2005-08-18 18:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621963, 217323, 34659, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I think it lost something in the translation.  Just doesn''t have as much appeal as I think it should.  Still, you met the challenge and it''s not a bad shot.  5</td>', 'Good idea, but I think it lost something in the translation.  Just doesn''t have as much appeal as I think it should.  Still, you met the challenge and it''s not a bad shot.  5', '2005-08-18 18:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621964, 217738, 29490, '<td valign="top">The image seems a little dark and it''s hard to discern the rain.  I like the idea, and the color scheme works well.</td>', 'The image seems a little dark and it''s hard to discern the rain.  I like the idea, and the color scheme works well.', '2005-08-18 18:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621965, 217868, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus, DOF, &amp; natural colors.  Very appealing lines too.  Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful focus, DOF, & natural colors.  Very appealing lines too.  Nice job.', '2005-08-18 18:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621967, 217253, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, but I think it may get lost in the deluge of water droplet covered flowers in this challenge.  Your focus &amp; DOF are good, but not sure it has enough "pop" to rise above the masses.</td>', 'Really nice shot, but I think it may get lost in the deluge of water droplet covered flowers in this challenge.  Your focus & DOF are good, but not sure it has enough "pop" to rise above the masses.', '2005-08-18 18:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621971, 217144, 34659, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title.  It''s a pretty good shot though - nice focus &amp; color.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title.  It''s a pretty good shot though - nice focus & color.', '2005-08-18 18:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621973, 216045, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  The green clumps of grass are distracting, as is the piece of trash next to the umbrella.  Perhaps a different crop would and some cloning could change that.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like the idea.  The green clumps of grass are distracting, as is the piece of trash next to the umbrella.  Perhaps a different crop would and some cloning could change that.  Good luck!', '2005-08-18 18:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621975, 217643, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think you were successful in establishing a mood in this piece, but I think that the focus works against you.  Also, the colors seem a little washed out - no pun intended.  Still, like I said, you certainly created an emotive shot.</td>', 'I think you were successful in establishing a mood in this piece, but I think that the focus works against you.  Also, the colors seem a little washed out - no pun intended.  Still, like I said, you certainly created an emotive shot.', '2005-08-18 18:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621979, 216760, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think this shot has potential, but the centered composition doesn''t work well IMHO.  Also, I think you could bump up the color a notch or two.  Last thing is that the highlights are a little harsh.  BUT, it does successfully establish a mood and it''s a shot that most people can identify with.</td>', 'I think this shot has potential, but the centered composition doesn''t work well IMHO.  Also, I think you could bump up the color a notch or two.  Last thing is that the highlights are a little harsh.  BUT, it does successfully establish a mood and it''s a shot that most people can identify with.', '2005-08-18 18:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621981, 218102, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the colors;  the crop really makes this shot work.</td>', 'I like the colors;  the crop really makes this shot work.', '2005-08-18 18:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621983, 215778, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at.  You''ve got pretty good focus - I can tell there''s water there - but the image as a whole isn''t that appealing to me.  Not sure why - other than I don''t know what I''m viewing and that the colors could be bumped up a notch or two as well.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at.  You''ve got pretty good focus - I can tell there''s water there - but the image as a whole isn''t that appealing to me.  Not sure why - other than I don''t know what I''m viewing and that the colors could be bumped up a notch or two as well.', '2005-08-18 18:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621989, 217887, 34659, '<td valign="top">Met the challenge, but not a very appealing image.  Just seems a bit flat to me.  You have captured a pretty good reflection, but I''m not sure it''ll have enough appeal to the average viewer.</td>', 'Met the challenge, but not a very appealing image.  Just seems a bit flat to me.  You have captured a pretty good reflection, but I''m not sure it''ll have enough appeal to the average viewer.', '2005-08-18 18:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621990, 217590, 34659, '<td valign="top">Powerful image.  Great composition - although the crop may be a bit tight.  The colors look a little overprocessed, but otherwise a very appealing shot.</td>', 'Powerful image.  Great composition - although the crop may be a bit tight.  The colors look a little overprocessed, but otherwise a very appealing shot.', '2005-08-18 18:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621995, 215854, 34659, '<td valign="top">Met the challenge and it''s a pretty good shot.  Unfortunately though, it just doesn''t have a lot of universal appeal.  The highlights are a bit harsh too.  Still, good focus and DOF.</td>', 'Met the challenge and it''s a pretty good shot.  Unfortunately though, it just doesn''t have a lot of universal appeal.  The highlights are a bit harsh too.  Still, good focus and DOF.', '2005-08-18 18:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621996, 216530, 29490, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a lot of water coming down, you''ve captured rain very well.  The branches are a good reference point for what we''re seeing.  Good job and good luck.</td>', 'Now that''s a lot of water coming down, you''ve captured rain very well.  The branches are a good reference point for what we''re seeing.  Good job and good luck.', '2005-08-18 18:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622000, 216023, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very appealing image, but the graininess of the background is distracting.  The fact that you caught the water droplet mid-air is very cool though.  I also think you could bump up the color a notch.</td>', 'Very appealing image, but the graininess of the background is distracting.  The fact that you caught the water droplet mid-air is very cool though.  I also think you could bump up the color a notch.', '2005-08-18 18:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622002, 215961, 34659, '<td valign="top">Looks like the same little girl that''s in a color shot.  I like the composition a lot, but the blown highlights are a distraction.</td>', 'Looks like the same little girl that''s in a color shot.  I like the composition a lot, but the blown highlights are a distraction.', '2005-08-18 18:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622008, 216920, 29490, '<td valign="top">Great composition and perfect crop.</td>', 'Great composition and perfect crop.', '2005-08-18 18:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622009, 218054, 29490, '<td valign="top">I think a greater dof would help, the oof fly doesn''t do it for me.   The yellow seems a little muted.  Overall excellent idea, good luck.</td>', 'I think a greater dof would help, the oof fly doesn''t do it for me.   The yellow seems a little muted.  Overall excellent idea, good luck.', '2005-08-18 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622028, 218050, 9576, '<td valign="top">Nice one, right title good luck ;-)</td>', 'Nice one, right title good luck ;-)', '2005-08-18 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622029, 217110, 9576, '<td valign="top">It is a very cool shoot, simple and good balance 8</td>', 'It is a very cool shoot, simple and good balance 8', '2005-08-18 18:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622033, 217973, 34659, '<td valign="top">Something about this shot doesn''t seem quite right to me.  It''s got great color and I like the composition.  Good focus &amp; DOF too - so I''m not quite sure what it is...  (Sorry I can''t be more specific.  Maybe it''s the odd color glow in the background?)  Still, a pleasing and good image.<br/> <br/>EDIT:  Ya know - I think I figured out what bothers me about this shot.  It''s that the background color too closely resembles the beautiful colors on the petals.  It''s a lovely shade of pinks &amp; whites, but the fact that the background is saturated with essentially the same tones, it makes the whole color less dramatic.  (If that makes sense...)  If the background were darker, it would really allow the colors of the petals to shine on their own - so to speak.  Make sense?</td>', 'Something about this shot doesn''t seem quite right to me.  It''s got great color and I like the composition.  Good focus & DOF too - so I''m not quite sure what it is...  (Sorry I can''t be more specific.  Maybe it''s the odd color glow in the background?)  Still, a pleasing and good image. EDIT:  Ya know - I think I figured out what bothers me about this shot.  It''s that the background color too closely resembles the beautiful colors on the petals.  It''s a lovely shade of pinks & whites, but the fact that the background is saturated with essentially the same tones, it makes the whole color less dramatic.  (If that makes sense...)  If the background were darker, it would really allow the colors of the petals to shine on their own - so to speak.  Make sense?', '2005-08-18 18:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622034, 218065, 9576, '<td valign="top">Very very good I was planning for something similar but vent in a another direction 9</td>', 'Very very good I was planning for something similar but vent in a another direction 9', '2005-08-18 18:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622036, 217554, 9576, '<td valign="top">A litle bit noice but good shoot</td>', 'A litle bit noice but good shoot', '2005-08-18 18:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622037, 216453, 9576, '<td valign="top">The colours are very good</td>', 'The colours are very good', '2005-08-18 18:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622066, 216389, 6999, '<td valign="top">Marvellous - I almost just hit a score and passed on, but this has real depth and soul to it I think. And it has mystery, and a grittiness that speaks of a real world, rather than the fantasy cleaned-up version we get round here so much. It prompts a raft of questions and wonderings - perhaps a raft the kid could have used right then?</td>', 'Marvellous - I almost just hit a score and passed on, but this has real depth and soul to it I think. And it has mystery, and a grittiness that speaks of a real world, rather than the fantasy cleaned-up version we get round here so much. It prompts a raft of questions and wonderings - perhaps a raft the kid could have used right then?', '2005-08-18 19:14:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1622072, 216453, 6999, '<td valign="top">There are just <i>so</i> many of these shots in this challenge; there''s good stuff here - the detail and exposure of the main subject leaf is really well executed, and the sense of reflected light is strong. The de-sat of the background annoys me - just a personal thing, but it feels like being forced into the image, where it should draw me of its own merits.</td>', 'There are just so many of these shots in this challenge; there''s good stuff here - the detail and exposure of the main subject leaf is really well executed, and the sense of reflected light is strong. The de-sat of the background annoys me - just a personal thing, but it feels like being forced into the image, where it should draw me of its own merits.', '2005-08-18 19:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622078, 216104, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a spectacular photograph.  Masterful composition; every element is carefully positioned, and is contributing to the whole.  There''s nothing uncertain and nothing wasted.  (I don''t think it''s going too far to compare it to good classical music, from a compositional point of view ... makes me think of "Night on the Bare Mountain'' by Mussorgsky).  Terrific tonal range, with satisfying detail throughout.  Also a fascinating range of textures.  It''s an image filled with interest and reward for the viewer who cares to give it a couple of minutes'' study.  For example, if that''s a rain guage on the second post, it''s a very clever inclusion.  I only choose one 10 and this is it.  (I suppose some will quibble about the sharpening artifacts on the barbed wire, but I think the extra definition was necessary in this case)</td>', 'This is a spectacular photograph.  Masterful composition; every element is carefully positioned, and is contributing to the whole.  There''s nothing uncertain and nothing wasted.  (I don''t think it''s going too far to compare it to good classical music, from a compositional point of view ... makes me think of "Night on the Bare Mountain'' by Mussorgsky).  Terrific tonal range, with satisfying detail throughout.  Also a fascinating range of textures.  It''s an image filled with interest and reward for the viewer who cares to give it a couple of minutes'' study.  For example, if that''s a rain guage on the second post, it''s a very clever inclusion.  I only choose one 10 and this is it.  (I suppose some will quibble about the sharpening artifacts on the barbed wire, but I think the extra definition was necessary in this case)', '2005-08-18 19:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622079, 216865, 23891, '<td valign="top">All my spider photographs are overexposed too :-) The camera just wants to expose for the dark that makes up 98% of the frame. Exposure compensation -2/3 stop might help.</td>', 'All my spider photographs are overexposed too :-) The camera just wants to expose for the dark that makes up 98% of the frame. Exposure compensation -2/3 stop might help.', '2005-08-18 19:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622088, 217855, 23891, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! I only wish I could see the kicker''s face a little more. She looks really ferocious. Perfect shutter speed.</td>', 'I love this photo! I only wish I could see the kicker''s face a little more. She looks really ferocious. Perfect shutter speed.', '2005-08-18 19:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622119, 216363, 38997, '<td valign="top">awesome shot! could be in national geographic</td>', 'awesome shot! could be in national geographic', '2005-08-18 19:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622122, 216442, 32345, '<td valign="top">Great picture, even if I don''t like the title I gave it a score according to the quality of your entry.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great picture, even if I don''t like the title I gave it a score according to the quality of your entry.  Good luck.', '2005-08-18 19:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622131, 218050, 811, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot, and moreso because you got it with water in the picture.  Kinda a desolation with hope type shot.</td>', 'Powerful shot, and moreso because you got it with water in the picture.  Kinda a desolation with hope type shot.', '2005-08-18 19:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622140, 217651, 25754, '<td valign="top">Looks a slight bit out of focus to me. I like the background colours. I''d probably crop a bit more to fill the frame with the leaves.</td>', 'Looks a slight bit out of focus to me. I like the background colours. I''d probably crop a bit more to fill the frame with the leaves.', '2005-08-18 19:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622142, 218058, 32345, '<td valign="top">I really love the feeling of this picture, it''s just too bad that you have these out-of-focus leaves at the top. I still give it a decent score (above 50%) Good Luck</td>', 'I really love the feeling of this picture, it''s just too bad that you have these out-of-focus leaves at the top. I still give it a decent score (above 50%) Good Luck', '2005-08-18 19:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622144, 216561, 33379, '<td valign="top">excellent shot, good luck!</td>', 'excellent shot, good luck!', '2005-08-18 19:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622148, 216920, 25754, '<td valign="top">very cute. i like the bubbling effect of the raindrops on the water.</td>', 'very cute. i like the bubbling effect of the raindrops on the water.', '2005-08-18 19:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622150, 216010, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrasts between the signs and nature.  Perhaps a bit too much sky for my own personal taste, but interesting nonethelessl</td>', 'Interesting contrasts between the signs and nature.  Perhaps a bit too much sky for my own personal taste, but interesting nonethelessl', '2005-08-18 19:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622152, 215552, 33379, '<td valign="top">this would be great but wheres the rain?</td>', 'this would be great but wheres the rain?', '2005-08-18 20:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622157, 216363, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The coloring of this shot really helps to add a foreboding feeling to it, I think.</td>', 'Great capture.  The coloring of this shot really helps to add a foreboding feeling to it, I think.', '2005-08-18 20:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622160, 216431, 20115, '<td valign="top">wonderful</td>', 'wonderful', '2005-08-18 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
