(1622180, 217880, 811, '<td valign="top">The red of the flowers and the hummingbird feeder gives a nice sense of color to the shot.  Overall, I think a slightly sharper focus would have helped make this a truly effective shot.</td>', 'The red of the flowers and the hummingbird feeder gives a nice sense of color to the shot.  Overall, I think a slightly sharper focus would have helped make this a truly effective shot.', '2005-08-18 20:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622182, 215961, 29490, '<td valign="top">I really like this capture.  The focus is great and the crop does wonders.  B/W really adds to the impact.  The only problem I see is the skin blown out below the clavicle, perhaps a little burning would help that.  Other than that a wonderful photo.  Guessing this is CalliopeKel''s girl...</td>', 'I really like this capture.  The focus is great and the crop does wonders.  B/W really adds to the impact.  The only problem I see is the skin blown out below the clavicle, perhaps a little burning would help that.  Other than that a wonderful photo.  Guessing this is CalliopeKel''s girl...', '2005-08-18 20:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622187, 217948, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shades of blue.  I think the shot would have been even more interesting if it had something or somewhere for the eye to rest instead of wandering through the whole frame.</td>', 'Nice shades of blue.  I think the shot would have been even more interesting if it had something or somewhere for the eye to rest instead of wandering through the whole frame.', '2005-08-18 20:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622191, 218026, 811, '<td valign="top">The beautiful read makes for a nice abstract.  I like how the petal "flows" through the frame.</td>', 'The beautiful read makes for a nice abstract.  I like how the petal "flows" through the frame.', '2005-08-18 20:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622198, 217779, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice black adn white.  The composition is a little static to me, but I really can''t put my finger on what exactly should be changed.</td>', 'Nice black adn white.  The composition is a little static to me, but I really can''t put my finger on what exactly should be changed.', '2005-08-18 20:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622209, 217910, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cute shot &amp; girl.  The graininess of the image is a little distracting and her mittened hand looks overly large.  Still, a nice shot.</td>', 'Cute shot & girl.  The graininess of the image is a little distracting and her mittened hand looks overly large.  Still, a nice shot.', '2005-08-18 20:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622210, 218103, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong use of that big curve compositionally. I wonder if the massive contrast mightn''t be taking things too far - throwing out the baby with the rainwater, perhaps; maybe less of that would allow some stringer degrees of tone to show through, and perhaps take the water on the road less to burn-out point. I think this level of black/white runs too contrary to the scene you''ve captured, almost I can feel the greyness of that susurban world trying to get out through it.</td>', 'Strong use of that big curve compositionally. I wonder if the massive contrast mightn''t be taking things too far - throwing out the baby with the rainwater, perhaps; maybe less of that would allow some stringer degrees of tone to show through, and perhaps take the water on the road less to burn-out point. I think this level of black/white runs too contrary to the scene you''ve captured, almost I can feel the greyness of that susurban world trying to get out through it.', '2005-08-18 20:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1622214, 217790, 34659, '<td valign="top">Shot has possibilities, but OOF really detracts from shot.</td>', 'Shot has possibilities, but OOF really detracts from shot.', '2005-08-18 20:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
