(1622622, 218070, 34659, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a shot that really grabs me, yet I do think there are aspects that are noteworthy.  I think it''s great of the actual rain.  Not sure what the protruding object is in the bottom of the photograph - a rain gauge?  Also, the light is distracting - too bright and invasive.  Like I said though - it''s still a somewhat pleasing shot and a difficult one to comment on.</td>', 'This isn''t a shot that really grabs me, yet I do think there are aspects that are noteworthy.  I think it''s great of the actual rain.  Not sure what the protruding object is in the bottom of the photograph - a rain gauge?  Also, the light is distracting - too bright and invasive.  Like I said though - it''s still a somewhat pleasing shot and a difficult one to comment on.', '2005-08-18 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
