(1623142, 216659, 7531, '<td valign="top">Afraid it''s a little, ok no let me be honest here, it''s a boring composition! I see where you are coming from, but it is often better to get the subject and the reflection in the shot together. Also for most images this sort of wide angle 16:9 crop suits panarama type scenes much better.</td>', 'Afraid it''s a little, ok no let me be honest here, it''s a boring composition! I see where you are coming from, but it is often better to get the subject and the reflection in the shot together. Also for most images this sort of wide angle 16:9 crop suits panarama type scenes much better.', '2005-08-19 04:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
