(1623243, 217323, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s an imression like something out of space to this - like an asteroid belt in a movie, or something - that odd swirl of droplets, almost like there are two panes of glass, one behind the other - and of course one can see in the reflections that this is simply the real world. Not an uncommon idea for a shot, but pretty well done this time.</td>', 'There''s an imression like something out of space to this - like an asteroid belt in a movie, or something - that odd swirl of droplets, almost like there are two panes of glass, one behind the other - and of course one can see in the reflections that this is simply the real world. Not an uncommon idea for a shot, but pretty well done this time.', '2005-08-19 05:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623246, 217497, 6999, '<td valign="top">There seem almost to be only four or five categories of shot in this challenge. I would have this as the best of the vehicles spraying water category - love the almost tunnel-like shape of the spray here, and the colour tones.</td>', 'There seem almost to be only four or five categories of shot in this challenge. I would have this as the best of the vehicles spraying water category - love the almost tunnel-like shape of the spray here, and the colour tones.', '2005-08-19 05:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
