(1623324, 217921, 33379, '<td valign="top">omg, this is..i''m speechless. ok i''m ready to comment! maybe not, but i''ll give you a 10 :)</td>', 'omg, this is..i''m speechless. ok i''m ready to comment! maybe not, but i''ll give you a 10 :)', '2005-08-19 08:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623383, 216764, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the expression you''ve caught, feels carefree to me, nice emotive shot.</td>', 'I like the expression you''ve caught, feels carefree to me, nice emotive shot.', '2005-08-19 09:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623385, 217644, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice action, but I think to make this shot really good it needs someone, or something getting splashed.</td>', 'Nice action, but I think to make this shot really good it needs someone, or something getting splashed.', '2005-08-19 09:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623387, 218065, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet plant/flower shot.  The focus on the droplets is wonderful. I love the oof background colours, they are very complimentary to the sharp subject colours.  Great job!</td>', 'Another wet plant/flower shot.  The focus on the droplets is wonderful. I love the oof background colours, they are very complimentary to the sharp subject colours.  Great job!', '2005-08-19 09:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623390, 216760, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC... :-(<br/> <br/>Sorry, there''s no rain or attempt to simulate rain.  As the shot stands, I liket the centred composition, it works for me with the winding path.  Nice focus &amp; pose of subject too.</td>', 'DNMC... :-( Sorry, there''s no rain or attempt to simulate rain.  As the shot stands, I liket the centred composition, it works for me with the winding path.  Nice focus & pose of subject too.', '2005-08-19 09:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623396, 217987, 35357, '<td valign="top">There''s not much aesthetically pleasing to me in this shot, but I do think you composed it quite well with natural framing and making the rain runoff into a leading line.</td>', 'There''s not much aesthetically pleasing to me in this shot, but I do think you composed it quite well with natural framing and making the rain runoff into a leading line.', '2005-08-19 09:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623410, 217983, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC... :-(<br/> <br/>Fantastic shot, simply beautiful.  I love the way you''ve split it into solid colours at top &amp; bottom to fram her face.  Very cute how she''s holding the umbrella too.  This definitely belongs on the family room wall!  Unfortunately, I see no rain, so am scoring this a 4, sorry. :-(</td>', 'DNMC... :-( Fantastic shot, simply beautiful.  I love the way you''ve split it into solid colours at top & bottom to fram her face.  Very cute how she''s holding the umbrella too.  This definitely belongs on the family room wall!  Unfortunately, I see no rain, so am scoring this a 4, sorry. :-(', '2005-08-19 09:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623412, 217310, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC... :-(<br/> <br/>No rain in your shot, sorry.  I love the colour and lighting on the field.</td>', 'DNMC... :-( No rain in your shot, sorry.  I love the colour and lighting on the field.', '2005-08-19 09:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623417, 217554, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice droplet catch.  Pretty grainy for my taste.</td>', 'Nice droplet catch.  Pretty grainy for my taste.', '2005-08-19 09:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623422, 217902, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of every day life people sheltering during a downpour.  Very good for the challenge to include a lot of foreground splashing.</td>', 'Nice catch of every day life people sheltering during a downpour.  Very good for the challenge to include a lot of foreground splashing.', '2005-08-19 09:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623432, 217389, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the rain drop streaks and dof.  Nice, dark shades of green augment the fruit.  Personally, not a lot of interest for me.</td>', 'I like the rain drop streaks and dof.  Nice, dark shades of green augment the fruit.  Personally, not a lot of interest for me.', '2005-08-19 09:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623436, 216271, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, but not much interest for me.</td>', 'Nicely composed, but not much interest for me.', '2005-08-19 09:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623443, 215693, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the subject (overflowing water and disjointed pipe) but the background detracts a lot.  If it were possible, I think this shot would be imporved by a pan to the right, so the curves of the pipe would be followed.  Of course, there was probably something preventing this, I realise.</td>', 'I like the subject (overflowing water and disjointed pipe) but the background detracts a lot.  If it were possible, I think this shot would be imporved by a pan to the right, so the curves of the pipe would be followed.  Of course, there was probably something preventing this, I realise.', '2005-08-19 09:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623446, 218070, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the rain streaks, but the lighting is a bit too blown for my taste in this case.  Also, I can''t tell what the object  is.  A thermometer or a building?  I have no reference for scale or context, and I don''t think this is really an abstract shot.</td>', 'I like the rain streaks, but the lighting is a bit too blown for my taste in this case.  Also, I can''t tell what the object  is.  A thermometer or a building?  I have no reference for scale or context, and I don''t think this is really an abstract shot.', '2005-08-19 09:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623450, 217961, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet plant/flower shot.  It is interesting, though.  I''ve never seen anything like this before.  I like the focus and flow from the corner to the dro in the triangle.  Mostly, I like the exotic plant.</td>', 'Another wet plant/flower shot.  It is interesting, though.  I''ve never seen anything like this before.  I like the focus and flow from the corner to the dro in the triangle.  Mostly, I like the exotic plant.', '2005-08-19 09:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623454, 216644, 35357, '<td valign="top">Rather a depressing feel to this shot, though there isn''t anything of interest to me about it, it does catch the feel for me, so, good job!</td>', 'Rather a depressing feel to this shot, though there isn''t anything of interest to me about it, it does catch the feel for me, so, good job!', '2005-08-19 09:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623456, 217481, 35357, '<td valign="top">Great catch!  The subject is very interesting and caught in a perfect, candid pose.  Very nicely framed &amp; focused.</td>', 'Great catch!  The subject is very interesting and caught in a perfect, candid pose.  Very nicely framed & focused.', '2005-08-19 09:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623461, 217209, 35357, '<td valign="top">Compostion for this subject is technically very nice, as is the flow.  The subject is a little bland.</td>', 'Compostion for this subject is technically very nice, as is the flow.  The subject is a little bland.', '2005-08-19 09:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623463, 216767, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet flower shot.  Nice flower shot, but it has little interest for me.</td>', 'Another wet flower shot.  Nice flower shot, but it has little interest for me.', '2005-08-19 09:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623478, 217450, 15711, '<td valign="top">The white fence makes the shot.  Lovely coloration - deep and brooding like the storm.  Nicely done. I''m reviewing all the thumbnails again and this is a stand out with the the great contrast..  I like that you didn''t go black and white, although it is almost devoid of color.  I''m upping my vote to 9</td>', 'The white fence makes the shot.  Lovely coloration - deep and brooding like the storm.  Nicely done. I''m reviewing all the thumbnails again and this is a stand out with the the great contrast..  I like that you didn''t go black and white, although it is almost devoid of color.  I''m upping my vote to 9', '2005-08-19 09:50:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1623481, 217904, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, but would probably be improved without the on-coming car and windshield in front of the camera.  Without those two problems this shot would have a very nice, misty feel.</td>', 'Nicely composed, but would probably be improved without the on-coming car and windshield in front of the camera.  Without those two problems this shot would have a very nice, misty feel.', '2005-08-19 09:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623483, 216617, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflection. Perfect title (I remember the scene in the movie). Lovely softness to it.<br/> <br/>I''m reviewing the thumbnails again and this is a stand out.  The white of the gazebo against the muted deeper tones is just so strikingly beautiful.  The hint of the tree silhouettes in the dark background is a nice touch. Think I''ll go sing "Sixteen Going on Seventeen." Thanks for a beautiful image. 9</td>', 'Lovely reflection. Perfect title (I remember the scene in the movie). Lovely softness to it. I''m reviewing the thumbnails again and this is a stand out.  The white of the gazebo against the muted deeper tones is just so strikingly beautiful.  The hint of the tree silhouettes in the dark background is a nice touch. Think I''ll go sing "Sixteen Going on Seventeen." Thanks for a beautiful image. 9', '2005-08-19 09:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623487, 218098, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet flower shot.  There is some action to it, and I think this setup was a very good idea.  I''d prefer a dof to include the foreground water in focus.</td>', 'Another wet flower shot.  There is some action to it, and I think this setup was a very good idea.  I''d prefer a dof to include the foreground water in focus.', '2005-08-19 09:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623488, 217253, 15711, '<td valign="top">The white on white with a hint of yellow is lovely.  I love the macro.  Great job.<br/> <br/>I''m reviewing the thumbnails again and this is still an eye catching shot.  It''s amazing how many colors you can get with white.  The intensity of the drops is perfect.  This needs to be a huge poster!!! 9</td>', 'The white on white with a hint of yellow is lovely.  I love the macro.  Great job. I''m reviewing the thumbnails again and this is still an eye catching shot.  It''s amazing how many colors you can get with white.  The intensity of the drops is perfect.  This needs to be a huge poster!!! 9', '2005-08-19 09:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623489, 217779, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I like everything about this one.  The umbrella right above the line of the metal gate is great. Perfect lighting. You can een see the droplets from far away.  Really really good. On 2nd review, I''m still enjoying this shot alot.  The title couldn''t be more appropriate! 9</td>', 'Great capture. I like everything about this one.  The umbrella right above the line of the metal gate is great. Perfect lighting. You can een see the droplets from far away.  Really really good. On 2nd review, I''m still enjoying this shot alot.  The title couldn''t be more appropriate! 9', '2005-08-19 09:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623491, 215552, 15711, '<td valign="top">GREAT! I bet I know who did this too.  The blue against the charcoal and grey is awesome.  The angle works perfectly. Ok - this gets my 10!!! <br/> <br/>On reviewing the thumbnails again, this stands out with the white of the Converse and the wonderful tonality of the indigo of the jeans and umbrella. (Joey is that you??) <br/></td>', 'GREAT! I bet I know who did this too.  The blue against the charcoal and grey is awesome.  The angle works perfectly. Ok - this gets my 10!!!  On reviewing the thumbnails again, this stands out with the white of the Converse and the wonderful tonality of the indigo of the jeans and umbrella. (Joey is that you??) ', '2005-08-19 09:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623494, 216050, 35357, '<td valign="top">A very unusual shot.  Very interesting subject.  I''d prefer a pan to the right.  Kind of reminds me of the famous Marilyn Monroe shot.  Very strange.  I''ll be checking back after the challenge to see if you have an explanatino for this phenomenon.  Great catch.</td>', 'A very unusual shot.  Very interesting subject.  I''d prefer a pan to the right.  Kind of reminds me of the famous Marilyn Monroe shot.  Very strange.  I''ll be checking back after the challenge to see if you have an explanatino for this phenomenon.  Great catch.', '2005-08-19 09:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623495, 217781, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC... :-(<br/> <br/>There is no rain.</td>', 'DNMC... :-( There is no rain.', '2005-08-19 09:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623496, 217855, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great colors and action. This is really well done.  The contrast of the blues and the reds is great against the dark background and the "white" of the rain. This gets a ten from me!!<br/> <br/>On second review, this is still a total stand out.  The movement and the constrasting colors  is just spot on.  I bet you''ll see a ribbon for this one.</td>', 'Great colors and action. This is really well done.  The contrast of the blues and the reds is great against the dark background and the "white" of the rain. This gets a ten from me!! On second review, this is still a total stand out.  The movement and the constrasting colors  is just spot on.  I bet you''ll see a ribbon for this one.', '2005-08-19 09:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623498, 218091, 35357, '<td valign="top">I can''t see any rain, and the subject holds no interest for me, sorry.</td>', 'I can''t see any rain, and the subject holds no interest for me, sorry.', '2005-08-19 09:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623502, 215241, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful vista. Your colors couldn''t be any richer or more lovely. The misty rain is just stunning. 10<br/> <br/>Again, I''m reviewing my top pics and this is definitely a contender.  The overall hues are so delicious and inviting - I can hardly stand it. I''d like to know if you just used curves, or filters or what.  Can I have a 16 X 20?????</td>', 'What a beautiful vista. Your colors couldn''t be any richer or more lovely. The misty rain is just stunning. 10 Again, I''m reviewing my top pics and this is definitely a contender.  The overall hues are so delicious and inviting - I can hardly stand it. I''d like to know if you just used curves, or filters or what.  Can I have a 16 X 20?????', '2005-08-19 09:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623506, 217433, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet flower shot.  It''s a very nice flower, and I like the colourless background.</td>', 'Another wet flower shot.  It''s a very nice flower, and I like the colourless background.', '2005-08-19 10:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623508, 216908, 15711, '<td valign="top">VERY COOL. I love your use of light. Good movement and stop action<br/> <br/>Upon 2nd review, this is still one of my highest ranked photos.  And the title is so appropos. I''m a lover of the dark shots and this is an outstanding example. I''m curious to find out how you did it.  Way to go.</td>', 'VERY COOL. I love your use of light. Good movement and stop action Upon 2nd review, this is still one of my highest ranked photos.  And the title is so appropos. I''m a lover of the dark shots and this is an outstanding example. I''m curious to find out how you did it.  Way to go.', '2005-08-19 10:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623510, 216839, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love lightning shots, added to my favs!  The buildings give nice context, especially the one with the cross.  The horizon looks slightly tilted.</td>', 'Wow, I love lightning shots, added to my favs!  The buildings give nice context, especially the one with the cross.  The horizon looks slightly tilted.', '2005-08-19 10:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623511, 217786, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lovely!! Is it a pine sprig??  The blue and greens are so pretty against the black. Nicely done macro.<br/> <br/>Upon 2nd review, I''m an idiot and just saw the moon.  The way I have my monitor set up , I didn''t see it and now I feel like an imbicile.  GOD -  now I like it that much more.  I guess the title is a dead giveaway, huh?  DUH - I''m upping you to a 10.</td>', 'This is lovely!! Is it a pine sprig??  The blue and greens are so pretty against the black. Nicely done macro. Upon 2nd review, I''m an idiot and just saw the moon.  The way I have my monitor set up , I didn''t see it and now I feel like an imbicile.  GOD -  now I like it that much more.  I guess the title is a dead giveaway, huh?  DUH - I''m upping you to a 10.', '2005-08-19 10:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623512, 217868, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet plant/flower shot.  Very pretty, and well done.</td>', 'Another wet plant/flower shot.  Very pretty, and well done.', '2005-08-19 10:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623516, 216561, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the compostion with the beasts &amp; the rocky shore.  The white of the ducks looks a little blown for my taste, but it does make for a serene feel.</td>', 'I like the compostion with the beasts & the rocky shore.  The white of the ducks looks a little blown for my taste, but it does make for a serene feel.', '2005-08-19 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623521, 217318, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC... :-(<br/> <br/>Not shot during the rain.</td>', 'DNMC... :-( Not shot during the rain.', '2005-08-19 10:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623525, 217759, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, but as it stands isn''t very attractive to me.  I think this shot has a lot of potential, however.  Take away the car, straighten or remove the walls, and I think it would take on an entirely different feel.</td>', 'Nice silhouette, but as it stands isn''t very attractive to me.  I think this shot has a lot of potential, however.  Take away the car, straighten or remove the walls, and I think it would take on an entirely different feel.', '2005-08-19 10:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623529, 215363, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an impressively interesting catch of such a mundane bit of minutiae!  I''m very impressed!  Even the junky background somehow works in this shot.  You are definitely The Man/Woman!  I love the deflected flow.  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow, what an impressively interesting catch of such a mundane bit of minutiae!  I''m very impressed!  Even the junky background somehow works in this shot.  You are definitely The Man/Woman!  I love the deflected flow.  Great shot!', '2005-08-19 10:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623530, 217739, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love how the drop magnifies the veins in the leaf.  Very nice perspective and DOF. This is unusual. The purple and the yellow with the orange tones make for a nice color composition. 9<br/> <br/>Upon 2nd review, this is still one of my favorites.  It almost has an animal quality to it. Like some pre-historic beast with a giant eye (or maybe I''ve had too much coffee).  Just stellar though.  I think you''ll do quite well with it.</td>', 'I love how the drop magnifies the veins in the leaf.  Very nice perspective and DOF. This is unusual. The purple and the yellow with the orange tones make for a nice color composition. 9 Upon 2nd review, this is still one of my favorites.  It almost has an animal quality to it. Like some pre-historic beast with a giant eye (or maybe I''ve had too much coffee).  Just stellar though.  I think you''ll do quite well with it.', '2005-08-19 10:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623532, 217278, 35357, '<td valign="top">Awesome lilly shot, I love the low angle!</td>', 'Awesome lilly shot, I love the low angle!', '2005-08-19 10:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623588, 217029, 37961, '<td valign="top">That poor dog getting sprayed in the face with a water hose all for the sake of a challenge entry....</td>', 'That poor dog getting sprayed in the face with a water hose all for the sake of a challenge entry....', '2005-08-19 10:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623592, 217047, 37961, '<td valign="top">This photo evokes emotion. Lovely. 10. Challenge favorite.</td>', 'This photo evokes emotion. Lovely. 10. Challenge favorite.', '2005-08-19 10:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623593, 216961, 37961, '<td valign="top">Love the choice of greens in post editing. 10</td>', 'Love the choice of greens in post editing. 10', '2005-08-19 10:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623649, 217894, 37961, '<td valign="top">The rain gives the appearance of soft focus. Lovely setting.</td>', 'The rain gives the appearance of soft focus. Lovely setting.', '2005-08-19 11:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623665, 217159, 21604, '<td valign="top">Love this, I think it would work even better with the red''s boosted and the rest desatutrated. Very nice shot 8.</td>', 'Love this, I think it would work even better with the red''s boosted and the rest desatutrated. Very nice shot 8.', '2005-08-19 11:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623680, 217898, 21604, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.</td>', 'What a great shot.', '2005-08-19 11:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623801, 216045, 25754, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here. The parking lines add to the composition. I might have gone b+w to remove the distracting greens or cropped the top portion out just above the 2 large puddles.</td>', 'I like your idea here. The parking lines add to the composition. I might have gone b+w to remove the distracting greens or cropped the top portion out just above the 2 large puddles.', '2005-08-19 12:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623804, 217820, 42667, '<td valign="top">Ha haa haaa! Nice shot.</td>', 'Ha haa haaa! Nice shot.', '2005-08-19 12:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623808, 217787, 39347, '<td valign="top">I bet this would have been stunning in color.</td>', 'I bet this would have been stunning in color.', '2005-08-19 12:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623809, 217929, 25754, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot. I love the balance between the stormy sky and somewhat bleak looking landscape.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot. I love the balance between the stormy sky and somewhat bleak looking landscape.', '2005-08-19 12:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1623810, 217927, 28261, '<td valign="top">The massive highlight in the top detracts from this excellent image.  Perhaps a wider angled crop to minimize that area would have upped the score.  Still, an 8.</td>', 'The massive highlight in the top detracts from this excellent image.  Perhaps a wider angled crop to minimize that area would have upped the score.  Still, an 8.', '2005-08-19 12:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
