(1624256, 217921, 35274, '<td valign="top">HAHA<br/>funny</td>', 'HAHAfunny', '2005-08-19 16:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624267, 216010, 35274, '<td valign="top">cool landscape, especially with the low clouds. but the out of focus water drops on the window don''t really add anything to this photo in my opinion, infact I think they''re kinda distracting. the whole image could benefit from being lightened a bit, too. but it does have great potential! and is otherwise very interesting. good luck:-)</td>', 'cool landscape, especially with the low clouds. but the out of focus water drops on the window don''t really add anything to this photo in my opinion, infact I think they''re kinda distracting. the whole image could benefit from being lightened a bit, too. but it does have great potential! and is otherwise very interesting. good luck:-)', '2005-08-19 16:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624269, 216479, 32430, '<td valign="top">great shot! has a lot of emotion to it.  Good job</td>', 'great shot! has a lot of emotion to it.  Good job', '2005-08-19 16:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624271, 217929, 35274, '<td valign="top">oohh! what a dramatic scene.  love it!</td>', 'oohh! what a dramatic scene.  love it!', '2005-08-19 16:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624284, 217740, 35274, '<td valign="top">nice.<br/>would have liked more of it in focus (the things closer to the lens) like those green buds in the center, i find my eye being drawn to them. but the shallow DOF (that i believe caused the blurred areas) has really worked in your favor in other ways, such as really blurring the background, making the flowers your center focus.</td>', 'nice.would have liked more of it in focus (the things closer to the lens) like those green buds in the center, i find my eye being drawn to them. but the shallow DOF (that i believe caused the blurred areas) has really worked in your favor in other ways, such as really blurring the background, making the flowers your center focus.', '2005-08-19 17:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624286, 218098, 35274, '<td valign="top">interesting. i think having the water in focus more would have made it better tho.</td>', 'interesting. i think having the water in focus more would have made it better tho.', '2005-08-19 17:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624288, 217308, 35274, '<td valign="top">aww, how sweet.</td>', 'aww, how sweet.', '2005-08-19 17:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624297, 217013, 35274, '<td valign="top">interesting. i think if I were doing something like this, i would have chosen a more ''solid'' subject. with the grape vines you have here, there''s just a lot of stuff making your main subject kind of cluttered. maybe if you just focused more on the smaller area with just the green leaves and the grapes.</td>', 'interesting. i think if I were doing something like this, i would have chosen a more ''solid'' subject. with the grape vines you have here, there''s just a lot of stuff making your main subject kind of cluttered. maybe if you just focused more on the smaller area with just the green leaves and the grapes.', '2005-08-19 17:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624300, 217482, 35274, '<td valign="top">like how well you can see the falling rain. i think the flowers are a bit out of focus tho. but by using the rule of thirds to create negative space, i think you have succesfully made an otherwise common subject (atleast in this challenge) interesting.</td>', 'like how well you can see the falling rain. i think the flowers are a bit out of focus tho. but by using the rule of thirds to create negative space, i think you have succesfully made an otherwise common subject (atleast in this challenge) interesting.', '2005-08-19 17:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
