(1624398, 217946, 811, '<td valign="top">I keep skipping this one, then coming back to it, then skipping it, then coming back.  The composition is well-balanced adn works well.  The colors are bold, but not too much so (with the possible exception of the really really green grass at the far side of hte table), and the focus and all that seems to be fine, yet it is lacking somethign for me.  Perhaps if there was something on the table like a soggy bouquet of flowers, or child''s toy, or empty drink cans, it would help tell more of a story.</td>', 'I keep skipping this one, then coming back to it, then skipping it, then coming back.  The composition is well-balanced adn works well.  The colors are bold, but not too much so (with the possible exception of the really really green grass at the far side of hte table), and the focus and all that seems to be fine, yet it is lacking somethign for me.  Perhaps if there was something on the table like a soggy bouquet of flowers, or child''s toy, or empty drink cans, it would help tell more of a story.', '2005-08-19 17:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624402, 217983, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the pink adn blue, but the composition as a whole feels a bit too snug for me, I think.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the pink adn blue, but the composition as a whole feels a bit too snug for me, I think.', '2005-08-19 17:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
