(1624481, 216050, 34659, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Not sure the B/W works to your best advantage here though - I think you lose a lot of the water splash in the gray background that you might not have in color.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Not sure the B/W works to your best advantage here though - I think you lose a lot of the water splash in the gray background that you might not have in color.', '2005-08-19 18:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
