(1624489, 217902, 811, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge!  I obviously don''t know what you''re shooting with, but if there would have been any way to crop closer/get closer to show the expressions on the face, I think it would have been a truly excellent shot.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge!  I obviously don''t know what you''re shooting with, but if there would have been any way to crop closer/get closer to show the expressions on the face, I think it would have been a truly excellent shot.', '2005-08-19 18:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624490, 217433, 34659, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but I''m not sure that the selective desat works well here.  The colors of the flower are so unusual, that it makes it difficult at first to determine what it even is.  Upon closer inspection it certainly becomes clear - and you''ve got great focus &amp; DOF.</td>', 'Good shot, but I''m not sure that the selective desat works well here.  The colors of the flower are so unusual, that it makes it difficult at first to determine what it even is.  Upon closer inspection it certainly becomes clear - and you''ve got great focus & DOF.', '2005-08-19 18:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624493, 216724, 34659, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and angle.  It seems to be a tad OOF though - making it slightly less appealing.  Still, good idea.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and angle.  It seems to be a tad OOF though - making it slightly less appealing.  Still, good idea.', '2005-08-19 18:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
