(1624503, 217969, 811, '<td valign="top">Great focus.  As the subject is almost perfectly straight horizontal, the shot seems kinda static and the eyes look at the stick (?) and stay in the frame.  Placing it on a diagonal may help it to lead the lines through the frame.</td>', 'Great focus.  As the subject is almost perfectly straight horizontal, the shot seems kinda static and the eyes look at the stick (?) and stay in the frame.  Placing it on a diagonal may help it to lead the lines through the frame.', '2005-08-19 18:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
