(1624533, 218049, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky shot.  B/W works surprisingly well here.  Nice rays.</td>', 'Beautiful sky shot.  B/W works surprisingly well here.  Nice rays.', '2005-08-19 18:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624536, 218089, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and DOF.  I like the tones too.  Not crazy about the blurred movement shown on the model though - only because it doesn''t look like she''s moving very quickly at all (based on her feet &amp; leg positions).  IMHO, it would have worked better if she''d been running &amp; OOF or the shot was completely in focus.</td>', 'Nice focus and DOF.  I like the tones too.  Not crazy about the blurred movement shown on the model though - only because it doesn''t look like she''s moving very quickly at all (based on her feet & leg positions).  IMHO, it would have worked better if she''d been running & OOF or the shot was completely in focus.', '2005-08-19 18:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624537, 217318, 34659, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Unfortunately, I''m not particularly crazy about real close-up flower shots - however, you''ve got nice focus, DOF, &amp; color.  Appealing in an abstract way though.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Unfortunately, I''m not particularly crazy about real close-up flower shots - however, you''ve got nice focus, DOF, & color.  Appealing in an abstract way though.', '2005-08-19 19:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
