(1624545, 217110, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the water effect on the glass.  Wish the background was a bit more interesting.</td>', 'Love the water effect on the glass.  Wish the background was a bit more interesting.', '2005-08-19 19:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624546, 216766, 35357, '<td valign="top">I love the clean, simplicity.  Both the barn and the rainbow make for very interesting subject matter. Bravo.</td>', 'I love the clean, simplicity.  Both the barn and the rainbow make for very interesting subject matter. Bravo.', '2005-08-19 19:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624548, 217948, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice focus &amp; DOF.  The blues don''t work for me (personally) - however, still a good shot.</td>', 'Nice focus & DOF.  The blues don''t work for me (personally) - however, still a good shot.', '2005-08-19 19:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624550, 217554, 811, '<td valign="top">Very well done minimalist shot.  I am presuming that is noise?  Looks almost like it was a texture of some kind.</td>', 'Very well done minimalist shot.  I am presuming that is noise?  Looks almost like it was a texture of some kind.', '2005-08-19 19:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624551, 216660, 34659, '<td valign="top">The splash looks "off" to me.  i.e., why is there no water on the right hand side?  That point aside, nice natural color, good movement &amp; composition.</td>', 'The splash looks "off" to me.  i.e., why is there no water on the right hand side?  That point aside, nice natural color, good movement & composition.', '2005-08-19 19:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624552, 217865, 34659, '<td valign="top">IMHO, the umbrella takes up too much of the frame in this shot.  You''ve got nice colorful design, but it eclipses the water.  Still an appealing image.</td>', 'IMHO, the umbrella takes up too much of the frame in this shot.  You''ve got nice colorful design, but it eclipses the water.  Still an appealing image.', '2005-08-19 19:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624553, 217252, 35357, '<td valign="top">Great focus &amp; catch.  I love shots where drops act as in-focus lenses, very elegant.  I think the grungy trough, or whatever it is, amplifies the clean, crispness of the drop by contrast.</td>', 'Great focus & catch.  I love shots where drops act as in-focus lenses, very elegant.  I think the grungy trough, or whatever it is, amplifies the clean, crispness of the drop by contrast.', '2005-08-19 19:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624555, 217862, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  Nice expression and good color.  Focus &amp; DOF also good.</td>', 'Cute shot.  Nice expression and good color.  Focus & DOF also good.', '2005-08-19 19:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624557, 217402, 811, '<td valign="top">Good detail, but perhaps a bit too busy.</td>', 'Good detail, but perhaps a bit too busy.', '2005-08-19 19:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624562, 218041, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the colour of the oof background, though it''s a little grainy for my taste, something I struggle with a lot.  Spider &amp; drops compostions balance each other nicely.  Not a very rainy shot for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the colour of the oof background, though it''s a little grainy for my taste, something I struggle with a lot.  Spider & drops compostions balance each other nicely.  Not a very rainy shot for this challenge.', '2005-08-19 19:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624563, 216838, 811, '<td valign="top">The blur really detracts in this image.  Might have been better to leave it be.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, great capture.  The little girl''s expression is priceless!</td>', 'The blur really detracts in this image.  Might have been better to leave it be. Otherwise, great capture.  The little girl''s expression is priceless!', '2005-08-19 19:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624564, 217973, 35357, '<td valign="top">Another wet flower shot.  Fantastic focus, and the lighting is so nice that it makes me think this rain-shot was in a studio.  Great job capturing the softness of the petals.</td>', 'Another wet flower shot.  Fantastic focus, and the lighting is so nice that it makes me think this rain-shot was in a studio.  Great job capturing the softness of the petals.', '2005-08-19 19:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624566, 217786, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the subdued colours, it gives a nicely relaxing tone to the shot.  Not very rainy, but there''s a lot of that going on.</td>', 'I like the subdued colours, it gives a nicely relaxing tone to the shot.  Not very rainy, but there''s a lot of that going on.', '2005-08-19 19:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624570, 218041, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and composition.</td>', 'Nice capture and composition.', '2005-08-19 19:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624573, 216023, 35357, '<td valign="top">Oddly, my favourite thing about this shot is the grainy background.  I''m so wierd.  Good job catching the drop, I''ll bet that took a few tries.  I like how the drop is like a little lense to the flower too.</td>', 'Oddly, my favourite thing about this shot is the grainy background.  I''m so wierd.  Good job catching the drop, I''ll bet that took a few tries.  I like how the drop is like a little lense to the flower too.', '2005-08-19 19:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624578, 217013, 35357, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not very interesting subject matter to me.</td>', 'Sorry, not very interesting subject matter to me.', '2005-08-19 19:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624580, 216382, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully focused, but not a very rainy shot, and the subject isn''t very interesting to me.</td>', 'Wonderfully focused, but not a very rainy shot, and the subject isn''t very interesting to me.', '2005-08-19 19:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624582, 218026, 35357, '<td valign="top">DNMC... :-(  After the rain, not during.<br/> <br/>I like the strong colour, it contrasts nicely with the background.  The curving lines add nice flow.</td>', 'DNMC... :-(  After the rain, not during. I like the strong colour, it contrasts nicely with the background.  The curving lines add nice flow.', '2005-08-19 19:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624589, 215995, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure effect.  The selective desat(?) adds interest.</td>', 'Nice long exposure effect.  The selective desat(?) adds interest.', '2005-08-19 19:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624592, 217402, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract artsiness of this shot.  The chaotic web is interesting, good find.</td>', 'I like the abstract artsiness of this shot.  The chaotic web is interesting, good find.', '2005-08-19 19:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624595, 217965, 42705, '<td valign="top">Gorgeously captured. Pristine.  It looks like rain; like: the way it looks to me.</td>', 'Gorgeously captured. Pristine.  It looks like rain; like: the way it looks to me.', '2005-08-19 19:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624598, 216833, 35357, '<td valign="top">The trailing "stars" on the droplet at the centre of this shot make the photo for me.  I''m surprised this shot hasn''t been requested for DQ for that reason.  Good catch.</td>', 'The trailing "stars" on the droplet at the centre of this shot make the photo for me.  I''m surprised this shot hasn''t been requested for DQ for that reason.  Good catch.', '2005-08-19 19:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624603, 217355, 35357, '<td valign="top">Good subject, a lot of character in those window panes.  I think the composition could have been better by panning up &amp; right a bit, maybe shooting from a lower or higher angle, rather than from horizontal.  Lots of different ways to shoot this.  Godd find.</td>', 'Good subject, a lot of character in those window panes.  I think the composition could have been better by panning up & right a bit, maybe shooting from a lower or higher angle, rather than from horizontal.  Lots of different ways to shoot this.  Godd find.', '2005-08-19 19:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624608, 215241, 35357, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setting and I love the look down the valley.  The change from colourful foreground to a more monochromatic-ish horizon is nice.  Looks like a great place to take a hike.</td>', 'Beautiful setting and I love the look down the valley.  The change from colourful foreground to a more monochromatic-ish horizon is nice.  Looks like a great place to take a hike.', '2005-08-19 19:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624613, 217113, 35357, '<td valign="top">Not very rainy, but what the heck, it''s a great shot.  It looks like a spindle off a lathe.  I like the watery-blue colours and sparkle.  You''re obviously a fancy-pants photographer ;-)</td>', 'Not very rainy, but what the heck, it''s a great shot.  It looks like a spindle off a lathe.  I like the watery-blue colours and sparkle.  You''re obviously a fancy-pants photographer ;-)', '2005-08-19 19:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624615, 217211, 35357, '<td valign="top">Not a very rainy shot.  I like the dof &amp; the web is interesting.  All sorts  of good ways to compose it, they would all probably work nicely.</td>', 'Not a very rainy shot.  I like the dof & the web is interesting.  All sorts  of good ways to compose it, they would all probably work nicely.', '2005-08-19 19:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624616, 217817, 40364, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Shows the emotion well. God job</td>', 'I really like this. Shows the emotion well. God job', '2005-08-19 19:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624623, 216908, 35357, '<td valign="top">Yay!  What a creative shot.  Simple &amp; humorous!  Great lighting.</td>', 'Yay!  What a creative shot.  Simple & humorous!  Great lighting.', '2005-08-19 19:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624664, 218054, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  The focus is off, unfortunately.  It looks like your camera wanted to focus on the petals in the back.</td>', 'I like the composition.  The focus is off, unfortunately.  It looks like your camera wanted to focus on the petals in the back.', '2005-08-19 20:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624730, 216442, 2158, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, but my guess is that the title is doing you more harm than good.  Well I''ll just have to pretend I didn''t read it and give you a decent score anyway:)</td>', 'Cute picture, but my guess is that the title is doing you more harm than good.  Well I''ll just have to pretend I didn''t read it and give you a decent score anyway:)', '2005-08-19 20:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624763, 217497, 35602, '<td valign="top">Love the play of colors.  The aqua color is so pleasing.</td>', 'Love the play of colors.  The aqua color is so pleasing.', '2005-08-19 20:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624767, 216838, 35602, '<td valign="top">This was such a wonderful photo.  Great capture of the moment.  Loved the soft focus created by the motion.  The coffee pot was just a little too blown out.  Maybe a little more burning in or colorizing to take some of the shine off would have made it  a 10 for me.  I gave it a 9, instead.</td>', 'This was such a wonderful photo.  Great capture of the moment.  Loved the soft focus created by the motion.  The coffee pot was just a little too blown out.  Maybe a little more burning in or colorizing to take some of the shine off would have made it  a 10 for me.  I gave it a 9, instead.', '2005-08-19 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624769, 218058, 35602, '<td valign="top">Did a really great job of showing the rain on this one.   NIce saturation.</td>', 'Did a really great job of showing the rain on this one.   NIce saturation.', '2005-08-19 21:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624772, 217545, 35602, '<td valign="top">Absolutely great shot.  The flowery umbrella really gave this photo that little extra.  Thought the lighting was really good too.</td>', 'Absolutely great shot.  The flowery umbrella really gave this photo that little extra.  Thought the lighting was really good too.', '2005-08-19 21:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624775, 217330, 35602, '<td valign="top">This was a unique style.  The white background and the colorful umbrella worked very well to give this photo zip.  I didn''t like the really strong motion of the people, though.  I know it was a creative technique but without seeing it with less blur on the people, I can''t say if this photo works totally as it stands.</td>', 'This was a unique style.  The white background and the colorful umbrella worked very well to give this photo zip.  I didn''t like the really strong motion of the people, though.  I know it was a creative technique but without seeing it with less blur on the people, I can''t say if this photo works totally as it stands.', '2005-08-19 21:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624776, 215778, 37893, '<td valign="top">I love the implied symmetry in this image. The rain drops are great too though i think it''s staged :) 6</td>', 'I love the implied symmetry in this image. The rain drops are great too though i think it''s staged :) 6', '2005-08-19 21:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624777, 217855, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is such a fun image. Shame on you for using your kids :) I love the fanciful play here. Poor little girl who''s getting bullied by her big sister. Bumping up to 9.</td>', 'This is such a fun image. Shame on you for using your kids :) I love the fanciful play here. Poor little girl who''s getting bullied by her big sister. Bumping up to 9.', '2005-08-19 21:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624780, 215903, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great landscape shot. I like how the haze creates a secondary layer beyond the green field. 6</td>', 'Great landscape shot. I like how the haze creates a secondary layer beyond the green field. 6', '2005-08-19 21:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624782, 216793, 37893, '<td valign="top">The contrast here is a a bit blown. I think you could have burned the flower a bit so that it doesn''t get lost in the image. The rain capture is fantastic. 6</td>', 'The contrast here is a a bit blown. I think you could have burned the flower a bit so that it doesn''t get lost in the image. The rain capture is fantastic. 6', '2005-08-19 21:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624783, 216764, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very creative interpretation of personifying an image of rain.  The grayish cast to her face makes her appear very stormy.  I would say that especially as a work of fine art, you did a wonderful job.  The one thing I didn''t like was her smile.  I would have probably just taken the shot without a smile.  Takes away from the idea of stormy.</td>', 'Very creative interpretation of personifying an image of rain.  The grayish cast to her face makes her appear very stormy.  I would say that especially as a work of fine art, you did a wonderful job.  The one thing I didn''t like was her smile.  I would have probably just taken the shot without a smile.  Takes away from the idea of stormy.', '2005-08-19 21:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624784, 217761, 37893, '<td valign="top">Let me guess. Universal Studios tram ride behind the Hollywood backlots :) Hey this never fails to impress. Hollywood rain is still rain in my books. 6</td>', 'Let me guess. Universal Studios tram ride behind the Hollywood backlots :) Hey this never fails to impress. Hollywood rain is still rain in my books. 6', '2005-08-19 21:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624785, 217770, 37893, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a tighter shot and a landscape image rather than portrait for this image. I love the contrast between the greens and the stark white image of the flower.6</td>', 'I would have preferred a tighter shot and a landscape image rather than portrait for this image. I love the contrast between the greens and the stark white image of the flower.6', '2005-08-19 21:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624786, 217211, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice web shot.  Loved the blues and greens in the background.  Though there are several blown out highlights from the background, they are not enough to distract from the image.</td>', 'Very nice web shot.  Loved the blues and greens in the background.  Though there are several blown out highlights from the background, they are not enough to distract from the image.', '2005-08-19 21:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624787, 217938, 37893, '<td valign="top">Such an emotional image. I love the "tear drop" by her left eyelash. I just wish she was looking up a bit more. Bumping to 8</td>', 'Such an emotional image. I love the "tear drop" by her left eyelash. I just wish she was looking up a bit more. Bumping to 8', '2005-08-19 21:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624788, 217252, 37893, '<td valign="top">Timely capture. I like it! care to share how this was done?</td>', 'Timely capture. I like it! care to share how this was done?', '2005-08-19 21:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624791, 217846, 37893, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but this image looks like it was taken somewhere in Europe. Maybe it''s the landscape or the cows. I like the haze in the background. Makes the cows stand out even more.</td>', 'I don''t know why but this image looks like it was taken somewhere in Europe. Maybe it''s the landscape or the cows. I like the haze in the background. Makes the cows stand out even more.', '2005-08-19 21:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624792, 216724, 37893, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic lighting. I like the tilt of the camera here. Great image. 7</td>', 'Very dramatic lighting. I like the tilt of the camera here. Great image. 7', '2005-08-19 21:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624795, 218065, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great macro. i think this looks like an indoor shot due to the lighting and there''s nothing wrong with that. My image is also an indoor shot. Love the reflections on the drops. 6</td>', 'Great macro. i think this looks like an indoor shot due to the lighting and there''s nothing wrong with that. My image is also an indoor shot. Love the reflections on the drops. 6', '2005-08-19 21:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624796, 217817, 37893, '<td valign="top">I hope things went well for this wedding :) Rain is always good luck in some cultures :)</td>', 'I hope things went well for this wedding :) Rain is always good luck in some cultures :)', '2005-08-19 21:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624797, 216745, 9576, '<td valign="top">nice wet flower but it does not mean rain?<br/>it is raining give this a litle bump up to 8 ;-)</td>', 'nice wet flower but it does not mean rain?it is raining give this a litle bump up to 8 ;-)', '2005-08-19 21:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624800, 218041, 37893, '<td valign="top">... and dried up all the rain and the itsy bitsy spider... I like the concept but the image is slightly blurry. There''s really no sharp focus on anything IMHO. 6</td>', '... and dried up all the rain and the itsy bitsy spider... I like the concept but the image is slightly blurry. There''s really no sharp focus on anything IMHO. 6', '2005-08-19 21:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624801, 217389, 35602, '<td valign="top">Thought it could use a little more light.  The leaves kind of sink into the background because the color is similar.  Maybe a little fill in flash, or just adjusting the light during editing.  You might also be able to push your compensation in your camera a stop or two.</td>', 'Thought it could use a little more light.  The leaves kind of sink into the background because the color is similar.  Maybe a little fill in flash, or just adjusting the light during editing.  You might also be able to push your compensation in your camera a stop or two.', '2005-08-19 21:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624802, 217968, 9576, '<td valign="top">A litle bit to much burning or somthing? 8</td>', 'A litle bit to much burning or somthing? 8', '2005-08-19 21:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624804, 217023, 9576, '<td valign="top">Happy face ;-) 7</td>', 'Happy face ;-) 7', '2005-08-19 21:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624805, 217489, 9576, '<td valign="top">good one 8</td>', 'good one 8', '2005-08-19 21:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624807, 216104, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great capture. 10</td>', 'Great capture. 10', '2005-08-19 21:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624810, 218026, 35602, '<td valign="top">The dark background really causes the petal to jump out at you.  Nice detail on the rain drops.</td>', 'The dark background really causes the petal to jump out at you.  Nice detail on the rain drops.', '2005-08-19 21:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624812, 217482, 9576, '<td valign="top">the rain is like straw 8</td>', 'the rain is like straw 8', '2005-08-19 21:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624813, 217970, 37893, '<td valign="top">I like the implied symmetry here. The bush in the back behind the fence is a bit distracting but other than that, it gets a 6 from me.</td>', 'I like the implied symmetry here. The bush in the back behind the fence is a bit distracting but other than that, it gets a 6 from me.', '2005-08-19 21:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624814, 218089, 9576, '<td valign="top">Ther does not seam to be any rain?</td>', 'Ther does not seam to be any rain?', '2005-08-19 21:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624815, 217257, 37893, '<td valign="top">IMHO a tighter crop would be great but still leaving some greens in the image.</td>', 'IMHO a tighter crop would be great but still leaving some greens in the image.', '2005-08-19 21:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624816, 217253, 9576, '<td valign="top">Nice photo 7</td>', 'Nice photo 7', '2005-08-19 21:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624817, 217973, 9576, '<td valign="top">Alitle bit to bright</td>', 'Alitle bit to bright', '2005-08-19 21:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624818, 217450, 37893, '<td valign="top">The foreground is blurry but overall, it definitely makes a strong statement. I wonder if you dodged the fence even more and make it a bit whiter. That would be great too.</td>', 'The foreground is blurry but overall, it definitely makes a strong statement. I wonder if you dodged the fence even more and make it a bit whiter. That would be great too.', '2005-08-19 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624821, 217389, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh! Greta capture on the rain drops as well.</td>', 'Great bokeh! Greta capture on the rain drops as well.', '2005-08-19 21:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624824, 217921, 9576, '<td valign="top">Smiling in the rain, Im smiling in the rain 8</td>', 'Smiling in the rain, Im smiling in the rain 8', '2005-08-19 21:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624825, 216363, 9576, '<td valign="top">9 for being there</td>', '9 for being there', '2005-08-19 21:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624827, 217961, 37893, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. I probably would have centered the caught rain drop. IMHO.</td>', 'I like this image a lot. I probably would have centered the caught rain drop. IMHO.', '2005-08-19 21:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624830, 217855, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great depiction of kids being kids, and if they are sisters you can really tell by the image.  Not enough color saturation, though.  The entire image seems to be the same tone.  Not sure how you could have really made the girls jump out.  Maybe fill in flash or an adjustment on exposure at the time of the image.</td>', 'Great depiction of kids being kids, and if they are sisters you can really tell by the image.  Not enough color saturation, though.  The entire image seems to be the same tone.  Not sure how you could have really made the girls jump out.  Maybe fill in flash or an adjustment on exposure at the time of the image.', '2005-08-19 21:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624831, 217740, 37893, '<td valign="top">very nice.... simple, clean, and very romantic feeling.... 6</td>', 'very nice.... simple, clean, and very romantic feeling.... 6', '2005-08-19 21:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624834, 216909, 37893, '<td valign="top">the duck is a bit blurry but the rain drops on the water is a great capture... 6</td>', 'the duck is a bit blurry but the rain drops on the water is a great capture... 6', '2005-08-19 21:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624837, 217810, 37893, '<td valign="top">it took me a while to realize where the umbrella was and i thought this was a clever idea... great shot... 6</td>', 'it took me a while to realize where the umbrella was and i thought this was a clever idea... great shot... 6', '2005-08-19 21:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624838, 216492, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great image.  I really like the light being weighted and centered as it is.  Definitely shows rain.  10</td>', 'Great image.  I really like the light being weighted and centered as it is.  Definitely shows rain.  10', '2005-08-19 21:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624839, 216760, 37893, '<td valign="top">this little boy is having too much fun... i wish i could see the reaction in his face... other than that DOF is great :) 6</td>', 'this little boy is having too much fun... i wish i could see the reaction in his face... other than that DOF is great :) 6', '2005-08-19 21:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624841, 217983, 37893, '<td valign="top">Very cute. I would have probably cropped out here right hand out of the frame for this shot... IMHO...6</td>', 'Very cute. I would have probably cropped out here right hand out of the frame for this shot... IMHO...6', '2005-08-19 21:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624843, 217174, 37893, '<td valign="top">interesting title... lovely bokeh and i love the composition... it''s just that nothing seems to be in focus... 5</td>', 'interesting title... lovely bokeh and i love the composition... it''s just that nothing seems to be in focus... 5', '2005-08-19 21:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624844, 217927, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice impressionistic style.  Backgroud looks like you used long brush strokes to paint it.</td>', 'Very nice impressionistic style.  Backgroud looks like you used long brush strokes to paint it.', '2005-08-19 21:26:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1624845, 218073, 37893, '<td valign="top">great capture... image is extremely sharp and i like the rain trails :) 6</td>', 'great capture... image is extremely sharp and i like the rain trails :) 6', '2005-08-19 21:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624846, 218102, 37893, '<td valign="top">i suggest using a tripod for this shot or something to stabilize the image... it''s a long exposure and there is a slight blur in the rest of the objects... only the guys should be out of focus... IMHO... 5</td>', 'i suggest using a tripod for this shot or something to stabilize the image... it''s a long exposure and there is a slight blur in the rest of the objects... only the guys should be out of focus... IMHO... 5', '2005-08-19 21:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624850, 217865, 37893, '<td valign="top">i love the juxstaposition of flower against the rain... a different take on a rain soaked flower... turn the umbrella 180 degrees so that you don''t see the strap :O</td>', 'i love the juxstaposition of flower against the rain... a different take on a rain soaked flower... turn the umbrella 180 degrees so that you don''t see the strap :O', '2005-08-19 21:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624852, 217887, 37893, '<td valign="top">neat idea... i just wish the debris was not present... how about if the shadow of the chair was centered between the boards... maybe the symmetry would be stronger... IMHO 6</td>', 'neat idea... i just wish the debris was not present... how about if the shadow of the chair was centered between the boards... maybe the symmetry would be stronger... IMHO 6', '2005-08-19 21:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624853, 216050, 37893, '<td valign="top">and where did you ever find this occuerence? great take on rain! 6</td>', 'and where did you ever find this occuerence? great take on rain! 6', '2005-08-19 21:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624854, 217925, 37893, '<td valign="top">just as we would expect i guess from rain across our windshield eh? no wipers?</td>', 'just as we would expect i guess from rain across our windshield eh? no wipers?', '2005-08-19 21:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624857, 215995, 37893, '<td valign="top">the image is burned too much IMHO... i like the idea but the PP is a bit too much :( 5</td>', 'the image is burned too much IMHO... i like the idea but the PP is a bit too much :( 5', '2005-08-19 21:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624861, 217740, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Looks almost like a dancer.  Seemed a little flat.  I don''t really know.  I like the image but something bothers me, but I can''t figure out what.  Once I see the other comments, maybe I''ll better be able to figure out what is tugging at me.  Gave it a 7.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Looks almost like a dancer.  Seemed a little flat.  I don''t really know.  I like the image but something bothers me, but I can''t figure out what.  Once I see the other comments, maybe I''ll better be able to figure out what is tugging at me.  Gave it a 7.', '2005-08-19 21:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624906, 216431, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Well done. The window as a frame is excellent.</td>', 'Very nice! Well done. The window as a frame is excellent.', '2005-08-19 21:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
