(1625222, 217858, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I naturally key in on the eyes in a shot like this. In this case they appear closed and in shadow which dosen''t really seem to fit to me. I guess the brightness and vivid colors clash with the somber mood of the subject. This could make an interesting contrast, but i''m just not getting it here. Perhaps further creative editing could bring the mood of the shot closer to that of the subject.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I naturally key in on the eyes in a shot like this. In this case they appear closed and in shadow which dosen''t really seem to fit to me. I guess the brightness and vivid colors clash with the somber mood of the subject. This could make an interesting contrast, but i''m just not getting it here. Perhaps further creative editing could bring the mood of the shot closer to that of the subject.', '2005-08-19 23:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625233, 217140, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great moment captured here. If this is cropped though, I might include more to the top and left to emphasize the diagonal line of sight. Also the skintones are appearing a bit orange to me but that could be a monitor issue.</td>', 'Great moment captured here. If this is cropped though, I might include more to the top and left to emphasize the diagonal line of sight. Also the skintones are appearing a bit orange to me but that could be a monitor issue.', '2005-08-19 23:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
