(1625584, 217902, 10261, '<td valign="top">If I were to infer the subject purely from the DOF I''d think that the bushes and stone curb were the intended topic. If this shot is supposed to be about rain, shooting the fractured reflections of the people in the puddle would have both met the challenge theme and added a clear subject.</td>', 'If I were to infer the subject purely from the DOF I''d think that the bushes and stone curb were the intended topic. If this shot is supposed to be about rain, shooting the fractured reflections of the people in the puddle would have both met the challenge theme and added a clear subject.', '2005-08-20 03:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625590, 218105, 10261, '<td valign="top">As presented here, this looks like a snapshot. With a little editing (burn the sky, make it look dark enough that it''s not obvious that this was a very sunny day) it could be a decent entry. The lines clearly visible in the pavement below the puddle steal attention from the reflection.</td>', 'As presented here, this looks like a snapshot. With a little editing (burn the sky, make it look dark enough that it''s not obvious that this was a very sunny day) it could be a decent entry. The lines clearly visible in the pavement below the puddle steal attention from the reflection.', '2005-08-20 03:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
