(1625634, 217840, 10261, '<td valign="top">The focus isn''t particularly sharp. With a shot this minimalistic such technical details are critical. Nice bokeh.</td>', 'The focus isn''t particularly sharp. With a shot this minimalistic such technical details are critical. Nice bokeh.', '2005-08-20 03:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625636, 217828, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is a very refreshing shot. I like the droplets on the lime and the texture is even more evident.</td>', 'This is a very refreshing shot. I like the droplets on the lime and the texture is even more evident.', '2005-08-20 03:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625639, 218050, 37893, '<td valign="top">Are these mussels? I''m not understanding your title. Anyway, I think you definitely captured rain in this shot. I like how the rain juxtaposes against the jagged edges of the rocks.</td>', 'Are these mussels? I''m not understanding your title. Anyway, I think you definitely captured rain in this shot. I like how the rain juxtaposes against the jagged edges of the rocks.', '2005-08-20 03:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625641, 217539, 37893, '<td valign="top">very nice. i like the waterfall effect of this. i know this has got to be staged because rain doesn''t fall in buckets like that or at least rain that i''ve seen. 8</td>', 'very nice. i like the waterfall effect of this. i know this has got to be staged because rain doesn''t fall in buckets like that or at least rain that i''ve seen. 8', '2005-08-20 03:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625642, 217489, 10261, '<td valign="top">The rain isn''t as visible as I would like for this challenge. Perhaps if you''d have cast some light across the path of the drops they''d have reflected some light toward the camera. I don''t care for the hue, but otherwise I really like this shot.</td>', 'The rain isn''t as visible as I would like for this challenge. Perhaps if you''d have cast some light across the path of the drops they''d have reflected some light toward the camera. I don''t care for the hue, but otherwise I really like this shot.', '2005-08-20 03:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625643, 217140, 37893, '<td valign="top">a fountain shot huh? this is still great and won''t get docked points in my book. i do like the fun aspect in this photo... great capture. 6</td>', 'a fountain shot huh? this is still great and won''t get docked points in my book. i do like the fun aspect in this photo... great capture. 6', '2005-08-20 03:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625644, 218011, 37893, '<td valign="top">the stone column is a bit distracting as well as the hammock... i think tyhis would have been better had the fruit stand alone against the green leaves of the tree... 6</td>', 'the stone column is a bit distracting as well as the hammock... i think tyhis would have been better had the fruit stand alone against the green leaves of the tree... 6', '2005-08-20 03:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625645, 216793, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that this would have been much more impressive in color. B&amp;W tends to emphasize the textures, and there aren''t many present in this image.</td>', 'I think that this would have been much more impressive in color. B&W tends to emphasize the textures, and there aren''t many present in this image.', '2005-08-20 03:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625647, 216833, 10261, '<td valign="top">I really like the illumination patterns below the drops.</td>', 'I really like the illumination patterns below the drops.', '2005-08-20 03:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625648, 217858, 37893, '<td valign="top">the fact that his feet is cut off bugs me a tad... the whole concept of the image is great and i would like to see more of the swing as well... 6</td>', 'the fact that his feet is cut off bugs me a tad... the whole concept of the image is great and i would like to see more of the swing as well... 6', '2005-08-20 03:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625651, 217764, 37893, '<td valign="top">great capture. the rain trails are good and i love seeing them here against the bokeh and the leaves :) 6</td>', 'great capture. the rain trails are good and i love seeing them here against the bokeh and the leaves :) 6', '2005-08-20 03:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625653, 217646, 37893, '<td valign="top">cute! shame on you for letting your daughte walk alone in the rain :) this photo reminds me a lot of my youth... i think the composition works well in this image... i wonder how this would have turned out if it were a selective desat? 7</td>', 'cute! shame on you for letting your daughte walk alone in the rain :) this photo reminds me a lot of my youth... i think the composition works well in this image... i wonder how this would have turned out if it were a selective desat? 7', '2005-08-20 03:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625655, 218032, 10261, '<td valign="top">The large leaf in the foreground seems to be obstructing the small portion of the image which is in focus. A composition which better indicated the intended subject of the image would have improved this shot dramatically. Personally, I prefer the drops clinging to the coniferous tree over those on the leaves in the foreground.</td>', 'The large leaf in the foreground seems to be obstructing the small portion of the image which is in focus. A composition which better indicated the intended subject of the image would have improved this shot dramatically. Personally, I prefer the drops clinging to the coniferous tree over those on the leaves in the foreground.', '2005-08-20 03:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625658, 217745, 37893, '<td valign="top">the flower to the left is distracting in the overall scheme of things... make it simple and hold the other flower back so one yellow flower stands proud between all the greens :) 6</td>', 'the flower to the left is distracting in the overall scheme of things... make it simple and hold the other flower back so one yellow flower stands proud between all the greens :) 6', '2005-08-20 04:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625659, 217880, 10261, '<td valign="top">If rain drops were clearly visible I would have given this a higher score. I''d like this image better if there was a clear subject; as it is my attention is divided between the silhouette of the woman, the portion of the garden which is in sharp focus, and the flowers, bird feeder and trellis, which seem to be the most interesting thing in the image.</td>', 'If rain drops were clearly visible I would have given this a higher score. I''d like this image better if there was a clear subject; as it is my attention is divided between the silhouette of the woman, the portion of the garden which is in sharp focus, and the flowers, bird feeder and trellis, which seem to be the most interesting thing in the image.', '2005-08-20 04:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625660, 217948, 37893, '<td valign="top">a bit too much PP IMHO... if not, then you fooled me here... the ripples on the water is a great contrast against the drops :) love it! 7</td>', 'a bit too much PP IMHO... if not, then you fooled me here... the ripples on the water is a great contrast against the drops :) love it! 7', '2005-08-20 04:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625661, 217651, 37893, '<td valign="top">this is lacking some sharp focus... maybe a bit of USM would do the trick... great background blur and i like the assymetry of having three leaves :) 6</td>', 'this is lacking some sharp focus... maybe a bit of USM would do the trick... great background blur and i like the assymetry of having three leaves :) 6', '2005-08-20 04:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625663, 218103, 37893, '<td valign="top">simple and straightforward... i think the tree trunk on the right is a tad too dark hence my eye seems to gravitate back there all the time... remember that viewer tends to follow lines in your image... i wish there was an end point to your leading line :( 7</td>', 'simple and straightforward... i think the tree trunk on the right is a tad too dark hence my eye seems to gravitate back there all the time... remember that viewer tends to follow lines in your image... i wish there was an end point to your leading line :( 7', '2005-08-20 04:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625665, 216104, 10261, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. So far this is easily my highest pick for the ribbon.</td>', 'Excellent composition. So far this is easily my highest pick for the ribbon.', '2005-08-20 04:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625667, 217318, 10261, '<td valign="top">I see a hint of moisture, but no clear depiction of rain. Interesting macro shot.</td>', 'I see a hint of moisture, but no clear depiction of rain. Interesting macro shot.', '2005-08-20 04:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625668, 218032, 37893, '<td valign="top">i love the background blur but there seems to be a lack of sharpness on the main subject... a bit of USM? 6</td>', 'i love the background blur but there seems to be a lack of sharpness on the main subject... a bit of USM? 6', '2005-08-20 04:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625670, 217497, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot. Seems a bit of burning in PP but it''s still great! I love the motion and teh fluidity of the shot. That red thing above the truck is a bit distracting IMHO.</td>', 'I think this is a great shot. Seems a bit of burning in PP but it''s still great! I love the motion and teh fluidity of the shot. That red thing above the truck is a bit distracting IMHO.', '2005-08-20 04:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625671, 217257, 10261, '<td valign="top">The composition would have been stronger if the light green item just behind the top petal weren''t there. This would be more clearly on-topic if there was a clear depiction of rain (not just moisture) in the image.</td>', 'The composition would have been stronger if the light green item just behind the top petal weren''t there. This would be more clearly on-topic if there was a clear depiction of rain (not just moisture) in the image.', '2005-08-20 04:08:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1625673, 217174, 10261, '<td valign="top">The focus isn''t particularly sharp. With a shot this minimalistic such technical details are critical. Nice bokeh and wonderful composition.</td>', 'The focus isn''t particularly sharp. With a shot this minimalistic such technical details are critical. Nice bokeh and wonderful composition.', '2005-08-20 04:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625674, 218034, 37893, '<td valign="top">too much burnign IMHO. the kids right leg is oversaturated and so are his arms compared to the rest of his body... the tilt of the camera adds a fanciful respite from the usual straight on images... a fun shot overall... 7</td>', 'too much burnign IMHO. the kids right leg is oversaturated and so are his arms compared to the rest of his body... the tilt of the camera adds a fanciful respite from the usual straight on images... a fun shot overall... 7', '2005-08-20 04:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625676, 217110, 37893, '<td valign="top">i love the impressionistic aspect of this image... the eveness and symmetry of the water bothers me a tad but not too much... 7</td>', 'i love the impressionistic aspect of this image... the eveness and symmetry of the water bothers me a tad but not too much... 7', '2005-08-20 04:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625678, 217866, 37893, '<td valign="top">that is one menacing sky... IMHO that little rock at the bottom right hand corner is a bit distracting because the ground plane is continuous but jogs at that location... clone it out or crop tighter... 7</td>', 'that is one menacing sky... IMHO that little rock at the bottom right hand corner is a bit distracting because the ground plane is continuous but jogs at that location... clone it out or crop tighter... 7', '2005-08-20 04:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625679, 217646, 10261, '<td valign="top">Slightly sharper focus and more contrastly editing would have pushed this photo from really good to great. The heida edit of this shot would easily take the blue ribbon. Wonderful composition.</td>', 'Slightly sharper focus and more contrastly editing would have pushed this photo from really good to great. The heida edit of this shot would easily take the blue ribbon. Wonderful composition.', '2005-08-20 04:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625684, 218044, 10261, '<td valign="top">The corner of the umbrella seems to be in sharper focus than the drop; reversing this would result in a stronger image. Rendering this in B&amp;W and cropping to include less of the umbrella would have garnered a higher vote from me.</td>', 'The corner of the umbrella seems to be in sharper focus than the drop; reversing this would result in a stronger image. Rendering this in B&W and cropping to include less of the umbrella would have garnered a higher vote from me.', '2005-08-20 04:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625685, 218105, 37893, '<td valign="top">lose the rubber ducky... this is a great shot by itself :) i love his expression... bumping up to 7</td>', 'lose the rubber ducky... this is a great shot by itself :) i love his expression... bumping up to 7', '2005-08-20 04:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625686, 217021, 10261, '<td valign="top">The clear water droplets are good, but the stark shadows that they''re casting on the girl are distracting. Using a light source closer to perpendicular relative to the camera would have reduced this.</td>', 'The clear water droplets are good, but the stark shadows that they''re casting on the girl are distracting. Using a light source closer to perpendicular relative to the camera would have reduced this.', '2005-08-20 04:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625689, 217904, 37893, '<td valign="top">it''s almost x-files like... i don''t really know why but there''s something about the setting of this image that appeals to me very much 7</td>', 'it''s almost x-files like... i don''t really know why but there''s something about the setting of this image that appeals to me very much 7', '2005-08-20 04:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625690, 216918, 10261, '<td valign="top">I believe that this is the 5th through the windshield shot that I''ve seen so far. An interesting or original subject outside the car would have helped this one to stand apart from the rest.</td>', 'I believe that this is the 5th through the windshield shot that I''ve seen so far. An interesting or original subject outside the car would have helped this one to stand apart from the rest.', '2005-08-20 04:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625691, 217194, 37893, '<td valign="top">now how did you ever get rain trails that long? PP perhaps? IMHO the image is a tad too dark and it seems like you had to dodge the pages just a bit to bring out a bit of detail... 6</td>', 'now how did you ever get rain trails that long? PP perhaps? IMHO the image is a tad too dark and it seems like you had to dodge the pages just a bit to bring out a bit of detail... 6', '2005-08-20 04:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625694, 217946, 37893, '<td valign="top">a little rain shouldn''t dampen the occassion :) the lonlely bench is a great take on this challenege... IMHO, clone out that patch of paved walkway to the bottom right...</td>', 'a little rain shouldn''t dampen the occassion :) the lonlely bench is a great take on this challenege... IMHO, clone out that patch of paved walkway to the bottom right...', '2005-08-20 04:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625695, 217968, 10261, '<td valign="top">The editing seems slightly overdone; the sky looks unnatural and the textures seem oversharpened. Even so, this is one of my higher-rated images in this challenge.</td>', 'The editing seems slightly overdone; the sky looks unnatural and the textures seem oversharpened. Even so, this is one of my higher-rated images in this challenge.', '2005-08-20 04:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625698, 217485, 10261, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation is very distracting and detracts from the image.</td>', 'The selective desaturation is very distracting and detracts from the image.', '2005-08-20 04:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625705, 217781, 10261, '<td valign="top">This would have been a much stronger image with just the tree silhouette and the sky. Increasing the saturation on the sky somewhat would have helped to give this image an added kick.</td>', 'This would have been a much stronger image with just the tree silhouette and the sky. Increasing the saturation on the sky somewhat would have helped to give this image an added kick.', '2005-08-20 04:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625706, 216054, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the action in the foreground, but I find the background to be little more than a distraction. A shallower DOF would have helped to reduce the distraction.</td>', 'I like the action in the foreground, but I find the background to be little more than a distraction. A shallower DOF would have helped to reduce the distraction.', '2005-08-20 04:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625710, 216431, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would like this shot better if it didn''t look so posed. The blown out highlights on the bottom and right edges of the window frame are somewhat distracting, and I''d like to see a better reflection in the right side of the window.</td>', 'I would like this shot better if it didn''t look so posed. The blown out highlights on the bottom and right edges of the window frame are somewhat distracting, and I''d like to see a better reflection in the right side of the window.', '2005-08-20 04:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625723, 216839, 36881, '<td valign="top">hahaha love it :D</td>', 'hahaha love it :D', '2005-08-20 04:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625736, 217450, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is rad! The foreground lighting almost seems too bright for the scene. Quite dramatic though. I''m also almost tempted to guess theat the "rain" are smudges put on the camera lense. But sure does look like rain (and I believe that it is), so great capture!</td>', 'Wow, this is rad! The foreground lighting almost seems too bright for the scene. Quite dramatic though. I''m also almost tempted to guess theat the "rain" are smudges put on the camera lense. But sure does look like rain (and I believe that it is), so great capture!', '2005-08-20 06:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625737, 218058, 9668, '<td valign="top">The top leaves see a tad distracting, but you can definatly see the rain, and the effects off it. Great movement to this image. What''s up with the title? Sideways rain drops?</td>', 'The top leaves see a tad distracting, but you can definatly see the rain, and the effects off it. Great movement to this image. What''s up with the title? Sideways rain drops?', '2005-08-20 06:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625738, 217866, 9668, '<td valign="top">Where are you 14,000 feet. Only a few places on the eath are that high. I''m guessing Mauna Kea in Hawaii. Though it is the coming of rain, doesn''t say rain to me though. Like the trio of people.</td>', 'Where are you 14,000 feet. Only a few places on the eath are that high. I''m guessing Mauna Kea in Hawaii. Though it is the coming of rain, doesn''t say rain to me though. Like the trio of people.', '2005-08-20 06:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625739, 217433, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great color! I like the selective desat.</td>', 'Great color! I like the selective desat.', '2005-08-20 06:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625740, 216389, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gritty, contrasty, nice.</td>', 'Gritty, contrasty, nice.', '2005-08-20 06:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625741, 216839, 9668, '<td valign="top">Crazy lightning strike! Wish I had an image like this!</td>', 'Crazy lightning strike! Wish I had an image like this!', '2005-08-20 06:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625743, 217257, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous color and sharpness!!! I love it.</td>', 'Fabulous color and sharpness!!! I love it.', '2005-08-20 06:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625744, 215903, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awsome landscape shot. I love beams of light like this, and this is just stunning.</td>', 'Awsome landscape shot. I love beams of light like this, and this is just stunning.', '2005-08-20 06:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625745, 216431, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great framing! Nice dramatic pose.</td>', 'Great framing! Nice dramatic pose.', '2005-08-20 06:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625746, 217857, 9668, '<td valign="top">Neat macro, love the precision of it.</td>', 'Neat macro, love the precision of it.', '2005-08-20 06:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625747, 217968, 22748, '<td valign="top">Unbelievably great color!! I love the dramatic effect. Some may say "it''s overprocessed" but really they are just jealous that you have such amazing skill.</td>', 'Unbelievably great color!! I love the dramatic effect. Some may say "it''s overprocessed" but really they are just jealous that you have such amazing skill.', '2005-08-20 06:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625749, 217759, 9668, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better if the focus were on the foregroun (the mother and daughter) rather then the background. I like how you''ve got the streaks of rain though.</td>', 'I think it would be better if the focus were on the foregroun (the mother and daughter) rather then the background. I like how you''ve got the streaks of rain though.', '2005-08-20 06:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625750, 217973, 9668, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say, but this looks like it was taken indoors. The off color lighting and the solid backgroun make it look like it was a studio shot. Like the water drops though</td>', 'I''m sorry to say, but this looks like it was taken indoors. The off color lighting and the solid backgroun make it look like it was a studio shot. Like the water drops though', '2005-08-20 06:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625752, 217703, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely golden lighting. Seems to glow.</td>', 'Lovely golden lighting. Seems to glow.', '2005-08-20 06:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625754, 217498, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. The little streaks of rain, the splashes, and the white flower for the eye to come back and focus on again. Great job!</td>', 'Love this shot. The little streaks of rain, the splashes, and the white flower for the eye to come back and focus on again. Great job!', '2005-08-20 06:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625755, 217787, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love the tones of this image, though I''m afraid the DPC literalist and going to chew you up for not actually being rain.</td>', 'Love the tones of this image, though I''m afraid the DPC literalist and going to chew you up for not actually being rain.', '2005-08-20 06:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625756, 217969, 40980, '<td valign="top">Works for me.I like it</td>', 'Works for me.I like it', '2005-08-20 06:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625757, 217703, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous color and contrast in this image! Really beautiful.</td>', 'Fabulous color and contrast in this image! Really beautiful.', '2005-08-20 06:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625758, 216839, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great lightning shot! This is difficult to do so well.</td>', 'Great lightning shot! This is difficult to do so well.', '2005-08-20 06:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625760, 217880, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea, lovingly captured.  There are technically better photographs in the challenge, but none that are more thoughtful and elegant than this.  Terrific composition, too.  And a great title.  8</td>', 'Lovely idea, lovingly captured.  There are technically better photographs in the challenge, but none that are more thoughtful and elegant than this.  Terrific composition, too.  And a great title.  8', '2005-08-20 06:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625763, 217485, 22748, '<td valign="top">Incredible image!! Very very dramatic, I love the selective desat and the dramatic contrasty feel to the image.</td>', 'Incredible image!! Very very dramatic, I love the selective desat and the dramatic contrasty feel to the image.', '2005-08-20 06:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625764, 217948, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous smoothness and color. Really beautiful image.</td>', 'Fabulous smoothness and color. Really beautiful image.', '2005-08-20 06:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625791, 217758, 36199, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the colour in the drops against the background</td>', 'I particularly like the colour in the drops against the background', '2005-08-20 08:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625884, 217929, 42253, '<td valign="top">Very nice!<br/> <br/>I like how you captured the full range of a thunderstorm''s power.</td>', 'Very nice! I like how you captured the full range of a thunderstorm''s power.', '2005-08-20 09:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625885, 217764, 42253, '<td valign="top">NIce shot!<br/> <br/>Minimal but shows the theme well and the tonal range is nice.</td>', 'NIce shot! Minimal but shows the theme well and the tonal range is nice.', '2005-08-20 09:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625887, 217389, 42253, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!<br/> <br/>Shows the theme clearly and gives us a burst of color to make the image pop</td>', 'Very nice!! Shows the theme clearly and gives us a burst of color to make the image pop', '2005-08-20 09:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625898, 217894, 42253, '<td valign="top">Nice image!<br/> <br/>Conveys the theme well</td>', 'Nice image! Conveys the theme well', '2005-08-20 10:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625900, 218041, 34659, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the colors.  The spider looks overprocessed/sharpened to me.  He''s OOF too.  Looks like the DOF was set too close or too far away.  Still, not a bad shot.</td>', 'I like the composition and the colors.  The spider looks overprocessed/sharpened to me.  He''s OOF too.  Looks like the DOF was set too close or too far away.  Still, not a bad shot.', '2005-08-20 10:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625903, 215552, 42253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!<br/> <br/>Great use of color and compo to enhance the theme.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice shot! Great use of color and compo to enhance the theme. ', '2005-08-20 10:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625904, 217779, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good shot.  I think the B/W works well.  Not sure about the composition though - the railing hides the guy''s expression.  Still, not a bad entry.</td>', 'This is a pretty good shot.  I think the B/W works well.  Not sure about the composition though - the railing hides the guy''s expression.  Still, not a bad entry.', '2005-08-20 10:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625905, 216271, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think technically this is a pretty good shot.  The subject matter, however, is not that interesting to me personally.  You''ve got good color, lines, and "mood".</td>', 'I think technically this is a pretty good shot.  The subject matter, however, is not that interesting to me personally.  You''ve got good color, lines, and "mood".', '2005-08-20 10:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625906, 216389, 42253, '<td valign="top">Very nice representation of the concept</td>', 'Very nice representation of the concept', '2005-08-20 10:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625908, 218065, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow - very glad I came back to this the 3rd time.  I missed a lot on the first two passes.  Great reflections in the water droplets!  Good focus, DOF, &amp; color too.  Very nice job.  Bumping up again.</td>', 'Wow - very glad I came back to this the 3rd time.  I missed a lot on the first two passes.  Great reflections in the water droplets!  Good focus, DOF, & color too.  Very nice job.  Bumping up again.', '2005-08-20 10:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625909, 216000, 42253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wonderful image! ', '2005-08-20 10:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625911, 216763, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and pretty good composition.  IMHO, the dark areas are too indeterminate and the brighter areas have a glare from the light.  I think you could adjust the contrast, backlighting/exposure, and bump up the colors to improve upon it a bit.</td>', 'Nice idea and pretty good composition.  IMHO, the dark areas are too indeterminate and the brighter areas have a glare from the light.  I think you could adjust the contrast, backlighting/exposure, and bump up the colors to improve upon it a bit.', '2005-08-20 10:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625914, 218091, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think this was a good idea, but it''s so dark that it''s difficult to determine what is really being reflected (if anything).  IMHO, you might consider including whatever the light source is in the crop.  That would help the viewers get their bearings.</td>', 'I think this was a good idea, but it''s so dark that it''s difficult to determine what is really being reflected (if anything).  IMHO, you might consider including whatever the light source is in the crop.  That would help the viewers get their bearings.', '2005-08-20 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625916, 217209, 34659, '<td valign="top">While not a bad shot technically (although I think the DOF could have been a bit larger), the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest very well.</td>', 'While not a bad shot technically (although I think the DOF could have been a bit larger), the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest very well.', '2005-08-20 10:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625917, 216903, 34659, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, but the image is too blurred for me to really make much sense of it.  From an abstract perspective, the balance is appealing, but I''m not sure it has the pop it needs to stand alone in this manner.</td>', 'I like the colors, but the image is too blurred for me to really make much sense of it.  From an abstract perspective, the balance is appealing, but I''m not sure it has the pop it needs to stand alone in this manner.', '2005-08-20 10:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625919, 217029, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think you''ll probably get hurt by viewers who don''t consider that there is really any rain in the shot (the sun is apparent from the right and the water is obviously being sprayed/thrown at the dog.  That fact aside, I think it is a cute picture and the focus &amp; DOF are both good.</td>', 'I think you''ll probably get hurt by viewers who don''t consider that there is really any rain in the shot (the sun is apparent from the right and the water is obviously being sprayed/thrown at the dog.  That fact aside, I think it is a cute picture and the focus & DOF are both good.', '2005-08-20 10:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625920, 217211, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the composition, but would have liked it even better with the spider.  You might also consider pumping up the colors a touch.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the composition, but would have liked it even better with the spider.  You might also consider pumping up the colors a touch.', '2005-08-20 10:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625922, 217878, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot technically at all.  Nice perspective, focus, &amp; DOF.  Natural colors too and the lighting isn''t bad.  Unfortunately, though, the subject matter really doesn''t grab me personally.</td>', 'Not a bad shot technically at all.  Nice perspective, focus, & DOF.  Natural colors too and the lighting isn''t bad.  Unfortunately, though, the subject matter really doesn''t grab me personally.', '2005-08-20 10:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625923, 217580, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is a much better shot upon closer examination than at first glance.  You got some amazing detail in the puddle reflection and I like the warm tones.  The pavement texture is a bit distracting though.  Still, good shot.  Bumping up.</td>', 'This is a much better shot upon closer examination than at first glance.  You got some amazing detail in the puddle reflection and I like the warm tones.  The pavement texture is a bit distracting though.  Still, good shot.  Bumping up.', '2005-08-20 10:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625924, 218032, 34659, '<td valign="top">Pretty good composition, but the focus &amp; DOF are off.  Also, the image is a bit grainy and I think you could bump up the color &amp; contrast a bit.  Still, not a bad shot.</td>', 'Pretty good composition, but the focus & DOF are off.  Also, the image is a bit grainy and I think you could bump up the color & contrast a bit.  Still, not a bad shot.', '2005-08-20 10:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625927, 217333, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice glistening effects, but I''m not sure the subject matter holds my interest personally.  It''s a pretty good shot technically though - focus &amp; DOF aren''t bad.</td>', 'Nice glistening effects, but I''m not sure the subject matter holds my interest personally.  It''s a pretty good shot technically though - focus & DOF aren''t bad.', '2005-08-20 10:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625929, 215995, 34659, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of selective desat.  Not sure it works for me personally, although there are some aspects of it that I do like.  If you had brought out all the browns and blueish-greens it might have had more appeal for me.  Still, it is an interesting take.</td>', 'Interesting choice of selective desat.  Not sure it works for me personally, although there are some aspects of it that I do like.  If you had brought out all the browns and blueish-greens it might have had more appeal for me.  Still, it is an interesting take.', '2005-08-20 10:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625931, 217840, 42253, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!</td>', 'Very nice!!', '2005-08-20 10:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625932, 216705, 34659, '<td valign="top">Pretty good emotive shot.  The lighting is a bit harsh IMHO, but I like the muted colors.  The composition is good too.</td>', 'Pretty good emotive shot.  The lighting is a bit harsh IMHO, but I like the muted colors.  The composition is good too.', '2005-08-20 10:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625933, 217820, 34659, '<td valign="top">Is this the same couple I saw on the boat?  ;-)  Actually, I think this shot works better, as there are fewer things in the foreground to be a distraction.  I think the colors could use a bump or two.</td>', 'Is this the same couple I saw on the boat?  ;-)  Actually, I think this shot works better, as there are fewer things in the foreground to be a distraction.  I think the colors could use a bump or two.', '2005-08-20 10:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625935, 216793, 42253, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2005-08-20 10:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625936, 216148, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot - good focus, although I think the DOF is a bit shallow.  Also, the greens look unnatural (maybe too much processing?).  Still, a pleasing image.</td>', 'Not a bad shot - good focus, although I think the DOF is a bit shallow.  Also, the greens look unnatural (maybe too much processing?).  Still, a pleasing image.', '2005-08-20 10:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625938, 217821, 34659, '<td valign="top">I like the very abstract feel of this.  I don''t get the title (but I''m not considering it in the score).  This has some really nice sparkly/glistening effects and I like the lines/composition.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the very abstract feel of this.  I don''t get the title (but I''m not considering it in the score).  This has some really nice sparkly/glistening effects and I like the lines/composition.  Nice job.', '2005-08-20 10:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625939, 217759, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but I think the foreground is too light to be a good silhouette and too dark to be a good illumination.  The blown out sky is also a distraction.  I think you could improve upon this shot by straightening the horizon, cropping more off the top, adding light to the foreground and contrast to outside.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but I think the foreground is too light to be a good silhouette and too dark to be a good illumination.  The blown out sky is also a distraction.  I think you could improve upon this shot by straightening the horizon, cropping more off the top, adding light to the foreground and contrast to outside.', '2005-08-20 10:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625941, 216644, 34659, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like the whole screen thing.  The label on the chair is distracting though, as is the glare on the table.  Still, a unique take on the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like the whole screen thing.  The label on the chair is distracting though, as is the glare on the table.  Still, a unique take on the challenge.', '2005-08-20 10:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625946, 218105, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection, the addition of the duck is great. I think this would have worked without the child''s boots being in the frame as well.</td>', 'Very nice reflection, the addition of the duck is great. I think this would have worked without the child''s boots being in the frame as well.', '2005-08-20 10:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625950, 217308, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. B&amp;W works well and the shutter speed caught the rain as well. Good Luck 8</td>', 'Very nice photo. B&W works well and the shutter speed caught the rain as well. Good Luck 8', '2005-08-20 10:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
