(1625961, 217224, 33515, '<td valign="top">Recommended for a DQ, sorry to hear that, but I always vote these a little higher. Nice effect with the rain. I hope you post the details so we can see how you did this. Good Luck 9</td>', 'Recommended for a DQ, sorry to hear that, but I always vote these a little higher. Nice effect with the rain. I hope you post the details so we can see how you did this. Good Luck 9', '2005-08-20 10:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
