(1626217, 217310, 34759, '<td valign="top">I like the rich colors and textures in this one. Some people may complain that they don''t see rain, but to me the storm clouds show enough of a connection to rain. Great shot!</td>', 'I like the rich colors and textures in this one. Some people may complain that they don''t see rain, but to me the storm clouds show enough of a connection to rain. Great shot!', '2005-08-20 13:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
