(1626224, 215701, 37961, '<td valign="top">Good subject and posing. His face does look a little overexposed though. I realize these things are hard to fix, and personally, it doesn''t lower my opinion of this photo because I don''t see that as a flaw.</td>', 'Good subject and posing. His face does look a little overexposed though. I realize these things are hard to fix, and personally, it doesn''t lower my opinion of this photo because I don''t see that as a flaw.', '2005-08-20 13:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
