(1626249, 217858, 35357, '<td valign="top">Catching water in his hand makes this photo for me, a really good idea.  The composition somehow doesn''t suit the subject, I think this could be improved if you work to make his hand the primary subject, and flow can go up the dropping water to his face.</td>', 'Catching water in his hand makes this photo for me, a really good idea.  The composition somehow doesn''t suit the subject, I think this could be improved if you work to make his hand the primary subject, and flow can go up the dropping water to his face.', '2005-08-20 14:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
