(1626259, 218103, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the dark, raininess, natural framing, and curved lines.  Nicely composed, but the subject matter is rather ''dry''.</td>', 'I like the dark, raininess, natural framing, and curved lines.  Nicely composed, but the subject matter is rather ''dry''.', '2005-08-20 14:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
