(1626506, 218058, 37893, '<td valign="top">the blur of the foregroun image is too heavy against the smaller leaves of the subject... good capture and right on theme... maybe a tighter crop? 6</td>', 'the blur of the foregroun image is too heavy against the smaller leaves of the subject... good capture and right on theme... maybe a tighter crop? 6', '2005-08-20 16:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626509, 217736, 37893, '<td valign="top">not much rain evident here except for a heavy mist probably... why? the drops aren''t obvious on the water''s surface... nevertheless, i think it''s a good shot although very "snapshot" like... the man''s elbow being cut off the frame is bothersome as well as the other person having their back turned against the camera... 5</td>', 'not much rain evident here except for a heavy mist probably... why? the drops aren''t obvious on the water''s surface... nevertheless, i think it''s a good shot although very "snapshot" like... the man''s elbow being cut off the frame is bothersome as well as the other person having their back turned against the camera... 5', '2005-08-20 16:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626510, 217330, 30896, '<td valign="top">cool. the grain and softness work very well for the picture - except may be her face. i wander what settings you had.</td>', 'cool. the grain and softness work very well for the picture - except may be her face. i wander what settings you had.', '2005-08-20 16:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626511, 216763, 37893, '<td valign="top">good capture here but the light is a bit too harsh... burn it a tad to tone it down just a little...</td>', 'good capture here but the light is a bit too harsh... burn it a tad to tone it down just a little...', '2005-08-20 16:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626512, 218058, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the title, but I think the picture is very nice. The blurry leaves in the top foreground are distracting to me, but the rest of the image is one of my favorites so far. I love the subtle, but rich colors. That pale green with the strong, rain-streaked  gray look great!</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the title, but I think the picture is very nice. The blurry leaves in the top foreground are distracting to me, but the rest of the image is one of my favorites so far. I love the subtle, but rich colors. That pale green with the strong, rain-streaked  gray look great!', '2005-08-20 16:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626513, 216644, 37893, '<td valign="top">seems like you did quite a bit of dodging here... nothing wrong with that at all :) lose the green tarp so that only the dark wood patio and the stark white chairs are left for the viewer to appreciate... 5</td>', 'seems like you did quite a bit of dodging here... nothing wrong with that at all :) lose the green tarp so that only the dark wood patio and the stark white chairs are left for the viewer to appreciate... 5', '2005-08-20 16:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626514, 217194, 35357, '<td valign="top">Oh my, not a very good rain simulation, but oh well, good for you for getting the hose out and soaking a book.  This is quite an unusual photo.  I''m nearly finished scoring this challenge and I''m pretty sure that there won''t be any other entries where someone has turned the hose on a book.  I don''t find anything interesting in this shot other than the intrigue of what would posess someone to come up with the idea of hosing down a book and calling it "Forgotten".  It is for this reason alone I''m giving this shot a 10.  Of course, if I suddenly hit several more entries of books being hosed down, I''ll come back &amp; adjust.</td>', 'Oh my, not a very good rain simulation, but oh well, good for you for getting the hose out and soaking a book.  This is quite an unusual photo.  I''m nearly finished scoring this challenge and I''m pretty sure that there won''t be any other entries where someone has turned the hose on a book.  I don''t find anything interesting in this shot other than the intrigue of what would posess someone to come up with the idea of hosing down a book and calling it "Forgotten".  It is for this reason alone I''m giving this shot a 10.  Of course, if I suddenly hit several more entries of books being hosed down, I''ll come back & adjust.', '2005-08-20 16:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626515, 216910, 37893, '<td valign="top">this is good example of a bokeh shot :)</td>', 'this is good example of a bokeh shot :)', '2005-08-20 16:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626519, 218038, 37893, '<td valign="top">this is very snapshot like... the little oys shirt is a bit blown... nothing much to say really except probably a better composition of the image... the viewers eye (mine) is lead away from the image because my eye tends to follow what the little boy is looking at and when i look... there''s hardly anything there except for the blocks and the rubber duck :( 5</td>', 'this is very snapshot like... the little oys shirt is a bit blown... nothing much to say really except probably a better composition of the image... the viewers eye (mine) is lead away from the image because my eye tends to follow what the little boy is looking at and when i look... there''s hardly anything there except for the blocks and the rubber duck :( 5', '2005-08-20 16:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626520, 216659, 31133, '<td valign="top">Cool title and nice composition!</td>', 'Cool title and nice composition!', '2005-08-20 16:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
