(1626740, 217257, 18197, '<td valign="top">The best of this subject in my opinion. Nice and sharp. Well saturated. You will get criticism for the centered comp but I think it works well here. Nicely done.</td>', 'The best of this subject in my opinion. Nice and sharp. Well saturated. You will get criticism for the centered comp but I think it works well here. Nicely done.', '2005-08-20 19:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
