(1626744, 216839, 18197, '<td valign="top">Title made me smile. Photo made me look. Well done!</td>', 'Title made me smile. Photo made me look. Well done!', '2005-08-20 19:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626746, 217534, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. Reminds me of storms at home! Midwest USA or possibly Wyoming or Montana?</td>', 'Fantastic shot. Reminds me of storms at home! Midwest USA or possibly Wyoming or Montana?', '2005-08-20 19:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626747, 216766, 18197, '<td valign="top">Hope this scores a ribbon. I love the diffused colors here. Nice comp. Feels "real" somehow.</td>', 'Hope this scores a ribbon. I love the diffused colors here. Nice comp. Feels "real" somehow.', '2005-08-20 19:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626757, 217787, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting choise to use bw on this.  It gives it a very "primitive" feeling, and I suspect helps the viewer to focus on the water more than the foliage and stuff around it.</td>', 'Interesting choise to use bw on this.  It gives it a very "primitive" feeling, and I suspect helps the viewer to focus on the water more than the foliage and stuff around it.', '2005-08-20 19:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626758, 215967, 811, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and focus.  As I sit here and look at it, I almost feel as if I am *in* the picture.  Good work.</td>', 'Great exposure and focus.  As I sit here and look at it, I almost feel as if I am *in* the picture.  Good work.', '2005-08-20 19:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626761, 216561, 811, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The simple colors are very appealing to me.  It does feel just a touch off balance, though, because the ducks are more *in* the frame than the rocks.  Just a tiny nitpick though.  Good work.</td>', 'I like this shot.  The simple colors are very appealing to me.  It does feel just a touch off balance, though, because the ducks are more *in* the frame than the rocks.  Just a tiny nitpick though.  Good work.', '2005-08-20 19:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626762, 217739, 18197, '<td valign="top">Extraordinarily good color. Nicely focused. Well composed. My vote for best of show. Well done!</td>', 'Extraordinarily good color. Nicely focused. Well composed. My vote for best of show. Well done!', '2005-08-20 19:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626765, 218034, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully emotive shot. Well executed.</td>', 'Wonderfully emotive shot. Well executed.', '2005-08-20 19:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626769, 215552, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice effect here with the colors.  Very edgy without being too "digitally-arty."</td>', 'Nice effect here with the colors.  Very edgy without being too "digitally-arty."', '2005-08-20 19:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626771, 217786, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. Unusual in the challenge. Creative. Well executed.</td>', 'Simply beautiful. Unusual in the challenge. Creative. Well executed.', '2005-08-20 19:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626773, 218103, 811, '<td valign="top">Definitely rain.  The road leads into (and out of) the frame nicely, but it seems a bit dark to me, with the one section on the far right being blown out.</td>', 'Definitely rain.  The road leads into (and out of) the frame nicely, but it seems a bit dark to me, with the one section on the far right being blown out.', '2005-08-20 19:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626774, 216104, 18197, '<td valign="top">This has a delightful "old west" feeling. It feels like something momentus is about to happen. Very very well done.</td>', 'This has a delightful "old west" feeling. It feels like something momentus is about to happen. Very very well done.', '2005-08-20 19:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626776, 217739, 811, '<td valign="top">Great shallow depth of field and focus.  The only thing not totally appealing to me is the colors, but i understand that you don''t control that. :)</td>', 'Great shallow depth of field and focus.  The only thing not totally appealing to me is the colors, but i understand that you don''t control that. :)', '2005-08-20 19:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626778, 217155, 18197, '<td valign="top">Superb lightning shot. I love that the top is blown out "by nature." I love the detail in the lightning bolt. The low horizon works well and is accentuated by the lights. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'Superb lightning shot. I love that the top is blown out "by nature." I love the detail in the lightning bolt. The low horizon works well and is accentuated by the lights. Hope it ribbons.', '2005-08-20 19:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626779, 217144, 811, '<td valign="top">I think adding a bit of context for this shot would have made it more interesting.  As it is, there is no where for the eyes to "rest" giving it the feeling that there isn''t really a subject (I know the subject is obvious, but . . .).  I almost feel like I''m looking at a shot where you "just missed" the subject in an action shot.</td>', 'I think adding a bit of context for this shot would have made it more interesting.  As it is, there is no where for the eyes to "rest" giving it the feeling that there isn''t really a subject (I know the subject is obvious, but . . .).  I almost feel like I''m looking at a shot where you "just missed" the subject in an action shot.', '2005-08-20 19:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626781, 217929, 18197, '<td valign="top">Right place at the right time. For me the composition is the best element of this photo. Color''s good. Contrast is good. Focus is good. But wow, what a composition! Well done.</td>', 'Right place at the right time. For me the composition is the best element of this photo. Color''s good. Contrast is good. Focus is good. But wow, what a composition! Well done.', '2005-08-20 19:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626784, 217113, 18197, '<td valign="top">If this is a real raindrop, you''ve shown me something about nature I didn''t know. Thanks! Well done.</td>', 'If this is a real raindrop, you''ve shown me something about nature I didn''t know. Thanks! Well done.', '2005-08-20 19:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626785, 217840, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, and the one drip "flowing" gives the shot a nice feeling of "action."</td>', 'I like the colors, and the one drip "flowing" gives the shot a nice feeling of "action."', '2005-08-20 19:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626786, 217779, 18197, '<td valign="top">This may be best in show. So well composed to create the emotional payload of rain and a dreary day. Hope it ribbons!</td>', 'This may be best in show. So well composed to create the emotional payload of rain and a dreary day. Hope it ribbons!', '2005-08-20 19:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626788, 217215, 18197, '<td valign="top">Relevance to challenge could be improved.</td>', 'Relevance to challenge could be improved.', '2005-08-20 19:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626792, 217889, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition -- I like how it leads from the lower left to the upper right, and i really like the contrast of the purple on the green.  A tighter crop on the right, though it would have "centered" the composition, would also make an effective shot, I think.</td>', 'Good composition -- I like how it leads from the lower left to the upper right, and i really like the contrast of the purple on the green.  A tighter crop on the right, though it would have "centered" the composition, would also make an effective shot, I think.', '2005-08-20 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626793, 216838, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot. The setup and composition are very good. Colors are good. Too heavy handed with post processing for my taste, however.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot. The setup and composition are very good. Colors are good. Too heavy handed with post processing for my taste, however.', '2005-08-20 19:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
