(1626796, 217110, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  It almost looks like a piece of aluminum foil reflecting something.  The colors are drab (as can be expected in rain), but if there had been anything that was bright or bold, it may have made the shot a bit more of an eye-grabber,.</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  It almost looks like a piece of aluminum foil reflecting something.  The colors are drab (as can be expected in rain), but if there had been anything that was bright or bold, it may have made the shot a bit more of an eye-grabber,.', '2005-08-20 19:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626802, 216271, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting and highly stylized image. Well composed. Hope it was done in the camera and if so, congrats on a great capture and presentation.</td>', 'Interesting and highly stylized image. Well composed. Hope it was done in the camera and if so, congrats on a great capture and presentation.', '2005-08-20 19:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
