(1626939, 217555, 40355, '<td valign="top">Oh, neat close up.  Like the ripples, the indents and raised water.  Also like the fact that it''s a mud puddle, not some typical clear-as-drinking-water shot.  The little plant on the left adds a nice bit of color.</td>', 'Oh, neat close up.  Like the ripples, the indents and raised water.  Also like the fact that it''s a mud puddle, not some typical clear-as-drinking-water shot.  The little plant on the left adds a nice bit of color.', '2005-08-20 20:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
