(1626960, 218049, 40355, '<td valign="top">I''d give it a border, and maybe crop just a bit off from the bottom, where it starts to get a bit dark.  Just MHO...  As it stands, a great shot!</td>', 'I''d give it a border, and maybe crop just a bit off from the bottom, where it starts to get a bit dark.  Just MHO...  As it stands, a great shot!', '2005-08-20 20:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
