(1626978, 217194, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very emotive shot.  I would NEVER leave one of my books out like this, so it makes me wonder what book it is, and why it''s there, and then a whole mess of other questions!  Love the idea, the B&amp;W, the presentation.  I''d recommend a black border.  Hope to see this on the winner''s page!  10</td>', 'Very emotive shot.  I would NEVER leave one of my books out like this, so it makes me wonder what book it is, and why it''s there, and then a whole mess of other questions!  Love the idea, the B&W, the presentation.  I''d recommend a black border.  Hope to see this on the winner''s page!  10', '2005-08-20 21:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626979, 216705, 34763, '<td valign="top">a story in itself, great work</td>', 'a story in itself, great work', '2005-08-20 21:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626980, 217482, 34763, '<td valign="top">minimalistic approach that looks and feels great</td>', 'minimalistic approach that looks and feels great', '2005-08-20 21:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626983, 217818, 40355, '<td valign="top">Too close, no outside influence to the shot.  Just *wham*, green.</td>', 'Too close, no outside influence to the shot.  Just *wham*, green.', '2005-08-20 21:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626986, 216442, 40355, '<td valign="top">Honestly, the title irks me.....</td>', 'Honestly, the title irks me.....', '2005-08-20 21:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626990, 216104, 40355, '<td valign="top">Ah, we may have found another of the winners!  Amazing shot, crips and clear and well composed.  Great contrast and subject matter.  Very Ansel Adams.  Wish the scores went higher than 10, ''cause it deserves higher.    10</td>', 'Ah, we may have found another of the winners!  Amazing shot, crips and clear and well composed.  Great contrast and subject matter.  Very Ansel Adams.  Wish the scores went higher than 10, ''cause it deserves higher.    10', '2005-08-20 21:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626995, 216050, 40355, '<td valign="top">Now that''s something you don''t see every day....  Huh.  Great shot, well composed, like the use of B&amp;W. 7</td>', 'Now that''s something you don''t see every day....  Huh.  Great shot, well composed, like the use of B&W. 7', '2005-08-20 21:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
