(1627025, 217534, 40355, '<td valign="top">Intense.  Great contrast and composition.  10</td>', 'Intense.  Great contrast and composition.  10', '2005-08-20 21:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627026, 216363, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wow, fantastic catch!  Going in my favs.</td>', 'Wow, fantastic catch!  Going in my favs.', '2005-08-20 21:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627032, 215961, 35357, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool shot.  Great negative space, great subject &amp; pose, the rain really works.  Fabulous!<br/> <br/>edit - I rated this a 10 to come back to later.  It has an unplaceable quality, a special photo, I think.  This is one of my three picks for a ribbon.</td>', 'This is a very cool shot.  Great negative space, great subject & pose, the rain really works.  Fabulous! edit - I rated this a 10 to come back to later.  It has an unplaceable quality, a special photo, I think.  This is one of my three picks for a ribbon.', '2005-08-20 21:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627034, 216104, 35357, '<td valign="top">An instant 10 from me.  I thought I''d already commented &amp; voted on this shot, something must have happened.  The title is so right, this is an extremely intense shot and an amazing capture, adding to my favs.  Lightening plus barbed wire plus dramatic clouds plus Clint Eastwood-style fence posts plus barren landscape equals Intense.  Arrange all of the above as you have composed and it equals Intensity!<br/> <br/>- edit- rated this guy a ten and have come back now to add that I''m picking this as one of the three ribbon winners, good luck!</td>', 'An instant 10 from me.  I thought I''d already commented & voted on this shot, something must have happened.  The title is so right, this is an extremely intense shot and an amazing capture, adding to my favs.  Lightening plus barbed wire plus dramatic clouds plus Clint Eastwood-style fence posts plus barren landscape equals Intense.  Arrange all of the above as you have composed and it equals Intensity! - edit- rated this guy a ten and have come back now to add that I''m picking this as one of the three ribbon winners, good luck!', '2005-08-20 21:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627036, 217968, 35357, '<td valign="top">I love the drama and dark flavour of this shot.  It''s mysterious subject behind the umbrella, stopped at the water''s edge leaves me wondering at the story.  Very Joey Lawrence-esque.<br/> <br/>-edit- I rated this a ten to come back to later.  I''m picking this as one of my three favourites for a ribbon, good luck!</td>', 'I love the drama and dark flavour of this shot.  It''s mysterious subject behind the umbrella, stopped at the water''s edge leaves me wondering at the story.  Very Joey Lawrence-esque. -edit- I rated this a ten to come back to later.  I''m picking this as one of my three favourites for a ribbon, good luck!', '2005-08-20 21:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627037, 217330, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice piece of art!  I like the bold, slightly grainy colours and blur form motion.  This is a nice story, very well done!<br/> <br/>edit - picking this as a top ten shot, good luck!</td>', 'Wow, nice piece of art!  I like the bold, slightly grainy colours and blur form motion.  This is a nice story, very well done! edit - picking this as a top ten shot, good luck!', '2005-08-20 21:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627038, 217965, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s a fantastic effect.  It''s baffling how the dof gets the in focus drops as stop action and the out of focus drops as streaks... and the bokeh from I don''t know where.  Great job!<br/> <br/>edit - picking this as a top ten shot, good luck!</td>', 'Wow!  That''s a fantastic effect.  It''s baffling how the dof gets the in focus drops as stop action and the out of focus drops as streaks... and the bokeh from I don''t know where.  Great job! edit - picking this as a top ten shot, good luck!', '2005-08-20 21:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627041, 217450, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wonderful catch of a curtain of rain, congrats to you!  I think that section of white fence, combined with the rain make this shot outstanding.  The fence and the extremely flat, green horizon of the field give some order which contrasts the natural chaos of the rain curtain.  This is a marvelous shot.<br/> <br/>edit - picking this as a top ten finisheer, good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful catch of a curtain of rain, congrats to you!  I think that section of white fence, combined with the rain make this shot outstanding.  The fence and the extremely flat, green horizon of the field give some order which contrasts the natural chaos of the rain curtain.  This is a marvelous shot. edit - picking this as a top ten finisheer, good luck!', '2005-08-20 21:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627042, 215903, 35357, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  What a relief to come upon this shot after all the DNMC''s I just went through.  Fantastic, lovely, uplifting.  Slippy &amp; Ebert give this two thumbs up, WAY UP!  The sunbeams through the rain, the colour and geometry of the fields... [10]<br/> <br/>edit - picking this as a top ten finisher, good luck!</td>', 'Whoa!  What a relief to come upon this shot after all the DNMC''s I just went through.  Fantastic, lovely, uplifting.  Slippy & Ebert give this two thumbs up, WAY UP!  The sunbeams through the rain, the colour and geometry of the fields... [10] edit - picking this as a top ten finisher, good luck!', '2005-08-20 21:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627044, 217927, 35357, '<td valign="top">I avoid putting editing techniques in a title.  I like this shot a lot, it would make a great poster.  IMO, it''s very sellable, congrats on creating a great piece of art!<br/> <br/>edit - picking this as a top ten finisher, good luck!</td>', 'I avoid putting editing techniques in a title.  I like this shot a lot, it would make a great poster.  IMO, it''s very sellable, congrats on creating a great piece of art! edit - picking this as a top ten finisher, good luck!', '2005-08-20 21:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627050, 217968, 25150, '<td valign="top">i like it, but it seems a little over processed for my taste</td>', 'i like it, but it seems a little over processed for my taste', '2005-08-20 21:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627051, 216354, 25150, '<td valign="top">crisp &amp; clean, good stock</td>', 'crisp & clean, good stock', '2005-08-20 21:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627056, 215701, 25150, '<td valign="top">I have a pretty good idea of whose this is...<br/> <br/>maybe a little bit to contrasty, showing a bit hot on his left cheek, excellent shot though, def. one of my favorites.</td>', 'I have a pretty good idea of whose this is... maybe a little bit to contrasty, showing a bit hot on his left cheek, excellent shot though, def. one of my favorites.', '2005-08-20 21:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627059, 217534, 25150, '<td valign="top">seems a bit grainy, but i like it for this shot. bumped up</td>', 'seems a bit grainy, but i like it for this shot. bumped up', '2005-08-20 21:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627060, 216724, 25150, '<td valign="top">such a classic photo... IMO it''s sure to ribbon</td>', 'such a classic photo... IMO it''s sure to ribbon', '2005-08-20 21:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627068, 217481, 25150, '<td valign="top">very nice, I think it looks a bit over processed though... neat image?  seems plasticy (is that a word?) an excellent capture, and one of my favorites. I would like to see it grainy and gritty though, makes more sence in my mind.</td>', 'very nice, I think it looks a bit over processed though... neat image?  seems plasticy (is that a word?) an excellent capture, and one of my favorites. I would like to see it grainy and gritty though, makes more sence in my mind.', '2005-08-20 21:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627072, 217786, 25150, '<td valign="top">although I personally don''t really think this is a good rain shot (yeah, it has water) I still think it is beautiful, and you really did a terrific job with the colors and DOF. (the "moon" {lens flare} is distracting to me, and i think this would make a great print without it)</td>', 'although I personally don''t really think this is a good rain shot (yeah, it has water) I still think it is beautiful, and you really did a terrific job with the colors and DOF. (the "moon" {lens flare} is distracting to me, and i think this would make a great print without it)', '2005-08-20 21:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627075, 215552, 25150, '<td valign="top">I think its a bit to over processed (for my taste) and personally think it would benefit from some grittyness. It''s kind of a dark image, and I think if it felt "older" it would be more striking. excellent crop and composition, good use of selective sat.</td>', 'I think its a bit to over processed (for my taste) and personally think it would benefit from some grittyness. It''s kind of a dark image, and I think if it felt "older" it would be more striking. excellent crop and composition, good use of selective sat.', '2005-08-20 21:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627078, 218043, 25150, '<td valign="top">for some reason this image really hits me, and I really hope you do well. I like the slight green tint to the whole thing, and I also like the grain in the shadows. I don''t really care for the crop, but thats just my opinion. Bumped up.</td>', 'for some reason this image really hits me, and I really hope you do well. I like the slight green tint to the whole thing, and I also like the grain in the shadows. I don''t really care for the crop, but thats just my opinion. Bumped up.', '2005-08-20 22:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627079, 217482, 25150, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but the flowers just don''t really seem to be in sharp focus.</td>', 'I really like this, but the flowers just don''t really seem to be in sharp focus.', '2005-08-20 22:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627081, 217113, 25150, '<td valign="top">such a nice water drop shot, the blue is perfect, and the shape is one in a million. It''s nice, but it really isn''t "rain" to me. It''s a controlled water drop. Still, it''s done perfectly, and I can score you on that!</td>', 'such a nice water drop shot, the blue is perfect, and the shape is one in a million. It''s nice, but it really isn''t "rain" to me. It''s a controlled water drop. Still, it''s done perfectly, and I can score you on that!', '2005-08-20 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627082, 217983, 11923, '<td valign="top">Adorable model, and great contrastic colors, brings pop to the photo.  I wish the young girl''s eyes were a bit more in focus as there is quite a bit of personality and life there.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'Adorable model, and great contrastic colors, brings pop to the photo.  I wish the young girl''s eyes were a bit more in focus as there is quite a bit of personality and life there.  I gave a 5.', '2005-08-20 22:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627083, 216492, 11923, '<td valign="top">This certainly brings back memories!  I''d love to see one where the youngest girl (who seems to be a main focus because of her placement in the photograph) was looking up.  The focus seems to be a bit light but that''s probably the way the light is playing off all the water.  I gave a 4.</td>', 'This certainly brings back memories!  I''d love to see one where the youngest girl (who seems to be a main focus because of her placement in the photograph) was looking up.  The focus seems to be a bit light but that''s probably the way the light is playing off all the water.  I gave a 4.', '2005-08-20 22:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627085, 217482, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great composition, beautiful use of color and negative space.  Seems the focus could be just a smidge sharper - might be the water droplets making it seem slightly hazy though.  Very nicely done.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Great composition, beautiful use of color and negative space.  Seems the focus could be just a smidge sharper - might be the water droplets making it seem slightly hazy though.  Very nicely done.  I gave a 6', '2005-08-20 22:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627087, 216442, 11923, '<td valign="top">Cute model!  I love the expression on her face, she seems very impish.  Great tones, nice focus on the young girl.  There is a feeling of life and movement to the image with the way the water is dripping from her face.  Nicely done.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Cute model!  I love the expression on her face, she seems very impish.  Great tones, nice focus on the young girl.  There is a feeling of life and movement to the image with the way the water is dripping from her face.  Nicely done.  I gave a 6.', '2005-08-20 22:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627090, 217159, 11923, '<td valign="top">What a great idea!  I really like the focus on the reflection rather than including both the girl in reality and her reflection.  This keeps the composition much more simple and gives the eye a place to rest.  I''m guessing this is selective desaturation?  It seems just a tad washed out if that''s the case.  I like the lightness of it but something seems a bit too flat for my tastes, maybe if the dark areas were richer in their darkness, more contrast or something.  Not sure!  Either way I think its a great image.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'What a great idea!  I really like the focus on the reflection rather than including both the girl in reality and her reflection.  This keeps the composition much more simple and gives the eye a place to rest.  I''m guessing this is selective desaturation?  It seems just a tad washed out if that''s the case.  I like the lightness of it but something seems a bit too flat for my tastes, maybe if the dark areas were richer in their darkness, more contrast or something.  Not sure!  Either way I think its a great image.  I gave a 6.', '2005-08-20 22:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627092, 216530, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s some crazy rain.  It looks almost like a textured wall.  Very abstract feeling to that portion of the image.  I like the simplicity of the photograph, you''ve highlighted the rain very well, but I find myself straining just a bit to see some details of the "shelter".  There are portions where the light is being diffused by the leaves, which in turns gives more detail to said leaves - I really like that aspect.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Wow that''s some crazy rain.  It looks almost like a textured wall.  Very abstract feeling to that portion of the image.  I like the simplicity of the photograph, you''ve highlighted the rain very well, but I find myself straining just a bit to see some details of the "shelter".  There are portions where the light is being diffused by the leaves, which in turns gives more detail to said leaves - I really like that aspect.  I gave a 6', '2005-08-20 22:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627097, 217554, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I like the premise behind it but it has a flatness in color that is a bit offputting.  If there was a way to darken the water more so that shining droplet stood out even better, that contrast might add more pop to the photo.  Since the droplet IS the main and basically only area of focus for the photograph I feel it needs something more to give it a boost.  I gave a 4.</td>', 'Interesting image.  I like the premise behind it but it has a flatness in color that is a bit offputting.  If there was a way to darken the water more so that shining droplet stood out even better, that contrast might add more pop to the photo.  Since the droplet IS the main and basically only area of focus for the photograph I feel it needs something more to give it a boost.  I gave a 4.', '2005-08-20 22:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627102, 218032, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great colors and I can see it meets the challenge very well.  The focus seems a bit distracting for me though - it appears you want to highlight the droplets on the leaves but the soft focus on the trees in the background, as well as all the space they take up, are distracting my eyes away from the water drops.  I find the one big leaf with all the droplets to be a bit flat and uninspiring, however I LOVE the smaller leaf nearly hidden next to it.  The way the light filters through it really brings out the character and details of the leaf in an interesting way, I wish more of the photograph focused on that leaf.  All in all I think its a good photograph, it just doesn''t grab me as much as it could.  I gave a 4</td>', 'Great colors and I can see it meets the challenge very well.  The focus seems a bit distracting for me though - it appears you want to highlight the droplets on the leaves but the soft focus on the trees in the background, as well as all the space they take up, are distracting my eyes away from the water drops.  I find the one big leaf with all the droplets to be a bit flat and uninspiring, however I LOVE the smaller leaf nearly hidden next to it.  The way the light filters through it really brings out the character and details of the leaf in an interesting way, I wish more of the photograph focused on that leaf.  All in all I think its a good photograph, it just doesn''t grab me as much as it could.  I gave a 4', '2005-08-20 22:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627107, 217211, 11923, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous in its delicacy.  I am a clod at trying to photograph spiderwebs clearly so seeing one always knocks me out.  Focus is great, composition is wonderful.  The only thing I find distracting are the trees behind because of the way the light is filtering through them the web can get almost obscured or outdone.  If there was a way to get something darker behind the web while still using the light to pearlesce (is that a word??) off the raindrops, I think that would help the web pop out just a bit more and add loads of wow.  That said, this is still a fantastic image.  I gave a  6.</td>', 'Gorgeous in its delicacy.  I am a clod at trying to photograph spiderwebs clearly so seeing one always knocks me out.  Focus is great, composition is wonderful.  The only thing I find distracting are the trees behind because of the way the light is filtering through them the web can get almost obscured or outdone.  If there was a way to get something darker behind the web while still using the light to pearlesce (is that a word??) off the raindrops, I think that would help the web pop out just a bit more and add loads of wow.  That said, this is still a fantastic image.  I gave a  6.', '2005-08-20 22:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627108, 218038, 35602, '<td valign="top">A bit busy.  Too much in the picture.  Not sure where to look.</td>', 'A bit busy.  Too much in the picture.  Not sure where to look.', '2005-08-20 22:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627109, 217389, 32754, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition..light is good, dof excellent, as is detail in plant...but what impresses me most are the tones of image.</td>', 'Lovely composition..light is good, dof excellent, as is detail in plant...but what impresses me most are the tones of image.', '2005-08-20 22:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627112, 215630, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the black &amp; white and grit/noise this image has.  Its quite simple and yet has loads of interest.   If I were to pick something I might change I''d say cropping out the top portion with the lesser focus, I''m not sure it necessarily adds to the image all that much - maybe where that last biiig bubble is would be a good cut off point.  Still, I very much enjoy your take on the challenge, well done.  I gave a 7.</td>', 'I love the black & white and grit/noise this image has.  Its quite simple and yet has loads of interest.   If I were to pick something I might change I''d say cropping out the top portion with the lesser focus, I''m not sure it necessarily adds to the image all that much - maybe where that last biiig bubble is would be a good cut off point.  Still, I very much enjoy your take on the challenge, well done.  I gave a 7.', '2005-08-20 22:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627113, 217828, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fabulous color and the focus looks great to me too.  The texture of the fruit is great and the added dimension with the water droplets just boosts the interest level for me.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Fabulous color and the focus looks great to me too.  The texture of the fruit is great and the added dimension with the water droplets just boosts the interest level for me.  I gave a 6', '2005-08-20 22:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627114, 217878, 35602, '<td valign="top">How come there are no leaves on the trees?  Do you have serious problems with gypsy moth caterpillars?  Anyway, thought the shot was not all that interesting.</td>', 'How come there are no leaves on the trees?  Do you have serious problems with gypsy moth caterpillars?  Anyway, thought the shot was not all that interesting.', '2005-08-20 22:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627116, 217278, 32754, '<td valign="top">Lovely color and composition..soft and simple feel to this..nice work.</td>', 'Lovely color and composition..soft and simple feel to this..nice work.', '2005-08-20 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627117, 216045, 35602, '<td valign="top">Didnt think the image was aesthetically pleasing.  Good contrast in the umbrella, though.</td>', 'Didnt think the image was aesthetically pleasing.  Good contrast in the umbrella, though.', '2005-08-20 22:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627118, 216793, 32754, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of raindrops, also I like the position of flowers in this image; b&amp;w is also good in this case.</td>', 'Nice capture of raindrops, also I like the position of flowers in this image; b&w is also good in this case.', '2005-08-20 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627119, 216617, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like this scene but I wish the crop was higher from the bottom so that the scene wasn''t divided in two by the waterline.</td>', 'I like this scene but I wish the crop was higher from the bottom so that the scene wasn''t divided in two by the waterline.', '2005-08-20 22:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627121, 215961, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like the way you set up this picture..the position of model in frame is unusual and interesting.</td>', 'I like the way you set up this picture..the position of model in frame is unusual and interesting.', '2005-08-20 22:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627122, 216736, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think something was lost in converting it to black and white.  Image appears very grainy, though that could be from the rain falling.  It was a difficult lighting to capture a really contrasty image.</td>', 'I think something was lost in converting it to black and white.  Image appears very grainy, though that could be from the rain falling.  It was a difficult lighting to capture a really contrasty image.', '2005-08-20 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627124, 216492, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is so colorful and playful that it''s a joy to look at!  The expressions, the colors, the rain all combine to form one appealing image.</td>', 'This is so colorful and playful that it''s a joy to look at!  The expressions, the colors, the rain all combine to form one appealing image.', '2005-08-20 22:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627125, 217646, 35602, '<td valign="top">It is very out of focus.  Your composition is great, though.  You have leading lines in front of the child following her to the forest.  A higher shutter might have given this a more clean edge.</td>', 'It is very out of focus.  Your composition is great, though.  You have leading lines in front of the child following her to the forest.  A higher shutter might have given this a more clean edge.', '2005-08-20 22:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627128, 217764, 32754, '<td valign="top">Lovely color, lighting, composition and crystal-like reflections in background..good work.</td>', 'Lovely color, lighting, composition and crystal-like reflections in background..good work.', '2005-08-20 22:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627131, 217489, 32754, '<td valign="top">This simple composition has a lot of appeal..the water bouncing everywhere is great!  So is the lighting.</td>', 'This simple composition has a lot of appeal..the water bouncing everywhere is great!  So is the lighting.', '2005-08-20 22:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627145, 217653, 11923, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous color.  By itself it would be a lovely image, the droplets give an added area of interest.  Wonderful focus and great lighting.  I gave an 8</td>', 'Simply gorgeous color.  By itself it would be a lovely image, the droplets give an added area of interest.  Wonderful focus and great lighting.  I gave an 8', '2005-08-20 22:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627323, 217968, 449, '<td valign="top">Just started back up on dp, looking at past challenges and admiring many of the pics. I have noticed this style in several pics that have come to be my favorite. Just a guess...Heidia? Marvelous.I am guessing that alot of d and b went on to give this that mystical look. Love the purple/blue  clouds set off by the vibrant green grass. Picked back up in the stream reflection, but especially noticable in the jeans. great work.</td>', 'Just started back up on dp, looking at past challenges and admiring many of the pics. I have noticed this style in several pics that have come to be my favorite. Just a guess...Heidia? Marvelous.I am guessing that alot of d and b went on to give this that mystical look. Love the purple/blue  clouds set off by the vibrant green grass. Picked back up in the stream reflection, but especially noticable in the jeans. great work.', '2005-08-21 00:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627327, 216453, 449, '<td valign="top">great composition!!</td>', 'great composition!!', '2005-08-21 00:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627329, 217790, 10261, '<td valign="top">I see slightly blurry silhouettes and the sun in this image, but no rain. This picture would be much stronger if it had a clear subject and would better meet the challenge if there was moisture visible.</td>', 'I see slightly blurry silhouettes and the sun in this image, but no rain. This picture would be much stronger if it had a clear subject and would better meet the challenge if there was moisture visible.', '2005-08-21 00:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627364, 216104, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is very nice!  I would have liked to see this cropped a bit tighter on the bottom or maybe with a bit more sky at the top.  The fence is cutting the frame at a point too close to center, and the foreground information is overpowering the true shot which is the rolling hils, rain, and lighting.  This would have been really great if the angle had been where the fence wire began at the bottom right and came in diagonally.  What a wonderful capture though.</td>', 'This is very nice!  I would have liked to see this cropped a bit tighter on the bottom or maybe with a bit more sky at the top.  The fence is cutting the frame at a point too close to center, and the foreground information is overpowering the true shot which is the rolling hils, rain, and lighting.  This would have been really great if the angle had been where the fence wire began at the bottom right and came in diagonally.  What a wonderful capture though.', '2005-08-21 01:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627374, 216705, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been perfect as a close up on her face and the rainy window.  Her arms are exaggerated here.  They look too big for her body.</td>', 'I think this would have been perfect as a close up on her face and the rainy window.  Her arms are exaggerated here.  They look too big for her body.', '2005-08-21 01:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627443, 216050, 20889, '<td valign="top">Thats pretty cool looking, I never seen that before.</td>', 'Thats pretty cool looking, I never seen that before.', '2005-08-21 02:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627445, 217110, 20889, '<td valign="top">not much to look at but I do like the way it looks.</td>', 'not much to look at but I do like the way it looks.', '2005-08-21 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627450, 217215, 20889, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean shot, but I use to play the oppsites and never had much luck.</td>', 'Nice and clean shot, but I use to play the oppsites and never had much luck.', '2005-08-21 02:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627456, 217646, 38127, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this picture. Such a little person taking on the whole big world... its full of hope, promise, and confidence... Thanks for sharing it.</td>', 'Absolutely love this picture. Such a little person taking on the whole big world... its full of hope, promise, and confidence... Thanks for sharing it.', '2005-08-21 02:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627457, 217862, 20889, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see the rain till I moved right up on the picture. Maybe a little longer shutter and got it to steak a bit. I have found that a darker back ground shows rain more, just some thoughts.</td>', 'I didn''t see the rain till I moved right up on the picture. Maybe a little longer shutter and got it to steak a bit. I have found that a darker back ground shows rain more, just some thoughts.', '2005-08-21 02:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627459, 215552, 20889, '<td valign="top">like the feel and angle, but wheres the rain?</td>', 'like the feel and angle, but wheres the rain?', '2005-08-21 02:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627463, 217927, 20889, '<td valign="top">Only thing I don''t like is all the hot white other than that I think its great 8.</td>', 'Only thing I don''t like is all the hot white other than that I think its great 8.', '2005-08-21 02:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627480, 217880, 37893, '<td valign="top">great rain trails here and i like the anxious-feeling this image conveys :) 6</td>', 'great rain trails here and i like the anxious-feeling this image conveys :) 6', '2005-08-21 02:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627482, 217643, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think this image has too much noise... best run it through Neat image to rid of the noise... the way the image is cropped is somewhat ineffective IMHO... there are black areas to the right of the frame that could go away and the sign at the top is cut off... it ditracts from the image a bit... 5</td>', 'I think this image has too much noise... best run it through Neat image to rid of the noise... the way the image is cropped is somewhat ineffective IMHO... there are black areas to the right of the frame that could go away and the sign at the top is cut off... it ditracts from the image a bit... 5', '2005-08-21 02:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627484, 217402, 37893, '<td valign="top">this matches one of the other entries :) you guys should have a duet :) I like this image a lot... the strength of the web is shown and without hesitation... 6</td>', 'this matches one of the other entries :) you guys should have a duet :) I like this image a lot... the strength of the web is shown and without hesitation... 6', '2005-08-21 02:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627498, 217892, 37844, '<td valign="top">This photo was my favorite for this theme from start to finish. To me it said it all.  The fact that we''ve had a drought here in Kentucky for what seems like most of the summer may have influenced me a little but basically I saw myself in the child in this photo and it made me feel  like I did back then. Thank you.</td>', 'This photo was my favorite for this theme from start to finish. To me it said it all.  The fact that we''ve had a drought here in Kentucky for what seems like most of the summer may have influenced me a little but basically I saw myself in the child in this photo and it made me feel  like I did back then. Thank you.', '2005-08-21 02:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627539, 217539, 31133, '<td valign="top">I really like this on a technical level. In that way, it''s perfect. However, for me (and it might just be me :-), the nostrils and underside of the upper lip distracts me from an otherwise really nice image. I like the way the guy''s (you?) eyes show such ecstacy at the rain. I like blue color of the rain, and the skin tones are perfect.</td>', 'I really like this on a technical level. In that way, it''s perfect. However, for me (and it might just be me :-), the nostrils and underside of the upper lip distracts me from an otherwise really nice image. I like the way the guy''s (you?) eyes show such ecstacy at the rain. I like blue color of the rain, and the skin tones are perfect.', '2005-08-21 03:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627542, 218006, 31133, '<td valign="top">The raindrops are mostly sharp as tacks, and I like the message in this image. I''d like to see more focus on the hand, though. I like the framing done by the mirror, by the way. (except I might have made sure the frame also covered or touched the lower right corner). Your entry is very relevant to the challenge.</td>', 'The raindrops are mostly sharp as tacks, and I like the message in this image. I''d like to see more focus on the hand, though. I like the framing done by the mirror, by the way. (except I might have made sure the frame also covered or touched the lower right corner). Your entry is very relevant to the challenge.', '2005-08-21 04:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627544, 215363, 31133, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The subdued colors, the steeple in the lower right, annd the way the rain looks like rice all appeal to me very much. I''m looking forward to seeing the photo details after the challenge. Again, nice work!</td>', 'Very nice.  The subdued colors, the steeple in the lower right, annd the way the rain looks like rice all appeal to me very much. I''m looking forward to seeing the photo details after the challenge. Again, nice work!', '2005-08-21 04:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627550, 216644, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea and very well executed! Almost everything is perfect: Distractions for me include  the tag on the chair. the green tarp, and the hose. The compostion is great as it is, but would be stronger without those extra elements, I think.</td>', 'Beautiful idea and very well executed! Almost everything is perfect: Distractions for me include  the tag on the chair. the green tarp, and the hose. The compostion is great as it is, but would be stronger without those extra elements, I think.', '2005-08-21 04:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627552, 217702, 31133, '<td valign="top">Your focus is great here, but I think the flash is a little too strong.</td>', 'Your focus is great here, but I think the flash is a little too strong.', '2005-08-21 04:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627555, 216918, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite "through the window shots" in the entry. I wish the part at the bottom where the wiper doesn''t go were cropped, though. The white figure and red tail light really make this shot. Also, have you noticed that the drop at the top right rear of the car looks like a bird? Nice!</td>', 'This is one of my favorite "through the window shots" in the entry. I wish the part at the bottom where the wiper doesn''t go were cropped, though. The white figure and red tail light really make this shot. Also, have you noticed that the drop at the top right rear of the car looks like a bird? Nice!', '2005-08-21 04:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627556, 217909, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract! The rule of thirds is well used and Eyore is a great subject.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract! The rule of thirds is well used and Eyore is a great subject.', '2005-08-21 04:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627558, 218043, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ah, I wish I had just a fraction of the talent that is in this shot - composition, focus, color, mood, ... it''s very, very nice. Thanks for entering this.</td>', 'Ah, I wish I had just a fraction of the talent that is in this shot - composition, focus, color, mood, ... it''s very, very nice. Thanks for entering this.', '2005-08-21 04:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627563, 216838, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love the expressions here - the mood (especially on the little girl) is wonderful. For me, though, the boy should not be blurred - it''s a major distraction (for me). I like the colors and the reflection on the coffee pot. There''s one other, but more trivial input: The extra line of water confuses me ... might be an improvement if  the water were just coming out of the spout and nowhere else. Again, I really like the colors and also the background.</td>', 'I love the expressions here - the mood (especially on the little girl) is wonderful. For me, though, the boy should not be blurred - it''s a major distraction (for me). I like the colors and the reflection on the coffee pot. There''s one other, but more trivial input: The extra line of water confuses me ... might be an improvement if  the water were just coming out of the spout and nowhere else. Again, I really like the colors and also the background.', '2005-08-21 04:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627565, 217389, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. I like how the apples and not the rain are the subject, but the rain is still clearly visible.</td>', 'I like this a lot. I like how the apples and not the rain are the subject, but the rain is still clearly visible.', '2005-08-21 04:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627566, 216865, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like how the web and the spider take up the whole image - that all else is black. I wish spider didn''t have blown highlights and that the focus were a little sharper (like I should talk ;-).</td>', 'I like how the web and the spider take up the whole image - that all else is black. I wish spider didn''t have blown highlights and that the focus were a little sharper (like I should talk ;-).', '2005-08-21 04:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627570, 217252, 31133, '<td valign="top">The drop is very good, but I''d like to see the bottom brownish part cropped away. Other than that, I like this composition. Also, the reflection in the drop is pretty.</td>', 'The drop is very good, but I''d like to see the bottom brownish part cropped away. Other than that, I like this composition. Also, the reflection in the drop is pretty.', '2005-08-21 04:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627573, 217781, 31133, '<td valign="top">The sky is beautiful, but it competes with the leading lines of the road and the vertical line of the overpass and the tree on the right.</td>', 'The sky is beautiful, but it competes with the leading lines of the road and the vertical line of the overpass and the tree on the right.', '2005-08-21 04:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627575, 218038, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s easy to see that effort went into making this - the rubber ducky is a nice touch! The image has some problems for me, though: I wish the blue plastic thing weren''t there, the fence confuses me because I can''t figure out what that silver thing is at the left of it, and the baby in the foreground is overexposed.</td>', 'It''s easy to see that effort went into making this - the rubber ducky is a nice touch! The image has some problems for me, though: I wish the blue plastic thing weren''t there, the fence confuses me because I can''t figure out what that silver thing is at the left of it, and the baby in the foreground is overexposed.', '2005-08-21 04:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627583, 218034, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute, he''s still getting wet ma!</td>', 'cute, he''s still getting wet ma!', '2005-08-21 04:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627586, 216104, 22748, '<td valign="top">Really incredible capture. The lightning bolt is awesome, the composition with the fence is fabulous, but the thing that stands out almost more than that is the great contrast and tones in the image. Outstanding. Ansel would be proud.</td>', 'Really incredible capture. The lightning bolt is awesome, the composition with the fence is fabulous, but the thing that stands out almost more than that is the great contrast and tones in the image. Outstanding. Ansel would be proud.', '2005-08-21 04:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627588, 217047, 22748, '<td valign="top">I love the smoothness in this image. Great color, patterns in the water''s surface.</td>', 'I love the smoothness in this image. Great color, patterns in the water''s surface.', '2005-08-21 04:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627589, 218026, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great color and detail. The drops are very sharp and crisp.</td>', 'Great color and detail. The drops are very sharp and crisp.', '2005-08-21 04:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627590, 217534, 22748, '<td valign="top">VERY dramatic shot. I love the lines of the road, and the proportion of earth to sky seems perfect. The difference in color to gray is great too. Outstanding shot.</td>', 'VERY dramatic shot. I love the lines of the road, and the proportion of earth to sky seems perfect. The difference in color to gray is great too. Outstanding shot.', '2005-08-21 04:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627591, 215552, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great simple composition and pose. I love the color and slight desaturation, and how the blue is brought out. Great contrasty image.</td>', 'Great simple composition and pose. I love the color and slight desaturation, and how the blue is brought out. Great contrasty image.', '2005-08-21 04:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627595, 217875, 16241, '<td valign="top">yowee, cool, not really rain but i like it!</td>', 'yowee, cool, not really rain but i like it!', '2005-08-21 05:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627598, 217887, 16241, '<td valign="top">artistic</td>', 'artistic', '2005-08-21 05:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627600, 217892, 16241, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-08-21 05:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627669, 216910, 29490, '<td valign="top">Too oof for my tastes.  I do like the compositional aspect and the crop.  Good luck.</td>', 'Too oof for my tastes.  I do like the compositional aspect and the crop.  Good luck.', '2005-08-21 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627670, 217252, 41902, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Sharp, clean. I like the use of negative space.</td>', 'Excellent capture. Sharp, clean. I like the use of negative space.', '2005-08-21 08:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627671, 217758, 7304, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors and the rain drops have some cool reflections happening inside them. Clean. 8</td>', 'Vibrant colors and the rain drops have some cool reflections happening inside them. Clean. 8', '2005-08-21 08:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627672, 217389, 29490, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, the colors work very well together and the focus and dof are very good.  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice image, the colors work very well together and the focus and dof are very good.  Good job!', '2005-08-21 08:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627673, 217740, 7304, '<td valign="top">Like the rain on the back layer. The pink flowers are in focus and they look like paper.</td>', 'Like the rain on the back layer. The pink flowers are in focus and they look like paper.', '2005-08-21 08:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627675, 217450, 7304, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice in the white fence but it works well with the dark clouds. Love the rain falling in the background. 8</td>', 'Interesting choice in the white fence but it works well with the dark clouds. Love the rain falling in the background. 8', '2005-08-21 09:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627676, 216104, 7304, '<td valign="top">Very eerie shot with the barbed wire and the lightning. Nice composition and clarity. 8</td>', 'Very eerie shot with the barbed wire and the lightning. Nice composition and clarity. 8', '2005-08-21 09:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627677, 216920, 7304, '<td valign="top">Cute shot of mom and babies. They don''t mind. Nice capture of the rain on the water. 8</td>', 'Cute shot of mom and babies. They don''t mind. Nice capture of the rain on the water. 8', '2005-08-21 09:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627678, 217021, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the stop-action of the rain, well captured.  It looks like the focus is on the rain and not the girl, which imo works here.  I think a non-centered crop would make this photo pop.   Good luck</td>', 'I like the stop-action of the rain, well captured.  It looks like the focus is on the rain and not the girl, which imo works here.  I think a non-centered crop would make this photo pop.   Good luck', '2005-08-21 09:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627679, 217764, 7304, '<td valign="top">Like how the leaves dominate the picture with the one drop off the right leaf, The rain in the background adds as a balance to my eye. 8</td>', 'Like how the leaves dominate the picture with the one drop off the right leaf, The rain in the background adds as a balance to my eye. 8', '2005-08-21 09:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627680, 217971, 29490, '<td valign="top">Very tranquil and pleasing.  Excellent dof and focus. Good job and good luck.</td>', 'Very tranquil and pleasing.  Excellent dof and focus. Good job and good luck.', '2005-08-21 09:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627681, 216354, 7304, '<td valign="top">Crisp capture of the droplets on the umbrella. Nice transition between the black umbrella and the background.</td>', 'Crisp capture of the droplets on the umbrella. Nice transition between the black umbrella and the background.', '2005-08-21 09:04:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1627682, 217539, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and, focus, and dof.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice lighting and, focus, and dof.  Well done!', '2005-08-21 09:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627683, 217224, 7304, '<td valign="top">Almost looks surreal. Nice capture and clarity. The rain and the butterfly seem to fight for attention to my eye but otherwise well done. 8</td>', 'Almost looks surreal. Nice capture and clarity. The rain and the butterfly seem to fight for attention to my eye but otherwise well done. 8', '2005-08-21 09:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627684, 217140, 7304, '<td valign="top">Love the expressions. Nice clean capture.</td>', 'Love the expressions. Nice clean capture.', '2005-08-21 09:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627685, 217862, 7304, '<td valign="top">This shot looks sad. Nice shot though. Composition is good and it is clean.</td>', 'This shot looks sad. Nice shot though. Composition is good and it is clean.', '2005-08-21 09:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627687, 215778, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The droplets and the rolling water says it all. Fits nicely. 9</td>', 'Nice idea. The droplets and the rolling water says it all. Fits nicely. 9', '2005-08-21 09:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627688, 217533, 7304, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture of the waterdroplets. Just enough hint to make out a flower.</td>', 'Interesting capture of the waterdroplets. Just enough hint to make out a flower.', '2005-08-21 09:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627689, 216363, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Rain, lightning and clouds. Nice and clear. The lightning dominates the image but you can tell that the rain is falling.</td>', 'Nice image. Rain, lightning and clouds. Nice and clear. The lightning dominates the image but you can tell that the rain is falling.', '2005-08-21 09:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627690, 216833, 7304, '<td valign="top">If the droplets were just a bit more in focus it would be a better shot but I like the idea. Would make a good backdrop for advertising. 7</td>', 'If the droplets were just a bit more in focus it would be a better shot but I like the idea. Would make a good backdrop for advertising. 7', '2005-08-21 09:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627691, 217155, 7304, '<td valign="top">That''s an excellent capture of lightning and I know that with lightning comes rain but I don''t see it in this picture. 6</td>', 'That''s an excellent capture of lightning and I know that with lightning comes rain but I don''t see it in this picture. 6', '2005-08-21 09:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627692, 217889, 7304, '<td valign="top">Just a touch dark ut otherwise a nice capture of the flower and droplets of water.</td>', 'Just a touch dark ut otherwise a nice capture of the flower and droplets of water.', '2005-08-21 09:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627693, 217252, 7304, '<td valign="top">The wood is wet and that one drop adds to the composition nicely. Keep it simple. 7</td>', 'The wood is wet and that one drop adds to the composition nicely. Keep it simple. 7', '2005-08-21 09:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627694, 216389, 7304, '<td valign="top">About to splash? Interesting facial expression on the child. Fits well and pretty sharp.</td>', 'About to splash? Interesting facial expression on the child. Fits well and pretty sharp.', '2005-08-21 09:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627695, 217855, 7304, '<td valign="top">Funn after a rain it looks like. Nice capture of the water splashing and a fun shot. Love the expressions on their faces.</td>', 'Funn after a rain it looks like. Nice capture of the water splashing and a fun shot. Love the expressions on their faces.', '2005-08-21 09:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627697, 217892, 7304, '<td valign="top">Says it all on a hot day. Like the shot and the feeling it gives the viewer. 7</td>', 'Says it all on a hot day. Like the shot and the feeling it gives the viewer. 7', '2005-08-21 09:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627699, 216745, 7304, '<td valign="top">You got in close. Nice capture. Fits well. 7</td>', 'You got in close. Nice capture. Fits well. 7', '2005-08-21 09:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627700, 216952, 7304, '<td valign="top">Horse must have been wondering what you were doing. Just a bit dark. You can tell it rained and can see some small drops hit the water. Like the reflection.</td>', 'Horse must have been wondering what you were doing. Just a bit dark. You can tell it rained and can see some small drops hit the water. Like the reflection.', '2005-08-21 09:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627701, 218006, 7304, '<td valign="top">A different idea. Nice. The hand and water droplets fight for attention.</td>', 'A different idea. Nice. The hand and water droplets fight for attention.', '2005-08-21 09:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627710, 217215, 39007, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet challenge</td>', 'Doesn''t meet challenge', '2005-08-21 09:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627711, 217739, 35517, '<td valign="top">very very nice.. the slight colour of yellow here is gorgeous...</td>', 'very very nice.. the slight colour of yellow here is gorgeous...', '2005-08-21 09:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627748, 217790, 41701, '<td valign="top">Wow! Raining spaghetti?  :)</td>', 'Wow! Raining spaghetti?  :)', '2005-08-21 10:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627752, 217759, 41701, '<td valign="top">Needs depth of field and maybe a bit more of the background, but otherwise very nice.</td>', 'Needs depth of field and maybe a bit more of the background, but otherwise very nice.', '2005-08-21 10:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627756, 217310, 41701, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours, but I''m missing rain! :)</td>', 'Really nice colours, but I''m missing rain! :)', '2005-08-21 10:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627762, 216865, 41701, '<td valign="top">Needs to be a bit sharper..!  Could be very good.</td>', 'Needs to be a bit sharper..!  Could be very good.', '2005-08-21 10:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627766, 217482, 17837, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I''d like to see the flower in focus though. Good still capture of the rain.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I''d like to see the flower in focus though. Good still capture of the rain.', '2005-08-21 10:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
