(1627806, 217381, 17837, '<td valign="top">Im not even sure what this is. The flash has been overexposed in the water. I think the photo itself is very busy and detracts from the entire feel of it.</td>', 'Im not even sure what this is. The flash has been overexposed in the water. I think the photo itself is very busy and detracts from the entire feel of it.', '2005-08-21 11:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627810, 217786, 17837, '<td valign="top">a very nice capture. There are a few hotspots, and for that you will most likely be voted down. They are a tad distracting. I must commend you on the subject though, great composition!  Just have to learn to control that flash a little better =)</td>', 'a very nice capture. There are a few hotspots, and for that you will most likely be voted down. They are a tad distracting. I must commend you on the subject though, great composition!  Just have to learn to control that flash a little better =)', '2005-08-21 11:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
