(1627817, 217739, 17837, '<td valign="top">a great capture. I love the selective focus. Congrats on an awesome image. I might have cropped it a bit, thts the only thing I would change.</td>', 'a great capture. I love the selective focus. Congrats on an awesome image. I might have cropped it a bit, thts the only thing I would change.', '2005-08-21 11:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627820, 217646, 17837, '<td valign="top">a good attempt! glad to see some people arent afraid to get a little wet with their cameras. If this were my photo, I would change a few things. I would zoom in on the little girl, showing some of background and make it out of focus. I think it would make it a stronger image, plus add some interest. Good job regardless.</td>', 'a good attempt! glad to see some people arent afraid to get a little wet with their cameras. If this were my photo, I would change a few things. I would zoom in on the little girl, showing some of background and make it out of focus. I think it would make it a stronger image, plus add some interest. Good job regardless.', '2005-08-21 11:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627821, 217253, 17837, '<td valign="top">love the desaturated feel of this. Great job. My only problem with this is that I dont believe it to be an outdoor shot, when water is mixed with glycerine, it causes the water to ball up in droplets much like in your photo, so based on that I can only give you a 6 based on the topic at hand. if this were a free study, you''d get a 10</td>', 'love the desaturated feel of this. Great job. My only problem with this is that I dont believe it to be an outdoor shot, when water is mixed with glycerine, it causes the water to ball up in droplets much like in your photo, so based on that I can only give you a 6 based on the topic at hand. if this were a free study, you''d get a 10', '2005-08-21 11:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627822, 216329, 17837, '<td valign="top">a good attempt, though the girl should probably be stopped motion.</td>', 'a good attempt, though the girl should probably be stopped motion.', '2005-08-21 11:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627827, 215701, 17837, '<td valign="top">a wonderful image, probably going to ribbon. Good capture of water, and the facial expression just screams RAIN.</td>', 'a wonderful image, probably going to ribbon. Good capture of water, and the facial expression just screams RAIN.', '2005-08-21 11:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
