(1627838, 216920, 17837, '<td valign="top">very cool, the white on the mother is a tad over exposed. When photographing pure white objects, IE snow, swans, etc... always over expose about 2/3 of a stop. I like the water, good job.</td>', 'very cool, the white on the mother is a tad over exposed. When photographing pure white objects, IE snow, swans, etc... always over expose about 2/3 of a stop. I like the water, good job.', '2005-08-21 11:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
