(1630198, 217786, 7531, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all the wonderful comments. This was a bit of a fluke shot. Some guy had just watered the garden of the hotel I was staying in. The original was naturally green, and the moon, as was pointed out, was lens flare, but hey if you can put it to use...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-24 01:35:32.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all the wonderful comments. This was a bit of a fluke shot. Some guy had just watered the garden of the hotel I was staying in. The original was naturally green, and the moon, as was pointed out, was lens flare, but hey if you can put it to use...', '2005-08-22 03:01:28.000000', '2005-08-24 02:35:32.000000', 0),
