(1630219, 217554, 37844, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe people are objecting to the grainy quality. That''s what draws me to this photo, it appears like some kind of denium, dark bluejean material and makes the photo far more interesting than if it was a drop in smooth brightly lit water, bet you can find hundreds of photos like that. I gave it a ten.</td>', 'I can''t believe people are objecting to the grainy quality. That''s what draws me to this photo, it appears like some kind of denium, dark bluejean material and makes the photo far more interesting than if it was a drop in smooth brightly lit water, bet you can find hundreds of photos like that. I gave it a ten.', '2005-08-22 03:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
