(1630288, 217323, 37844, '<td valign="top">I just saw a photo in Popular Photography magazine(last year issue) that was similar to yours. It won one of their contests. What made it interesing was that it each drop had the reflection of a piece of a yellow taxi in it and the background looked like a blur of the taxi''s window. It was titled Taxi drop-off. It reminded me of your photo so much I had to come back and double check to see if they were the same. I am telling you about this for future reference, because you are obviously on the right track if a photo so similar to yours won a contest in a very popular photographic magazine. Just keep trying, we''re all here to learn something new.</td>', 'I just saw a photo in Popular Photography magazine(last year issue) that was similar to yours. It won one of their contests. What made it interesing was that it each drop had the reflection of a piece of a yellow taxi in it and the background looked like a blur of the taxi''s window. It was titled Taxi drop-off. It reminded me of your photo so much I had to come back and double check to see if they were the same. I am telling you about this for future reference, because you are obviously on the right track if a photo so similar to yours won a contest in a very popular photographic magazine. Just keep trying, we''re all here to learn something new.', '2005-08-22 03:24:49.000000', NULL, 0),
