(1630293, 217481, 93, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by annah:</b></div><hr/><i> tho, i see no real connection with rain besides his hand position, it is still a nicely done image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The fact that his hand position can speak and say, "ahh, he''s feeling for rain", make this photo as strong, IMO, as any photo where you can see rain or raindrops. Also. the ground is wet :)</td>', 'Originally posted by annah: tho, i see no real connection with rain besides his hand position, it is still a nicely done image.   The fact that his hand position can speak and say, "ahh, he''s feeling for rain", make this photo as strong, IMO, as any photo where you can see rain or raindrops. Also. the ground is wet :)', '2005-08-22 03:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
