(1630374, 216903, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jmlelii:</b></div><hr/><i> Theres just too much confusion here in this photo. The flash against the glass also distracts. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No flash, no glass -- just OOF shot of flowers being watered, with bright overhead sunlight.<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Chez:</b></div><hr/><i> Good Abstract, flowers? Certainly gives an overall quality of rain, almost looks like a Monet painting </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks, that was the effect I saw in this too -- I''ve never really done it before without using a filter, but this one is basically straight out of the camera. With this particular subject, I liked the OOF effect.</td>', 'Originally posted by jmlelii: Theres just too much confusion here in this photo. The flash against the glass also distracts.  No flash, no glass -- just OOF shot of flowers being watered, with bright overhead sunlight.Originally posted by Chez: Good Abstract, flowers? Certainly gives an overall quality of rain, almost looks like a Monet painting  Thanks, that was the effect I saw in this too -- I''ve never really done it before without using a filter, but this one is basically straight out of the camera. With this particular subject, I liked the OOF effect.', '2005-08-22 03:45:45.000000', NULL, 0),
