(1630904, 217927, 25140, '<td valign="top">This should have scored much higher!  Is so original unlike most of the others.</td>', 'This should have scored much higher!  Is so original unlike most of the others.', '2005-08-22 10:30:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1630965, 217534, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wow, thanks for the comments and votes! There are a lot of very strong images in this challenge; I''m quite surprised at this result.<br/> <br/>Some had questioned whether I was going through this storm--the fact is, I had just barely come through it. Luckily, we were behind a large truck for the rain was amazing and coming down by the bucket load. We really couldn''t see a thing and had considered stopping. But just as we (my wife and I) were about to pull over, it stopped very suddenly. We went a bit further and I stopped to get the photo. I do wish I were just a few feet to the right--but was afraid of traffic behind me.<br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', 'Wow, thanks for the comments and votes! There are a lot of very strong images in this challenge; I''m quite surprised at this result. Some had questioned whether I was going through this storm--the fact is, I had just barely come through it. Luckily, we were behind a large truck for the rain was amazing and coming down by the bucket load. We really couldn''t see a thing and had considered stopping. But just as we (my wife and I) were about to pull over, it stopped very suddenly. We went a bit further and I stopped to get the photo. I do wish I were just a few feet to the right--but was afraid of traffic behind me. Thanks again!', '2005-08-22 10:54:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1630986, 216104, 714, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys! If only you could see my smile. :-))</td>', 'Thanks guys! If only you could see my smile. :-))', '2005-08-22 11:01:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1630999, 217921, 32767, '<td valign="top">The comments are very funny. I stayed away from saying anything because the image made me cringe. Totally grossed me out. Way too Village People as stated many times but I am starting to warm up to the humor now that I know it was a joke.<br/> <br/>It''s a Classic.</td>', 'The comments are very funny. I stayed away from saying anything because the image made me cringe. Totally grossed me out. Way too Village People as stated many times but I am starting to warm up to the humor now that I know it was a joke. It''s a Classic.', '2005-08-22 11:03:59.000000', NULL, 0),
