(1631243, 216865, 31738, '<td valign="top">Ant, I feel that it''s way too overexposed and I would of liked to see more detail of the spider web itself; like water droplets dripping off the web being that it is a "rain challenge". It looks like the picture came out too dark to begin with and you edited the picture to brighten it up. You''re starting to lose your touch with long exposure shots. What''s wrong with you? I thought that was your specialty. LOL.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-22 11:38:14.</i></td>', 'Ant, I feel that it''s way too overexposed and I would of liked to see more detail of the spider web itself; like water droplets dripping off the web being that it is a "rain challenge". It looks like the picture came out too dark to begin with and you edited the picture to brighten it up. You''re starting to lose your touch with long exposure shots. What''s wrong with you? I thought that was your specialty. LOL.', '2005-08-22 12:35:30.000000', '2005-08-22 12:38:14.000000', 0),
(1631329, 216104, 6845, '<td valign="top">Copy cat! =P Nah, just kidding. The better image obviously won here. Great job!</td>', 'Copy cat! =P Nah, just kidding. The better image obviously won here. Great job!', '2005-08-22 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
