(1631665, 217534, 3575, '<td valign="top">Ahh, I miss Utah :) This is an incredible shot, David! I can''t believe you got this great shot with all the traffic and there''s not a car in your photo! I''ll be back there in October and hope to get some beautiful shots myself. Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'Ahh, I miss Utah :) This is an incredible shot, David! I can''t believe you got this great shot with all the traffic and there''s not a car in your photo! I''ll be back there in October and hope to get some beautiful shots myself. Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2005-08-22 14:24:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1631759, 217892, 24454, '<td valign="top">You did SO GOOD!!!   This was a favorite-of-all-time type of picture!  Congratulations on such a great finish!<br/> <br/></td>', 'You did SO GOOD!!!   This was a favorite-of-all-time type of picture!  Congratulations on such a great finish! ', '2005-08-22 14:55:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1631762, 217786, 24454, '<td valign="top">This was also one my favorites in this challenge!!   Congratulations!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This was also one my favorites in this challenge!!   Congratulations!!! ', '2005-08-22 14:57:40.000000', NULL, 0),
