(1631826, 216644, 30861, '<td valign="top">That screen is Karma''s version of a doggie door. She created it all by herself. Anomalies in the way this house is oriented/built don''t allow the placement of a "regular" doggie door; the only place one might easily exist is right where the sliding glass door is. I''m not gonna bother replacing the screen until winter, because as long as I leave this glass door open she''s gonna bust out the screen anyway. I''ll need to get a carpenter and an electrician in to create a proper doggie door for her, sigh.</td>', 'That screen is Karma''s version of a doggie door. She created it all by herself. Anomalies in the way this house is oriented/built don''t allow the placement of a "regular" doggie door; the only place one might easily exist is right where the sliding glass door is. I''m not gonna bother replacing the screen until winter, because as long as I leave this glass door open she''s gonna bust out the screen anyway. I''ll need to get a carpenter and an electrician in to create a proper doggie door for her, sigh.', '2005-08-22 15:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1631852, 217921, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just got through reading the comments and I''m laughing even harder than the first time I saw it.  I literally am crying at what people said.  For the rest of the day, I''ll have his s-eaten grin and hairy arms etched in my brain.<br/> <br/>I can''t stop laughing. :&gt; O  ha ha ha ha ha ha<br/> <br/>Thanks again for making my day.</td>', 'I just got through reading the comments and I''m laughing even harder than the first time I saw it.  I literally am crying at what people said.  For the rest of the day, I''ll have his s-eaten grin and hairy arms etched in my brain. I can''t stop laughing. :> O  ha ha ha ha ha ha Thanks again for making my day.', '2005-08-22 15:25:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1631903, 217766, 41098, '<td valign="top">I like this unique view of the flamingos. Its a great new angle to see this beautiful bird.</td>', 'I like this unique view of the flamingos. Its a great new angle to see this beautiful bird.', '2005-08-22 15:35:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1631963, 217766, 14986, '<td valign="top">The pinks just look awesome against the dark water.  The unique vantage point gives this lots of interest and the focus and exposure are very good IMO. I wish it somehow wasn''t quite as centered, but then again I''m not sure if changing that would make the angle less appealing. (?)  Anyway...one of my favorites in your portfolio.</td>', 'The pinks just look awesome against the dark water.  The unique vantage point gives this lots of interest and the focus and exposure are very good IMO. I wish it somehow wasn''t quite as centered, but then again I''m not sure if changing that would make the angle less appealing. (?)  Anyway...one of my favorites in your portfolio.', '2005-08-22 15:45:07.000000', NULL, 0),
