(1643407, 217973, 37673, '<td valign="top">Though you can tell it wasn''t an out door shot I was still so impressed with it I didn''t really mind. Everything here seems to be very pleasing. DOF was nicely done and doesn''t pick up anything distracting in the rear. Focus is fantastic VERY detailed. The colors are smooth and soft. The lighting is perfect and thats what gives away the indoor shot. I was very impressed with the artisitic approach you show here. Although it might fall short of the challenge I am still impressed with the shot. Very nice work. Two (green) thumbs up.</td>', 'Though you can tell it wasn''t an out door shot I was still so impressed with it I didn''t really mind. Everything here seems to be very pleasing. DOF was nicely done and doesn''t pick up anything distracting in the rear. Focus is fantastic VERY detailed. The colors are smooth and soft. The lighting is perfect and thats what gives away the indoor shot. I was very impressed with the artisitic approach you show here. Although it might fall short of the challenge I am still impressed with the shot. Very nice work. Two (green) thumbs up.', '2005-08-25 02:26:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1643421, 217333, 37673, '<td valign="top">Well I always say "photography is 30% skill and 70% luck" this situation just cements my theory. The picture is nicely done. I wouldn''t have admitted to the rush shot though. It could have been a shot that was very well thought out. Too bad there.  Focus seems to be done well. It captures the detail in the rain well and the DOF fades off nicely. The color is pretty cool. Not sure where it was cast from but it looks great. Lighting could have been a bit better but obviously you had no control there. Everything else just falls into place.  Congrats on a very "Lucky" shot.</td>', 'Well I always say "photography is 30% skill and 70% luck" this situation just cements my theory. The picture is nicely done. I wouldn''t have admitted to the rush shot though. It could have been a shot that was very well thought out. Too bad there.  Focus seems to be done well. It captures the detail in the rain well and the DOF fades off nicely. The color is pretty cool. Not sure where it was cast from but it looks great. Lighting could have been a bit better but obviously you had no control there. Everything else just falls into place.  Congrats on a very "Lucky" shot.', '2005-08-25 02:31:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1644764, 216644, 17507, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see this one in the challenge, but I''m glad I''ve stumbled across it. Truly this is an underrated image, apparently a victim of the "hit 5 and keep going" voting style. This image has a subtlety to it that''s lost on all those who just want visual fireworks. It''s a shame that such intelligent imagery as this frequently gets passed over.</td>', 'I didn''t see this one in the challenge, but I''m glad I''ve stumbled across it. Truly this is an underrated image, apparently a victim of the "hit 5 and keep going" voting style. This image has a subtlety to it that''s lost on all those who just want visual fireworks. It''s a shame that such intelligent imagery as this frequently gets passed over.', '2005-08-25 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
