(1648840, 217894, 1827, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy feeling.  I really like the photo''s tonality too.</td>', 'Very dreamy feeling.  I really like the photo''s tonality too.', '2005-08-27 00:48:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1649255, 216705, 37608, '<td valign="top">:: Critique Club ::<br/> <br/> I like the softness in this photo it works well with the subject, her expression is priceless for this moment. The light is good it cast nice soft dramatic shadows on her face. The muted colors work great too, now with that being said.<br/> <br/> Her arms are distracting from her face and look too big for her. Along with the shadows under them are extremely harsh. The highlights really hurt here as well; they take away from the somber mood.<br/> <br/> Over all I would say this is a just above average photo, around a 6 or 7.  You can tell you put thought into it and that is great. Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>                                              Nick<br/></td>', ':: Critique Club ::  I like the softness in this photo it works well with the subject, her expression is priceless for this moment. The light is good it cast nice soft dramatic shadows on her face. The muted colors work great too, now with that being said.  Her arms are distracting from her face and look too big for her. Along with the shadows under them are extremely harsh. The highlights really hurt here as well; they take away from the somber mood.  Over all I would say this is a just above average photo, around a 6 or 7.  You can tell you put thought into it and that is great. Keep up the good work.                                               Nick', '2005-08-27 05:33:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1649855, 216839, 42826, '<td valign="top">That''s amazing!  It''s quite difficult to capture lightining</td>', 'That''s amazing!  It''s quite difficult to capture lightining', '2005-08-27 14:25:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1649861, 217968, 42826, '<td valign="top">The coloring in this photo is great.  The clouds are intense!</td>', 'The coloring in this photo is great.  The clouds are intense!', '2005-08-27 14:27:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1649988, 216705, 10985, '<td valign="top">Well done! Very nice softness. It fits the theme. I love how the backlit rain in the windows. The arms don''t bother me, except for maybe being a little too bright in the lit areas.</td>', 'Well done! Very nice softness. It fits the theme. I love how the backlit rain in the windows. The arms don''t bother me, except for maybe being a little too bright in the lit areas.', '2005-08-27 15:47:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1650206, 216104, 6306, '<td valign="top">SOME burning and dodging?</td>', 'SOME burning and dodging?', '2005-08-27 18:02:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1650464, 215630, 4207, '<td valign="top">Heidi ho from the CC. <br/> <br/>You say this image is Cliché, I don''t think so. It''s a great take on water drops. Now, if you had that water tesselating some image in the background, that would indeed be Cliché. <br/> <br/>This image feels a bit gritty for my taste. The drop in mid background are what makes me feel this way. They look processed beyond normal which takes away from the overall tone of the image. Otherwise i think you did a nice job. You have a clear foreground, middle ground and background and the composition is quite nice too. Yay for you.<br/> <br/>I reccomend going a little easier on the post processing if that''s not the look you''re going for. <br/> <br/>Keep it up. <br/>aj</td>', 'Heidi ho from the CC.  You say this image is Cliché, I don''t think so. It''s a great take on water drops. Now, if you had that water tesselating some image in the background, that would indeed be Cliché.  This image feels a bit gritty for my taste. The drop in mid background are what makes me feel this way. They look processed beyond normal which takes away from the overall tone of the image. Otherwise i think you did a nice job. You have a clear foreground, middle ground and background and the composition is quite nice too. Yay for you. I reccomend going a little easier on the post processing if that''s not the look you''re going for.  Keep it up. aj', '2005-08-27 20:20:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1650585, 215961, 25397, '<td valign="top">gave it a 10 hun</td>', 'gave it a 10 hun', '2005-08-27 21:15:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1650725, 217433, 37252, '<td valign="top">** Greetings from the Critique Club **<br/> <br/>Good DOF and focus. Exposure levels seem to be right on. Not sure about the selective desat - I would like to see what the original had to offer. The angle the flower was shot at is a bit awkward to the eye. <br/>Perhaps if you had been at a lower level with the flower?<br/> <br/>- Linda</td>', '** Greetings from the Critique Club ** Good DOF and focus. Exposure levels seem to be right on. Not sure about the selective desat - I would like to see what the original had to offer. The angle the flower was shot at is a bit awkward to the eye. Perhaps if you had been at a lower level with the flower? - Linda', '2005-08-27 22:38:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1650731, 216764, 37252, '<td valign="top">** Greetings from the Critique Club **<br/> <br/>Good DOF and focus. Exposure levels seem to be right on. I really like the "stormy feeling" that the black-on-black creates, but the expression on the models face just does not convey the same feeling.<br/>The composition would have been perfect had the fingers not been cropped off. Still, a really nice shot!<br/> <br/>- Linda</td>', '** Greetings from the Critique Club ** Good DOF and focus. Exposure levels seem to be right on. I really like the "stormy feeling" that the black-on-black creates, but the expression on the models face just does not convey the same feeling.The composition would have been perfect had the fingers not been cropped off. Still, a really nice shot! - Linda', '2005-08-27 22:44:14.000000', NULL, 0),
