(1706164, 217047, 37276, '<td valign="top">Darn it - if I''d known this was yours I''d have given you a 4... I doubled it for you though. It was a nice rain shot. I must have had pitty for you. :) Great shot in all seriousness - I don''t hand out that many 8''s.</td>', 'Darn it - if I''d known this was yours I''d have given you a 4... I doubled it for you though. It was a nice rain shot. I must have had pitty for you. :) Great shot in all seriousness - I don''t hand out that many 8''s.', '2005-09-14 00:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1710543, 216389, 41183, '<td valign="top">GOD bless ur brother. niceeeeeee pic and color</td>', 'GOD bless ur brother. niceeeeeee pic and color', '2005-09-15 01:58:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1710596, 217921, 35786, '<td valign="top">I love this one, it makes me laugh everytime I see it!<br/> <br/>PS... damn have you ever marked a comment as helpful??? :oP<br/> <br/>needed a laugh today!... &amp; I take it back :0)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 16:09:07.</i></td>', 'I love this one, it makes me laugh everytime I see it! PS... damn have you ever marked a comment as helpful??? :oP needed a laugh today!... & I take it back :0)', '2005-09-15 02:35:01.000000', '2006-02-08 16:09:07.000000', 0),
(1713907, 217159, 12448, '<td valign="top">Looking at the montage you posted, if you had used the red version, oversaturated or not, I bet you would have had a top 10 finish!  I love this shot but the muted colors probably hurt it in the overall scores.  But a great capture and I''m glad to see I''m not the only mom who lets her kids play in puddles, did you teach her how to do it properly like I had to teach my oldest? :)<br/> <br/>Great shot</td>', 'Looking at the montage you posted, if you had used the red version, oversaturated or not, I bet you would have had a top 10 finish!  I love this shot but the muted colors probably hurt it in the overall scores.  But a great capture and I''m glad to see I''m not the only mom who lets her kids play in puddles, did you teach her how to do it properly like I had to teach my oldest? :) Great shot', '2005-09-16 11:57:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1722120, 216705, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wow --- the softness really makes this image. I feel the only thing that really detracts from it is the face seems a little bit over-dodged making it cloudy and just too soft there.</td>', 'Wow --- the softness really makes this image. I feel the only thing that really detracts from it is the face seems a little bit over-dodged making it cloudy and just too soft there.', '2005-09-19 20:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1728604, 216479, 35517, '<td valign="top">i just LOVED this one... such a perfect shot all round, it is such a shame so many on this site don''t see the ''real art''.... perfect rennie, and one of my fav''s....</td>', 'i just LOVED this one... such a perfect shot all round, it is such a shame so many on this site don''t see the ''real art''.... perfect rennie, and one of my fav''s....', '2005-09-21 20:48:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1736236, 217894, 27812, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10, still think it is the best artistic rain shot I have ever seen.</td>', 'I gave this a 10, still think it is the best artistic rain shot I have ever seen.', '2005-09-24 20:21:07.000000', NULL, 0),
