(1740668, 218050, 38127, '<td valign="top">ahh for the love of art!!!!  Thats a great story. I was waiting for you to say that after all that work.. it started pouring out ;) LOL... I love the shot and it does look like rain to me.  :)</td>', 'ahh for the love of art!!!!  Thats a great story. I was waiting for you to say that after all that work.. it started pouring out ;) LOL... I love the shot and it does look like rain to me.  :)', '2005-09-26 20:59:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1746640, 216766, 41522, '<td valign="top">Tina, Congrats on the nice high placement of this wonderful photo.  I think this might be my favourite all time photo of yours!!!  Excellent composition and nice "capture" of the weather.  Congrats!</td>', 'Tina, Congrats on the nice high placement of this wonderful photo.  I think this might be my favourite all time photo of yours!!!  Excellent composition and nice "capture" of the weather.  Congrats!', '2005-09-28 21:02:22.000000', NULL, 0),
