(1866135, 218034, 31606, '<td valign="top">I love the angle on this.  You have done an excellent job on this all the way around.  Don''t beat yourself up about the green I think it looks wonderful.</td>', 'I love the angle on this.  You have done an excellent job on this all the way around.  Don''t beat yourself up about the green I think it looks wonderful.', '2005-11-14 18:42:17.000000', NULL, 0),
