(1895603, 215241, 21072, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the lighting in the valley is really nice and the colours are good.</td>', 'Great shot, the lighting in the valley is really nice and the colours are good.', '2005-11-24 16:58:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1912734, 217892, 42328, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture.  :)</td>', 'Wonderful capture.  :)', '2005-12-01 13:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1933592, 217155, 23226, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2005-12-07 20:54:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1934569, 217894, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this before on a few visits to Universal Studios - but never in the way you have captured and processed it here.  Wow... I LOVE this shot and added it to my favorites.  ¡Simplemente Fantástico!</td>', 'I''ve seen this before on a few visits to Universal Studios - but never in the way you have captured and processed it here.  Wow... I LOVE this shot and added it to my favorites.  ¡Simplemente Fantástico!', '2005-12-08 09:20:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1934869, 217983, 42328, '<td valign="top">Aww, she''s adorable!  I really like her expression.  Colors are great, too. ;)</td>', 'Aww, she''s adorable!  I really like her expression.  Colors are great, too. ;)', '2005-12-08 11:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1954500, 218050, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great shot and set-up story. A fascinating capture!</td>', 'Great shot and set-up story. A fascinating capture!', '2005-12-15 16:36:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1970199, 217894, 39558, '<td valign="top">Great Photo!!! It''s beautiful Art !!!</td>', 'Great Photo!!! It''s beautiful Art !!!', '2005-12-22 01:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1970686, 217894, 14614, '<td valign="top">Missed this one in the challenge.  Like your use of filters to enhance the feel and the tint.  Cropping out the tree bits at the top would cut out some of the interesting roof but the trees detract from the image in a small way.  As presented -- great work</td>', 'Missed this one in the challenge.  Like your use of filters to enhance the feel and the tint.  Cropping out the tree bits at the top would cut out some of the interesting roof but the trees detract from the image in a small way.  As presented -- great work', '2005-12-22 08:04:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1979085, 218050, 37961, '<td valign="top">Wow, you went through a lot of effort for this picture. I don''t think the sun shining dimenished anything. I''ve often seen it rain while the sun is shining, particularly when I lived in Florida. The muscles were an extra nice touch, and I''m thinking its what made this photo have the impact that it does. I doub''t I would have ever questioned that was rain had you not said so. Great work JP.</td>', 'Wow, you went through a lot of effort for this picture. I don''t think the sun shining dimenished anything. I''ve often seen it rain while the sun is shining, particularly when I lived in Florida. The muscles were an extra nice touch, and I''m thinking its what made this photo have the impact that it does. I doub''t I would have ever questioned that was rain had you not said so. Great work JP.', '2005-12-26 15:12:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1991270, 216389, 48928, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, if I was reigstered at the time of voting would have been a 9 or 10 from me  :)</td>', 'I really like this picture, if I was reigstered at the time of voting would have been a 9 or 10 from me  :)', '2005-12-31 21:11:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1992673, 218105, 34659, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept and setup here - the rubber duck was a great touch!  I think that the image seems a bit washed out though (pun intended).  I would probably try to burn the reflection to deepen the color tones and shadows.  If you reduced the overall lighting (PP), I think you could really improve the image''s impact.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I really like the concept and setup here - the rubber duck was a great touch!  I think that the image seems a bit washed out though (pun intended).  I would probably try to burn the reflection to deepen the color tones and shadows.  If you reduced the overall lighting (PP), I think you could really improve the image''s impact.  Nice shot.', '2006-01-01 15:59:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1999045, 217894, 34013, '<td valign="top">love this shot...turned out very nice!</td>', 'love this shot...turned out very nice!', '2006-01-03 17:07:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2009154, 218050, 37252, '<td valign="top">I just realized I never left you a comment on this excellent shot - gave it a 9 back when  we voted. Knowing now all the hassle it was for you to capture this, I''d have given you a 10. Perseverance sure pays off.</td>', 'I just realized I never left you a comment on this excellent shot - gave it a 9 back when  we voted. Knowing now all the hassle it was for you to capture this, I''d have given you a 10. Perseverance sure pays off.', '2006-01-06 02:26:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2032063, 216644, 16241, '<td valign="top">very nice, i like it a lot!</td>', 'very nice, i like it a lot!', '2006-01-13 01:48:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2068800, 218050, 42792, '<td valign="top">Impressive set-up and a really great shot.  Very inspiring.  Sure fooled me!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-21 19:54:45.</i></td>', 'Impressive set-up and a really great shot.  Very inspiring.  Sure fooled me!', '2006-01-21 19:54:10.000000', '2006-01-21 19:54:45.000000', 0),
(2112072, 217892, 50466, '<td valign="top">very good composition and lighting. i like your decision to go with black and white since it was raining and the color probably wasn''t ideal. i like the black border but there seems to be a bit of white in each corner...i think it would be better without that. overall very well done</td>', 'very good composition and lighting. i like your decision to go with black and white since it was raining and the color probably wasn''t ideal. i like the black border but there seems to be a bit of white in each corner...i think it would be better without that. overall very well done', '2006-02-01 19:42:25.000000', NULL, 0),
